{"parentUuid":"2bd62acb-9d7d-431d-97d8-c2406bb8277d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/MutexReal/FinalCorollaries.lean","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/MutexReal/FinalCorollaries.lean","content":"import Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.Final\nimport Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.Bridge\n\n/-!\n# No silent change under the final wording\n\nBrief of milestone 4, slice 2, layer R, final pass, task 6 (`corpus-spec2-m3.md` v12 §2 undecies:\n\"L'amendement ne change ni l'effet abstrait de `newMutex`, ni l'état d'initialisation d'aucune\nfeuille (C13.10), ni le graphe du contrôleur\"):\n\n* the amended `newMutex` has the effect of `NewMutexOk` and keeps the initialization state of\n  every leaf (`newMutexAm_effect`, `newMutexAm_same_effect`);\n* the controller graph (`ctlGraph`) reads only the labels, never the states, so a final amended\n  execution has the graph of its labels; its initial write, event `0`, is a non-atomic\n  modification writing `0` and the source of no `sw` edge (`ctlGraph_init_write`);\n* the invariant, the coherence and the bridge of layer R apply as they are to a final amended\n  execution (`runAmF_ctl_invariant`, `runAmF_coherent`, `runAmF_bridge`, `runAmF_bridge_sw`,\n  `runAmF_bridge_sw_ref`, `runAmF_bridge_converse`): corollaries, not new proofs.\n-/\n\nset_option autoImplicit false\n\nnamespace Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal\n\nopen Ern.MemoryModel.Access Ern.Concurrency\n\n/-! ## The effect of `newMutex` -/\n\n/-- Brief, final pass, task 6 (proposed C13, \"Clarification to the Effect\": the abstract\nregistration effect is unchanged and no structural leaf of `M` changes its initialization state):\nan amended `newMutex` that is `ok` appends `⟨guarded, none⟩` to the registry, leaves the kernel\nstate unchanged, so the initialization state of every leaf, and the leaves of `M` are `Init` before\nand after (WC5.1 corrigé C13.10). -/\ntheorem newMutexAm_effect {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {ar : ArenaReg} {s : SC} {reg : SyncReg}\n    {c g : Nat} {st' : SC × SyncReg} (h : NewMutexAmOk k L ar s reg c g st') :\n    st' = (s, reg ++ [⟨g, none⟩]) ∧ (∀ l, st'.1.I l = s.I l) ∧\n      OptP (mutexOf s g) (fun m => ∀ l ∈ footprint s.P m, st'.1.I l = .init) False := by\n  obtain ⟨⟨-, hpre, rfl⟩, -⟩ := h\n  exact ⟨rfl, fun _ => rfl, hpre.initM⟩\n\n/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: the amended `newMutex` and `newMutex` have the same final state\nwhen both are `ok`; the proposed C13 item 11 only removes `ok` outcomes. -/\ntheorem newMutexAm_same_effect {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {ar : ArenaReg} {s : SC}\n    {reg : SyncReg} {c g : Nat} {st' st'' : SC × SyncReg} (h : NewMutexAmOk k L ar s reg c g st')\n    (h' : NewMutexOk k L ar s reg c g st'') : st' = st'' := by\n  rw [h.1.2.2, h'.2.2]\n\n/-! ## The controller graph -/\n\n/-- Brief, final pass, task 6; `corpus-spec2-m3.md` v12 §2 undecies: in the controller graph of\nany trace, the initial write (event `0`, hypothesis 4 of layer R) is a modification of the\ncontroller (WC5.1 corrigé C31), not atomic, of no context, writing `0`, and the source of no `sw`\nedge (C32 item 1: only a release-capable write is). -/\ntheorem ctlGraph_init_write (o : Ords) (e : Nat) (lbls : List Label) :\n    (ctlGraph o e lbls).isMod 0 = true ∧ (ctlGraph o e lbls).isAtomic 0 = false ∧\n      (ctlGraph o e lbls).ctx? 0 = none ∧ (ctlGraph o e lbls).valW 0 = some 0 ∧\n      ∀ r, ¬ EventModel.SW (ctlGraph o e lbls) 0 r := by\n  refine ⟨rfl, ?_, rfl, rfl, fun r h => ?_⟩\n  · simp [EventModel.Graph.isAtomic, EventModel.Graph.kind?, EventModel.Graph.ev?]\n  · have hr := h.2.1\n    simp [EventModel.Graph.relCap, EventModel.Graph.kind?, EventModel.Graph.ev?] at hr\n\n/-! ## Invariant, coherence and bridge -/\n\n/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: `ctl_invariant` on a final amended execution. -/\ntheorem runAmF_ctl_invariant {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {e : Nat}\n    (h0 : ∀ x, (σ 0).2.1[e]? = some x → x.grant = none) (o : Ords) :\n    ∀ n, n ≤ lbls.length →\n      (∀ x, (σ n).2.1[e]? = some x →\n        (x.grant = none ↔ lastW (ctlGraph o e (lbls.take n)) = some 0)) ∧\n      ((σ n).2.1[e]? = none → ctlOps e (lbls.take n) = []) ∧\n      PredZero (ctlEvs o e (lbls.take n)) :=\n  ctl_invariant (fun i hi => (h.1 i hi).2) h0 o\n\n/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: `ctlGraph_coherent_run` on a final amended execution from a state\nwith an empty registry. -/\ntheorem runAmF_coherent {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) (h0 : (σ 0).2.1 = []) (e : Nat) {o : Ords}\n    (ho : o.WellTyped) :\n    EventModel.WellTyped (ctlGraph o e lbls) ∧ EventModel.EventConsistent (ctlGraph o e lbls) :=\n  ctlGraph_coherent_run (run7_run5R h.1) h0 e ho\n\n/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: `bridge` on a final amended execution. -/\ntheorem runAmF_bridge {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {e : Nat}\n    (h0 : ∀ x, (σ 0).2.1[e]? = some x → x.grant = none) {u a c : Nat}\n    (hu : lbls[u]? = some (.unlock c e)) (hsw : SWS σ L lbls (.step u) (.step a)) (o : Ords) :\n    EventModel.RF (ctlGraph o e lbls) (ctlIdx e lbls u) (ctlIdx e lbls a) :=\n  bridge (fun i hi => (h.1 i hi).2) h0 hu hsw o\n\n/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: `bridge_sw` on a final amended execution. -/\ntheorem runAmF_bridge_sw {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {e : Nat}\n    (h0 : ∀ x, (σ 0).2.1[e]? = some x → x.grant = none) {u a c : Nat}\n    (hu : lbls[u]? = some (.unlock c e)) (hsw : SWS σ L lbls (.step u) (.step a)) (o : Ords) :\n    EventModel.SW (ctlGraph o e lbls) (ctlIdx e lbls u) (ctlIdx e lbls a) ↔\n      (o.rel = .rel ∨ o.rel = .sc) ∧ (o.acq = .acq ∨ o.acq = .acqRel ∨ o.acq = .sc) :=\n  bridge_sw (fun i hi => (h.1 i hi).2) h0 hu hsw o\n\n/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: `bridge_sw_ref` on a final amended execution. -/\ntheorem runAmF_bridge_sw_ref {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {e : Nat}\n    (h0 : ∀ x, (σ 0).2.1[e]? = some x → x.grant = none) {u a c : Nat}\n    (hu : lbls[u]? = some (.unlock c e)) (hsw : SWS σ L lbls (.step u) (.step a)) :\n    EventModel.SW (ctlGraph refOrds e lbls) (ctlIdx e lbls u) (ctlIdx e lbls a) :=\n  bridge_sw_ref (fun i hi => (h.1 i hi).2) h0 hu hsw\n\n/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: `bridge_converse` on a final amended execution, under hypothesis 3\n(`CtlFixed`). -/\ntheorem runAmF_bridge_converse {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {e : Nat}\n    (h0 : ∀ x, (σ 0).2.1[e]? = some x → x.grant = none) (h3 : CtlFixed σ L lbls e)\n    {u a cu ca : Nat} (hu : lbls[u]? = some (.unlock cu e)) (ha : lbls[a]? = some (.acquire ca e))\n    (o : Ords) (hrf : EventModel.RF (ctlGraph o e lbls) (ctlIdx e lbls u) (ctlIdx e lbls a)) :\n    SWS σ L lbls (.step u) (.step a) :=\n  bridge_converse (fun i hi => (h.1 i hi).2) h0 h3 hu ha o hrf\n\nend Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal\n","numLines":120,"startLine":1,"totalLines":120}},"displayPath":"formal/Ern/Concurrency/MutexReal/FinalCorollaries.lean","savedCopyFraming":{"enveloped":false}},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8b0e99c9-e768-4d9d-9744-62cdf2a3cb69","timestamp":"2026-11-12T16:25:16.873Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/MutexReal/FinalCorollaries.lean\"}\n</system-reminder>"},{"content":"<system-reminder>\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\timport Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.Final\n2\timport Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.Bridge\n3\t\n4\t/-!\n5\t# No silent change under the final wording\n6\t\n7\tBrief of milestone 4, slice 2, layer R, final pass, task 6 (`corpus-spec2-m3.md` v12 §2 undecies:\n8\t\"L'amendement ne change ni l'effet abstrait de `newMutex`, ni l'état d'initialisation d'aucune\n9\tfeuille (C13.10), ni le graphe du contrôleur\"):\n10\t\n11\t* the amended `newMutex` has the effect of `NewMutexOk` and keeps the initialization state of\n12\t  every leaf (`newMutexAm_effect`, `newMutexAm_same_effect`);\n13\t* the controller graph (`ctlGraph`) reads only the labels, never the states, so a final amended\n14\t  execution has the graph of its labels; its initial write, event `0`, is a non-atomic\n15\t  modification writing `0` and the source of no `sw` edge (`ctlGraph_init_write`);\n16\t* the invariant, the coherence and the bridge of layer R apply as they are to a final amended\n17\t  execution (`runAmF_ctl_invariant`, `runAmF_coherent`, `runAmF_bridge`, `runAmF_bridge_sw`,\n18\t  `runAmF_bridge_sw_ref`, `runAmF_bridge_converse`): corollaries, not new proofs.\n19\t-/\n20\t\n21\tset_option autoImplicit false\n22\t\n23\tnamespace Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal\n24\t\n25\topen Ern.MemoryModel.Access Ern.Concurrency\n26\t\n27\t/-! ## The effect of `newMutex` -/\n28\t\n29\t/-- Brief, final pass, task 6 (proposed C13, \"Clarification to the Effect\": the abstract\n30\tregistration effect is unchanged and no structural leaf of `M` changes its initialization state):\n31\tan amended `newMutex` that is `ok` appends `⟨guarded, none⟩` to the registry, leaves the kernel\n32\tstate unchanged, so the initialization state of every leaf, and the leaves of `M` are `Init` before\n33\tand after (WC5.1 corrigé C13.10). -/\n34\ttheorem newMutexAm_effect {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {ar : ArenaReg} {s : SC} {reg : SyncReg}\n35\t    {c g : Nat} {st' : SC × SyncReg} (h : NewMutexAmOk k L ar s reg c g st') :\n36\t    st' = (s, reg ++ [⟨g, none⟩]) ∧ (∀ l, st'.1.I l = s.I l) ∧\n37\t      OptP (mutexOf s g) (fun m => ∀ l ∈ footprint s.P m, st'.1.I l = .init) False := by\n38\t  obtain ⟨⟨-, hpre, rfl⟩, -⟩ := h\n39\t  exact ⟨rfl, fun _ => rfl, hpre.initM⟩\n40\t\n41\t/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: the amended `newMutex` and `newMutex` have the same final state\n42\twhen both are `ok`; the proposed C13 item 11 only removes `ok` outcomes. -/\n43\ttheorem newMutexAm_same_effect {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {ar : ArenaReg} {s : SC}\n44\t    {reg : SyncReg} {c g : Nat} {st' st'' : SC × SyncReg} (h : NewMutexAmOk k L ar s reg c g st')\n45\t    (h' : NewMutexOk k L ar s reg c g st'') : st' = st'' := by\n46\t  rw [h.1.2.2, h'.2.2]\n47\t\n48\t/-! ## The controller graph -/\n49\t\n50\t/-- Brief, final pass, task 6; `corpus-spec2-m3.md` v12 §2 undecies: in the controller graph of\n51\tany trace, the initial write (event `0`, hypothesis 4 of layer R) is a modification of the\n52\tcontroller (WC5.1 corrigé C31), not atomic, of no context, writing `0`, and the source of no `sw`\n53\tedge (C32 item 1: only a release-capable write is). -/\n54\ttheorem ctlGraph_init_write (o : Ords) (e : Nat) (lbls : List Label) :\n55\t    (ctlGraph o e lbls).isMod 0 = true ∧ (ctlGraph o e lbls).isAtomic 0 = false ∧\n56\t      (ctlGraph o e lbls).ctx? 0 = none ∧ (ctlGraph o e lbls).valW 0 = some 0 ∧\n57\t      ∀ r, ¬ EventModel.SW (ctlGraph o e lbls) 0 r := by\n58\t  refine ⟨rfl, ?_, rfl, rfl, fun r h => ?_⟩\n59\t  · simp [EventModel.Graph.isAtomic, EventModel.Graph.kind?, EventModel.Graph.ev?]\n60\t  · have hr := h.2.1\n61\t    simp [EventModel.Graph.relCap, EventModel.Graph.kind?, EventModel.Graph.ev?] at hr\n62\t\n63\t/-! ## Invariant, coherence and bridge -/\n64\t\n65\t/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: `ctl_invariant` on a final amended execution. -/\n66\ttheorem runAmF_ctl_invariant {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n67\t    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {e : Nat}\n68\t    (h0 : ∀ x, (σ 0).2.1[e]? = some x → x.grant = none) (o : Ords) :\n69\t    ∀ n, n ≤ lbls.length →\n70\t      (∀ x, (σ n).2.1[e]? = some x →\n71\t        (x.grant = none ↔ lastW (ctlGraph o e (lbls.take n)) = some 0)) ∧\n72\t      ((σ n).2.1[e]? = none → ctlOps e (lbls.take n) = []) ∧\n73\t      PredZero (ctlEvs o e (lbls.take n)) :=\n74\t  ctl_invariant (fun i hi => (h.1 i hi).2) h0 o\n75\t\n76\t/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: `ctlGraph_coherent_run` on a final amended execution from a state\n77\twith an empty registry. -/\n78\ttheorem runAmF_coherent {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n79\t    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) (h0 : (σ 0).2.1 = []) (e : Nat) {o : Ords}\n80\t    (ho : o.WellTyped) :\n81\t    EventModel.WellTyped (ctlGraph o e lbls) ∧ EventModel.EventConsistent (ctlGraph o e lbls) :=\n82\t  ctlGraph_coherent_run (run7_run5R h.1) h0 e ho\n83\t\n84\t/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: `bridge` on a final amended execution. -/\n85\ttheorem runAmF_bridge {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n86\t    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {e : Nat}\n87\t    (h0 : ∀ x, (σ 0).2.1[e]? = some x → x.grant = none) {u a c : Nat}\n88\t    (hu : lbls[u]? = some (.unlock c e)) (hsw : SWS σ L lbls (.step u) (.step a)) (o : Ords) :\n89\t    EventModel.RF (ctlGraph o e lbls) (ctlIdx e lbls u) (ctlIdx e lbls a) :=\n90\t  bridge (fun i hi => (h.1 i hi).2) h0 hu hsw o\n91\t\n92\t/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: `bridge_sw` on a final amended execution. -/\n93\ttheorem runAmF_bridge_sw {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n94\t    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {e : Nat}\n95\t    (h0 : ∀ x, (σ 0).2.1[e]? = some x → x.grant = none) {u a c : Nat}\n96\t    (hu : lbls[u]? = some (.unlock c e)) (hsw : SWS σ L lbls (.step u) (.step a)) (o : Ords) :\n97\t    EventModel.SW (ctlGraph o e lbls) (ctlIdx e lbls u) (ctlIdx e lbls a) ↔\n98\t      (o.rel = .rel ∨ o.rel = .sc) ∧ (o.acq = .acq ∨ o.acq = .acqRel ∨ o.acq = .sc) :=\n99\t  bridge_sw (fun i hi => (h.1 i hi).2) h0 hu hsw o\n100\t\n101\t/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: `bridge_sw_ref` on a final amended execution. -/\n102\ttheorem runAmF_bridge_sw_ref {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n103\t    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {e : Nat}\n104\t    (h0 : ∀ x, (σ 0).2.1[e]? = some x → x.grant = none) {u a c : Nat}\n105\t    (hu : lbls[u]? = some (.unlock c e)) (hsw : SWS σ L lbls (.step u) (.step a)) :\n106\t    EventModel.SW (ctlGraph refOrds e lbls) (ctlIdx e lbls u) (ctlIdx e lbls a) :=\n107\t  bridge_sw_ref (fun i hi => (h.1 i hi).2) h0 hu hsw\n108\t\n109\t/-- Brief, final pass, task 6: `bridge_converse` on a final amended execution, under hypothesis 3\n110\t(`CtlFixed`). -/\n111\ttheorem runAmF_bridge_converse {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n112\t    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {e : Nat}\n113\t    (h0 : ∀ x, (σ 0).2.1[e]? = some x → x.grant = none) (h3 : CtlFixed σ L lbls e)\n114\t    {u a cu ca : Nat} (hu : lbls[u]? = some (.unlock cu e)) (ha : lbls[a]? = some (.acquire ca e))\n115\t    (o : Ords) (hrf : EventModel.RF (ctlGraph o e lbls) (ctlIdx e lbls u) (ctlIdx e lbls a)) :\n116\t    SWS σ L lbls (.step u) (.step a) :=\n117\t  bridge_converse (fun i hi => (h.1 i hi).2) h0 h3 hu ha o hrf\n118\t\n119\tend Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal\n120\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
{"parentUuid":"8b0e99c9-e768-4d9d-9744-62cdf2a3cb69","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/MutexReal/FinalAuthority.lean","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/MutexReal/FinalAuthority.lean","content":"import Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.Final\nimport Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.ResetAmend\n\n/-!\n# Authority of the protocol in a final amended execution\n\nBrief of milestone 4, slice 2, layer R, final pass, task 5: in a final amended execution, every\n`newMutex` step is made by a frame with exercisable `Modify` and effective `Modify` on the\ncontroller (proposed C13 item 11), and every `acquire`, `unlock` or `resetLock` step by a frame with\na present effective mode on the controller (WC5.1 corrigé C14 item 3, C17 item 4; proposed C18\nitem 4).\n-/\n\nset_option autoImplicit false\n\nnamespace Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal\n\nopen Ern.MemoryModel.Access Ern.Concurrency\n\n/-- Brief, final pass, task 5: in a final amended execution, every step `newMutex(g)` by `c` is made\nby a frame with an authority exercisable in `Modify` and of effective `Modify` on the controller\n`ControlOf(⟨g, none⟩)` of the registered entry (proposed C13 item 11). -/\ntheorem runAmF_newMutex_authority {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {j : Nat} (hj : j < lbls.length) {c g : Nat}\n    (hl : lbls[j] = .newMutex c g) : NewMutexRight L (σ j).1 c g := by\n  have ha := h.2 j hj\n  rw [hl] at ha\n  exact ha\n\n/-- Brief, final pass, task 5: in a final amended execution, every step `acquire(i)`, `unlock(i)` or\n`resetLock(i)` by `c` is made by a frame with a present effective mode on `ControlOf(i)`\n(`protocol_authority`: C14 item 3 and C17 item 4 in the step relation, the proposed C18 item 4 in\n`AmCondF`). -/\ntheorem runAmF_protocol_authority {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {j : Nat} (hj : j < lbls.length) {c i : Nat}\n    (hp : lbls[j] = .acquire c i ∨ lbls[j] = .unlock c i ∨ lbls[j] = .resetLock c i) :\n    OptP ((σ j).2.1[i]?) (fun e => CtrlRight L (σ j).1 e ((σ j).1.view c).top) False :=\n  ResetAmend.protocol_authority (h.1 j hj).2 (amCond_of_amCondF (h.2 j hj)) hp\n\nend Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal\n","numLines":41,"startLine":1,"totalLines":41}},"displayPath":"formal/Ern/Concurrency/MutexReal/FinalAuthority.lean","savedCopyFraming":{"enveloped":false}},"type":"attachment","uuid":"df530106-881d-449f-a507-9fefebac4053","timestamp":"2026-11-12T16:25:16.873Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/MutexReal/FinalAuthority.lean\"}\n</system-reminder>"},{"content":"<system-reminder>\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\timport Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.Final\n2\timport Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.ResetAmend\n3\t\n4\t/-!\n5\t# Authority of the protocol in a final amended execution\n6\t\n7\tBrief of milestone 4, slice 2, layer R, final pass, task 5: in a final amended execution, every\n8\t`newMutex` step is made by a frame with exercisable `Modify` and effective `Modify` on the\n9\tcontroller (proposed C13 item 11), and every `acquire`, `unlock` or `resetLock` step by a frame with\n10\ta present effective mode on the controller (WC5.1 corrigé C14 item 3, C17 item 4; proposed C18\n11\titem 4).\n12\t-/\n13\t\n14\tset_option autoImplicit false\n15\t\n16\tnamespace Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal\n17\t\n18\topen Ern.MemoryModel.Access Ern.Concurrency\n19\t\n20\t/-- Brief, final pass, task 5: in a final amended execution, every step `newMutex(g)` by `c` is made\n21\tby a frame with an authority exercisable in `Modify` and of effective `Modify` on the controller\n22\t`ControlOf(⟨g, none⟩)` of the registered entry (proposed C13 item 11). -/\n23\ttheorem runAmF_newMutex_authority {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n24\t    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {j : Nat} (hj : j < lbls.length) {c g : Nat}\n25\t    (hl : lbls[j] = .newMutex c g) : NewMutexRight L (σ j).1 c g := by\n26\t  have ha := h.2 j hj\n27\t  rw [hl] at ha\n28\t  exact ha\n29\t\n30\t/-- Brief, final pass, task 5: in a final amended execution, every step `acquire(i)`, `unlock(i)` or\n31\t`resetLock(i)` by `c` is made by a frame with a present effective mode on `ControlOf(i)`\n32\t(`protocol_authority`: C14 item 3 and C17 item 4 in the step relation, the proposed C18 item 4 in\n33\t`AmCondF`). -/\n34\ttheorem runAmF_protocol_authority {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n35\t    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunAmF k L σ lbls) {j : Nat} (hj : j < lbls.length) {c i : Nat}\n36\t    (hp : lbls[j] = .acquire c i ∨ lbls[j] = .unlock c i ∨ lbls[j] = .resetLock c i) :\n37\t    OptP ((σ j).2.1[i]?) (fun e => CtrlRight L (σ j).1 e ((σ j).1.view c).top) False :=\n38\t  ResetAmend.protocol_authority (h.1 j hj).2 (amCond_of_amCondF (h.2 j hj)) hp\n39\t\n40\tend Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal\n41\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
