{"parentUuid":"351d638f-d919-4942-a00d-5faa4a1aa7cc","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"048ce1b3-8891-4aae-bdd2-33b7fc094ee0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H4A6CueHP5BBwpxTkchtR8","type":"tool_result","content":"223:`Usable` (§40), `FrameOf` (§40), `OwnedIn` (§40) and `ExercisableAt` (§43) are inductive\n669:/-- `ExercisableAt(s, a, m)` (§43): `a` is active, its own mode permits `m`, and it is held by\n673:inductive S3.ExercisableAt (s : S3) : Nat → Mode → Prop where\n675:      y.holder = .frame s.top → S3.ExercisableAt s a m\n677:      m.le y.mode → y.holder = .place p → S3.ExercisableAt s b m →\n673:inductive S3.ExercisableAt (s : S3) : Nat → Mode → Prop where\n674-  | base {a : Nat} {m : Mode} {y : Authority} : s.A[a]? = some y → y.active = true → m.le y.mode →\n675-      y.holder = .frame s.top → S3.ExercisableAt s a m\n676-  | held {a p b : Nat} {m : Mode} {y : Authority} : s.A[a]? = some y → y.active = true →\n677-      m.le y.mode → y.holder = .place p → S3.ExercisableAt s b m →\n678-      (∀ l ∈ footprint s.P p, Allows (effective s b l) m) → S3.ExercisableAt s a m\n679-\n680-/-- One step of `ExercisableAt · m` read on a Boolean premise (decision procedure for §43). -/\n681-def exR (s : S3) (m : Mode) (E : Nat → Bool) (a : Nat) : Bool :=\n682-  match s.A[a]? with\n683-  | some y => y.active && decide (m.le y.mode) && match y.holder with\n684-    | .frame f => decide (f = s.top)\n685-    | .place p => (List.range s.A.length).any fun b =>\n686-        decide (∀ l ∈ footprint s.P p, Allows (effective s b l) m) && E b\n687-  | none => false\n  /-- §62.2: it is held by the current frame or by a place with exercisable `Modify`. -/\n  holderRight : OptP (s.A[a]?) (fun y => HolderRight s y.holder) False\n  /-- §62.3: no active descendant. -/","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"aa3f0f42-351f-4d30-b610-937f3f5428ad","timestamp":"2026-11-12T16:27:24.514Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"223:`Usable` (§40), `FrameOf` (§40), `OwnedIn` (§40) and `ExercisableAt` (§43) are inductive\n669:/-- `ExercisableAt(s, a, m)` (§43): `a` is active, its own mode permits `m`, and it is held by\n673:inductive S3.ExercisableAt (s : S3) : Nat → Mode → Prop where\n675:      y.holder = .frame s.top → S3.ExercisableAt s a m\n677:      m.le y.mode → y.holder = .place p → S3.ExercisableAt s b m →\n673:inductive S3.ExercisableAt (s : S3) : Nat → Mode → Prop where\n674-  | base {a : Nat} {m : Mode} {y : Authority} : s.A[a]? = some y → y.active = true → m.le y.mode →\n675-      y.holder = .frame s.top → S3.ExercisableAt s a m\n676-  | held {a p b : Nat} {m : Mode} {y : Authority} : s.A[a]? = some y → y.active = true →\n677-      m.le y.mode → y.holder = .place p → S3.ExercisableAt s b m →\n678-      (∀ l ∈ footprint s.P p, Allows (effective s b l) m) → S3.ExercisableAt s a m\n679-\n680-/-- One step of `ExercisableAt · m` read on a Boolean premise (decision procedure for §43). -/\n681-def exR (s : S3) (m : Mode) (E : Nat → Bool) (a : Nat) : Bool :=\n682-  match s.A[a]? with\n683-  | some y => y.active && decide (m.le y.mode) && match y.holder with\n684-    | .frame f => decide (f = s.top)\n685-    | .place p => (List.range s.A.length).any fun b =>\n686-        decide (∀ l ∈ footprint s.P p, Allows (effective s b l) m) && E b\n687-  | none => false\n  /-- §62.2: it is held by the current frame or by a place with exercisable `Modify`. -/\n  holderRight : OptP (s.A[a]?) (fun y => HolderRight s y.holder) False\n  /-- §62.3: no active descendant. -/","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"returnCodeInterpretation":"No matches found","noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"4794c5c3-cea1-4635-b782-31b5ee817b26","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},