{"parentUuid":"80157119-d115-4ab5-a842-d44b159555a8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"048ce1b3-8891-4aae-bdd2-33b7fc094ee0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NyadRU5vwZmgCpwtDHHWKU","type":"tool_result","content":"  except the authorities through which the step exercises its `Modify` right over `place`: some\n  authority grounding that right and its origin chain. -/\n  access : ∃ g ∈ List.range s.A.length, Grounds s .modify p g ∧\n    ∀ j ∈ List.range s.A.length, RightChain s g j ∨ FreeAccessOK s p j\n  /-- §70.3, last sentence: no authority that the effect makes inactive has an active descendant\n  that the effect does not make inactive. -/\n  keptDesc : ∀ a ∈ List.range s.A.length, ∀ j ∈ List.range s.A.length, s.Active a →\n    ¬ (freeEff s p).Active a → a ∈ s.ancs j → ¬ (freeEff s p).Active j\n  /-- §70.3: no surviving place is anchored to an authority of the released unit or of its dead\n  holders. -/\n  anchors : ∀ q ∈ List.range s.P.length, (freeS s p).Usable q → ∀ x ∈ s.D q, FreeAnchorOK s p x\n  /-- §70.4: no leaf of the released unit is pinned, statically or dynamically. -/\n    refine ⟨fun i => match i with | 0 => st | i + 1 => σ i, rfl, fun i hi => ?_, hn⟩\n    cases i with\n    | zero => exact ⟨he, by show LStep k L lbl st (σ 0); rw [h0]; exact hs⟩\n    | succ i => exact hr i (by simpa using hi)\n\n/-- Without a live `guarded`, every authority exercisable from the current frame of `c` (Spec 1\n§43) satisfies `Exer5`. -/\ntheorem exer5_of_exercisable {s : SC} {reg : SyncReg} {c a : Nat} {m : Mode}\n    (hng : ∀ e ∈ reg, ¬ e.Live s) (h : (s.view c).ExercisableAt a m) : Exer5 s reg c a m := by\n  have hg : ∀ x, NotGuarded s reg x := fun x e he hl => absurd hl (hng e he)\n  induction h with\n  | base hy ha hm hf => exact .base (hg _) hy ha hm hf\n  | held hy ha hm hp _ hc ih => exact .held (hg _) hy ha hm hp ih hc\n\n/-- Without a live entry in the synchronization registry, every `ok` step satisfies `ChainExcl`\n(the preconditions of Spec 1 §60.1, §61.1, §66.2, §67.1, §68.2 require `ExercisableAt`): the\ncorrection leaves the traces without a live mutex unchanged. -/\ntheorem chainExcl_of_noLive {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {lbl : Label} {s : SC} {reg : SyncReg}\n    {ar : ArenaReg} {st' : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg} (hng : ∀ e ∈ reg, ¬ e.Live s)\n    (h : LStep k L lbl (s, reg, ar) st') : ChainExcl (s, reg) lbl := by\n  cases lbl with\n  | kernel c op =>\n    cases op <;> simp only [ChainExcl] <;> try trivial\n    all_goals\n      cases h with\n      | kernel hk =>\n        obtain ⟨-, o, hR, ho⟩ := hk\n        cases hR with\n        | ok hp => exact exer5_of_exercisable hng hp.exercisable\n        | reject => cases ho\n  | _ => trivial\n\nend Ern.Concurrency","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"7e306734-97c0-4d56-8660-e0e0b67db606","timestamp":"2026-11-12T16:38:51.769Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"  except the authorities through which the step exercises its `Modify` right over `place`: some\n  authority grounding that right and its origin chain. -/\n  access : ∃ g ∈ List.range s.A.length, Grounds s .modify p g ∧\n    ∀ j ∈ List.range s.A.length, RightChain s g j ∨ FreeAccessOK s p j\n  /-- §70.3, last sentence: no authority that the effect makes inactive has an active descendant\n  that the effect does not make inactive. -/\n  keptDesc : ∀ a ∈ List.range s.A.length, ∀ j ∈ List.range s.A.length, s.Active a →\n    ¬ (freeEff s p).Active a → a ∈ s.ancs j → ¬ (freeEff s p).Active j\n  /-- §70.3: no surviving place is anchored to an authority of the released unit or of its dead\n  holders. -/\n  anchors : ∀ q ∈ List.range s.P.length, (freeS s p).Usable q → ∀ x ∈ s.D q, FreeAnchorOK s p x\n  /-- §70.4: no leaf of the released unit is pinned, statically or dynamically. -/\n    refine ⟨fun i => match i with | 0 => st | i + 1 => σ i, rfl, fun i hi => ?_, hn⟩\n    cases i with\n    | zero => exact ⟨he, by show LStep k L lbl st (σ 0); rw [h0]; exact hs⟩\n    | succ i => exact hr i (by simpa using hi)\n\n/-- Without a live `guarded`, every authority exercisable from the current frame of `c` (Spec 1\n§43) satisfies `Exer5`. -/\ntheorem exer5_of_exercisable {s : SC} {reg : SyncReg} {c a : Nat} {m : Mode}\n    (hng : ∀ e ∈ reg, ¬ e.Live s) (h : (s.view c).ExercisableAt a m) : Exer5 s reg c a m := by\n  have hg : ∀ x, NotGuarded s reg x := fun x e he hl => absurd hl (hng e he)\n  induction h with\n  | base hy ha hm hf => exact .base (hg _) hy ha hm hf\n  | held hy ha hm hp _ hc ih => exact .held (hg _) hy ha hm hp ih hc\n\n/-- Without a live entry in the synchronization registry, every `ok` step satisfies `ChainExcl`\n(the preconditions of Spec 1 §60.1, §61.1, §66.2, §67.1, §68.2 require `ExercisableAt`): the\ncorrection leaves the traces without a live mutex unchanged. -/\ntheorem chainExcl_of_noLive {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {lbl : Label} {s : SC} {reg : SyncReg}\n    {ar : ArenaReg} {st' : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg} (hng : ∀ e ∈ reg, ¬ e.Live s)\n    (h : LStep k L lbl (s, reg, ar) st') : ChainExcl (s, reg) lbl := by\n  cases lbl with\n  | kernel c op =>\n    cases op <;> simp only [ChainExcl] <;> try trivial\n    all_goals\n      cases h with\n      | kernel hk =>\n        obtain ⟨-, o, hR, ho⟩ := hk\n        cases hR with\n        | ok hp => exact exer5_of_exercisable hng hp.exercisable\n        | reject => cases ho\n  | _ => trivial\n\nend Ern.Concurrency","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"2fadac5e-9af0-49d8-8b35-192bf7d8fb9e","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"e