{"parentUuid":"2e127d18-812a-4bc5-a6bf-cc4ff87c8423","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"048ce1b3-8891-4aae-bdd2-33b7fc094ee0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E1gPSJXeX1qfq8NqGJTXjQ","type":"tool_result","content":"import Ern.Concurrency.CapPreserve\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.MX\n\n/-!\n# Counterexample: exercise through `guarded` in a holder chain\n\nBrief of milestone 4, task 4. `GuardedExcl` excludes the steps whose authority argument is a live\n`guarded`, while the third clause of Spec 1 §43 is recursive along the holder chain: an authority\n`z` stored in the protected `T` is exercisable by any frame that can exercise `guarded`, held by\n`slot`, in `Observe`. The trace below is built from the initial state of Spec 1 §47 with the\ncontract `KM` of `corpus-spec2-m3.md` v4 §0; each step is an `ok` step admitted by `Encap5`, by\n`decide`. It refutes `cap5_sound` and `handoff_loss_exists`.\n\nStatics: `0` the mutex value `M` with fields `1` (`slot`, `Uninit`) and `2` (`lock`, `Init`), `3`\nthe protected root `T` (`Init`) owned by `M`, `4` a local `Y` (`Init`) of the base frame. Root\nauthorities: `0` of `M` (frame 0), `1` of `T` (held by `M`), `2` of `Y` (frame 0).\n-/\n\nnamespace Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.GuardedChain\n\nopen Ern.MemoryModel.Access Ern.Concurrency Ern.Concurrency.Corpus\nopen Ern.Concurrency.Traces (L0)\n\n/-- Statics (Spec 1 §47): block MX of `corpus-spec2-m3.md` v4 §0 without `M′`, and a local `Y`. -/\ndef zst : Statics :=\n  [((none, none, 0), false), ((some 0, none, 0), false), ((some 0, none, 0), true),\n   ((none, some 0, 0), true), ((none, none, 0), true)]\n\n/-- The statics are well formed (Spec 1 §47). -/\ntheorem zst_ok : StaticsOK zst := by decide\n\n/-- Initial state (Spec 1 §47). -/\ndef gc0 : SC := SC.ofS3 (S3.init zst)\n/-- `z := derive(root_Y, Modify)`, authority 3 (O1). -/\ndef gc1 : SC := gc0.set (deriveEff (gc0.view 0) 2 [4] .modify)\n/-- `store(z, T)` (O8): `z` is held by `T`. -/\ndef gc2 : SC := storeEffC gc1 0 3 3\n/-- `guarded := derive(root_T, Modify, footprint(T))`, authority 4 (O1). -/\ndef gc3 : SC := gc2.set (deriveEff (gc2.view 0) 1 [3] .modify)\n/-- `store(guarded, slot)` (O8). -/\ndef gc4 : SC := storeEffC gc3 0 4 1\n/-- The registry after `newMutex(guarded)` (WC4 C13). -/\ndef greg : SyncReg := [⟨4, none⟩]\n/-- `o1 := derive(root_M, Observe, {slot, lock})`, authority 5 (O1). -/\ndef gc5 : SC := gc4.set (deriveEff (gc4.view 0) 0 [1, 2] .observe)\n/-- `spawn c1` yielding `o1` (WC4 C4): context 1, initial frame 1. -/\ndef gc6 : SC := spawnEff gc5 0 [5] []\n/-- `c1 : read3(Y)` via `z` (O9): the state is unchanged. -/\ndef gc7 : SC := gc6.set (gc6.view 1)\n/-- `c0 : acquire(e)`: grant `g`, authority 6, held by frame 0 (WC4 C16). -/\ndef gc8 : SC := deriveSyncEff gc7 0 4\n/-- The registry with the grant recorded (WC4 C16). -/\ndef gregG : SyncReg := [⟨4, some 6⟩]\n/-- `c0 : write3(Y)` via `z` (O10). -/\ndef gc9 : SC := gc8.set (write3Eff (gc8.view 0) [4])\n\n/-- The labels of the trace. -/\ndef glbls : List Label :=\n  [.kernel 0 (.derive 2 [4] .modify), .kernel 0 (.store 3 3), .kernel 0 (.derive 1 [3] .modify),\n   .kernel 0 (.store 4 1), .newMutex 0 4, .kernel 0 (.derive 0 [1, 2] .observe), .spawn 0 [5] [],\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/AR.lean:26:def arst : Statics :=\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/AR.lean-27-  [((none, none, 0), false), ((some 0, none, 0), false), ((some 0, none, 0), true),\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/AR.lean-28-   ((none, some 0, 0), true), ((none, none, 0), false), ((some 4, none, 0), false),\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/AR.lean-29-   ((some 4, none, 0), false), ((none, none, 0), false)]\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/AR.lean-30-\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/AR.lean-31-/-- The statics are well formed (Spec 1 §47). -/\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/AR.lean-32-theorem arst_ok : StaticsOK arst := by decide\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/AR.lean-33-\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/AR.lean-34-/-- The contract of block AR: `lock2` (place 2) is the only `SharedMutable` leaf. -/\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/AR.lean-35-abbrev KA : K := KC [2]\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/AR.lean-36-\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/AR.lean-37-/-- Initial state of block AR. -/\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/AR.lean-38-def a0 : SC := SC.ofS3 (S3.init arst)\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean:123:def xst : Statics :=\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean-124-  [((none, none, 0), false), ((some 0, none, 0), true), ((some 0, none, 0), true)]\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean-125-\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean-126-/-- Initial state of S13. -/\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean-127-def t0 : SC := SC.ofS3 (S3.init xst)\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean-128-/-- `a := derive(root_X, Modify)`, authority 1 (O1). -/\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean-129-def t1 : SC := t0.set (deriveEff (t0.view 0) 0 [1, 2] .modify)\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean-130-/-- `spawn c1` yielding `a` (WC4 C4): context 1, initial frame 1. -/\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean-131-def t2 : SC := spawnEff t1 0 [1] []\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean-132-\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean-133-/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` §1 S13, `reject` (O10.1: no effective mode, Spec 1 §43.3): after\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean-134-`spawn c1` yielding `a := derive(root_X, Modify)`, `write3(X)` via `root_X` by context 0. -/\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean-135-theorem S13_1_reject : opStepC KF (.derive 0 [1, 2] .modify) 0 t0 (.ok t1) ∧\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean:60:def mxst : Statics :=\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean-61-  [((none, none, 0), false), ((some 0, none, 0), false), ((some 0, none, 0), true),\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean-62-   ((none, some 0, 0), true), ((none, none, 0), false), ((some 4, none, 0), false),\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean-63-   ((some 4, none, 0), false)]\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean-64-\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean-65-/-- The statics are well formed (Spec 1 §47). -/\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean-66-theorem mxst_ok : StaticsOK mxst := by decide\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean