urrency/Encap5.lean-28-  | .kernel _ (.write a _) | .kernel _ (.writeShared a _) =>\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-29-    ∀ e ∈ st.2, e.Live st.1 → a ≠ e.guarded\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-30-  | _ => True\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-31-\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-32-/-- Decidability of `GuardedExcl`. -/\nErn/Concurrency/Sync.lean:78:def DeriveSyncStep {R : Type} (kc : KC R) (r : R) (s : SC) (c g : Nat) (o : Outcome3 SC) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/Sync.lean-79-  s.Live c ∧ Guarded (DeriveSyncPre kc r s c g) (deriveSyncEff s c g) o\nErn/Concurrency/Sync.lean-80-\nErn/Concurrency/Sync.lean-81-/-- WC4 C15 effect: the authority created by `deriveSync` is an ordinary authority of mode `Modify`,\nErn/Concurrency/Sync.lean-82-origin `guarded`, footprint `footprint(guarded)`, held by the current frame, active, of fresh\nErn/Concurrency/Transfer.lean:185:def SpawnValStep (k : K) (s : SC) (c : Nat) (ps : List Nat) (ls : LocalShape)\nErn/Concurrency/Transfer.lean-186-    (vs : List (Nat × Nat)) (o : Outcome3 SC) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/Transfer.lean-187-  s.Live c ∧ Guarded (SpawnValPre k s c ps ls vs) (spawnValEff s c ps ls vs) o\nErn/Concurrency/Transfer.lean-188-\nErn/Concurrency/Transfer.lean-189-/-! ## Verdict of the milestone-1 case D2 (WC4 C5 item 5) -/","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"da3e2f91-2298-4138-9841-23f1eb6bde78","timestamp":"2026-11-12T16:44:06.226Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:870:inductive Guarded {σ : Type} (Pre : Prop) (eff : σ) : Outcome3 σ → Prop where\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean-871-  | ok : Pre → Guarded Pre eff (.ok eff)\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean-872-  | reject : ¬ Pre → Guarded Pre eff .reject\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean-873-\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean-874-end Ern.MemoryModel.Access\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Lemmas.lean:228:theorem Guarded.ok_iff {σ : Type} {Pre : Prop} {eff s' : σ} :\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Lemmas.lean-229-    Guarded Pre eff (.ok s') ↔ Pre ∧ s' = eff :=\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Lemmas.lean-230-  ⟨fun h => by cases h; exact ⟨‹_›, rfl⟩, fun ⟨h, e⟩ => e ▸ .ok h⟩\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Lemmas.lean-231-\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Lemmas.lean-232-/-- The `reject` outcome of a guarded transition: the preconditions fail (§58). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Lemmas.lean-233-theorem Guarded.reject_iff {σ : Type} {Pre : Prop} {eff : σ} :\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Lemmas.lean-234-    Guarded Pre eff .reject ↔ ¬ Pre :=\nErn/Concurrency/Cap.lean:112:theorem pre_of_ok {P : Prop} {eff : S3} {o : Outcome3 S3} {s s' : SC} (hR : Guarded P eff o)\nErn/Concurrency/Cap.lean-113-    (ho : Outcome3.ok s' = omap s.set o) : P := by\nErn/Concurrency/Cap.lean-114-  cases hR with\nErn/Concurrency/Cap.lean-115-  | ok hp => exact hp\nErn/Concurrency/Cap.lean-116-  | reject => cases ho\nErn/Concurrency/Cap.lean-117-\nErn/Concurrency/Cap.lean-118-/-- `cap_sound` (WC5 C43, brief of milestone 4, task 2): for every enabled access step of context\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean:26:def GuardedExcl (st : SC × SyncReg) : Label → Prop\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-27-  | .kernel _ (.derive a _ _) | .kernel _ (.split a _) | .kernel _ (.read a _)\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-28-  | .kernel _ (.write a _) | .kernel _ (.writeShared a _) =>\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-29-    ∀ e ∈ st.2, e.Live st.1 → a ≠ e.guarded\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-30-  | _ => True\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-31-\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-32-/-- Decidability of `GuardedExcl`. -/\nErn/Concurrency/Sync.lean:78:def DeriveSyncStep {R : Type} (kc : KC R) (r : R) (s : SC) (c g : Nat) (o : Outcome3 SC) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/Sync.lean-79-  s.Live c ∧ Guarded (DeriveSyncPre kc r s c g) (deriveSyncEff s c g) o\nErn/Concurrency/Sync.lean-80-\nErn/Concurrency/Sync.lean-81-/-- WC4 C15 effect: the authority created by `deriveSync` is an ordinary authority of mode `Modify`,\nErn/Concurrency/Sync.lean-82-origin `guarded`, footprint `footprint(guarded)`, held by the current frame, active, of fresh\nErn/Concurrency/Transfer.lean:185:def SpawnValStep (k : K) (s : SC) (c : Nat) (ps : List Nat) (ls : LocalShape)\nErn/Concurrency/Transfer.lean-186-    (vs : List (Nat × Nat)) (o : Outcome3 SC) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/Transfer.lean-187-  s.Live c ∧ Guarded (SpawnValPre k s c ps ls vs) (spawnValEff s c ps ls vs) o\nErn/Concurrency/Transfer.lean-188-\nErn/Concurrency/Transfer.lean-189-/-! ## Verdict of the milestone-1 case D2 (WC4 C5 item 5) -/","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8ecd4d35-42f7-4884-9690-9ad98c659f19","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"802b800c-50a4-4f21-94e9-8268297e9665","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
