{"parentUuid":"7eef5e4f-2762-4e5e-9e18-eb82ab3945fc","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"048ce1b3-8891-4aae-bdd2-33b7fc094ee0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TqJpjCwZYsotZ4Q4tUu2if","type":"tool_result","content":"open Ern.Concurrency.Traces (L0)\n\n/-! ## Contract -/\n\n/-- Test contract of the corpus (Spec 1 §48): no declared disjointness, the leaves of `sm` are\n`SharedMutable`, nothing statically pinned, every external use done, every place deallocable,\nevery deallocation compatible, every allocation satisfiable. -/\ndef KC (sm : List Nat) : K :=\n  ⟨fun _ _ => False, fun l => l ∈ sm, fun _ => False, fun _ => True, fun _ => True,\n    fun _ _ => True, fun _ _ _ => True⟩\n\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : ∀ r r', Decidable ((KC sm).DeclaredDisjoint r r') :=\n  fun _ _ => inferInstanceAs (Decidable False)\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : DecidablePred (KC sm).SharedMutable :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ sm))\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : DecidablePred (KC sm).Pinned :=\n  fun _ => inferInstanceAs (Decidable False)\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : DecidablePred (KC sm).ExternalDone :=\n  fun _ => inferInstanceAs (Decidable True)\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : DecidablePred (KC sm).Deallocable :=\n  fun _ => inferInstanceAs (Decidable True)\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : ∀ p a, Decidable ((KC sm).FreeCompat p a) :=\n  fun _ _ => inferInstanceAs (Decidable True)\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : ∀ p ls s, Decidable ((KC sm).Satisfiable p ls s) :=\n  fun _ _ _ => inferInstanceAs (Decidable True)\n\n/-- `DDSound` of the corpus contract (Spec 1 §80): nothing is declared disjoint. -/\ntheorem ddKC (sm : List Nat) : DDSound (KC sm) := fun _ _ h => h.elim\n\n/-! ## Block MX (`corpus-spec2-m3.md` §0) -/\n\n/-- Statics (Spec 1 §47): `0` the mutex value `M`, `1` its field `slot` (`Uninit`), `2` its field\n`lock` (`Init`), `3` the protected root `T` (`Init`), owned by `M`; `4` the mutex-shaped value `M′`\nwith fields `5` (`slot′`) and `6` (`lock′`), `Uninit`. Root authorities: `0` of `M` (frame 0), `1`\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean:164:theorem S13_3_ok : opStepC KF (.split 0 [[1], [2]]) 0 t0 (.ok u1) ∧ SpawnStep u1 0 [1] [] (.ok u2) ∧\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean:159:`g` held by context 1, `writeShared(T)` via `g`. Positive twin: `S2_2_ok`. -/\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean:160:theorem S5a_1_reject : opStepC KM (.writeShared 5 [3]) 1 x5 .reject :=\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean:167:from `MX₄`, `writeShared(lock)` via `o1` by context 1 outside `acquire`/`unlock` is an `ok` kernel\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean:170:theorem S5b_1_ok : opStepC KM (.writeShared 4 [2]) 1 x4 (.ok x4w) ∧\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean:171:    Encap L0 (x4, regX) (.kernel 1 (.writeShared 4 [2])) :=\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/S10b.lean:66:    (∀ l ∈ footprint b5.P 1, ¬ K0.Pinned l ∧ b5.pin l = false) ∧\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Witness.lean:123:`writeShared` of `c` (Spec 1 §68) and a `read3`, `write3` or `writeShared` of `c′` (§66–§68), each\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Witness.lean:132:O11.1: every leaf of a `writeShared` region is `K.SharedMutable`). With R4\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Witness.lean:134:the grain of abstract steps, goes through `writeShared` on a `SharedMutable` leaf. This is not a\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Witness.lean:140:`writeShared(lock)` via `root_M` by context 0 and `read3(lock)` via `o1` by context 1 are both\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:10:the accesses of `read3`, `write3`, `writeShared` (`Label.Access`), and the source and destination\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:39:`writeShared`: their leaves (`Label.Access`). `store`: its target (Spec 1 §59, `KernelOp.Writes`;\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:53:  | .kernel _ (.read _ ls), l | .kernel _ (.write _ ls), l | .kernel _ (.writeShared _ ls), l =>\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:59:  | .kernel c (.free p _), l => Dying st.1 (st.1.set (freeEff (st.1.view c) p)) l\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:80:`exitFrame`, `read3`, `write3`, `writeShared`, `pin`, `unpin`, `free`, `spawn`, `terminate`,\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:83:  | .kernel _ (.derive _ _ _) | .kernel _ (.split _ _) | .kernel _ (.depend _ _)\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:85:  | .kernel _ (.writeShared _ _) | .kernel _ (.pin _) | .kernel _ (.unpin _)\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:86:  | .kernel _ (.free _ _) | .spawn _ _ _ | .terminate _ | .join _ _ | .deriveSync _ _\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:196:    | writeShared a ls =>","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"5134e434-0cdf-4d4d-8451-1f1470c65428","timestamp":"2026-11-12T16:51:09.512Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"open Ern.Concurrency.Traces (L0)\n\n/-! ## Contract -/\n\n/-- Test contract of the corpus (Spec 1 §48): no declared disjointness, the leaves of `sm` are\n`SharedMutable`, nothing statically pinned, every external use done, every place deallocable,\nevery deallocation compatible, every allocation satisfiable. -/\ndef KC (sm : List Nat) : K :=\n  ⟨fun _ _ => False, fun l => l ∈ sm, fun _ => False, fun _ => True, fun _ => True,\n    fun _ _ => True, fun _ _ _ => True⟩\n\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : ∀ r r', Decidable ((KC sm).DeclaredDisjoint r r') :=\n  fun _ _ => inferInstanceAs (Decidable False)\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : DecidablePred (KC sm).SharedMutable :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ sm))\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : DecidablePred (KC sm).Pinned :=\n  fun _ => inferInstanceAs (Decidable False)\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : DecidablePred (KC sm).ExternalDone :=\n  fun _ => inferInstanceAs (Decidable True)\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : DecidablePred (KC sm).Deallocable :=\n  fun _ => inferInstanceAs (Decidable True)\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : ∀ p a, Decidable ((KC sm).FreeCompat p a) :=\n  fun _ _ => inferInstanceAs (Decidable True)\ninstance (sm : List Nat) : ∀ p ls s, Decidable ((KC sm).Satisfiable p ls s) :=\n  fun _ _ _ => inferInstanceAs (Decidable True)\n\n/-- `DDSound` of the corpus contract (Spec 1 §80): nothing is declared disjoint. -/\ntheorem ddKC (sm : List Nat) : DDSound (KC sm) := fun _ _ h => h.elim\n\n/-! ## Block MX (`corpus-spec2-m3.md` §0) -/\n\n/-- Statics (Spec 1 §47): `0` the mutex value `M`, `1` its field `slot` (`Uninit`), `2` its field\n`lock` (`Init`), `3` the protected root `T` (`Init`), owned by `M`; `4` the mutex-shaped value `M′`\nwith fields `5` (`slot′`) and `6` (`lock′`), `Uninit`. Root authorities: `0` of `M` (frame 0), `1`\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Frames.lean:164:theorem S13_3_ok : opStepC KF (.split 0 [[1], [2]]) 0 t0 (.ok u1) ∧ SpawnStep u1 0 [1] [] (.ok u2) ∧\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean:159:`g` held by context 1, `writeShared(T)` via `g`. Positive twin: `S2_2_ok`. -/\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean:160:theorem S5a_1_reject : opStepC KM (.writeShared 5 [3]) 1 x5 .reject :=\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean:167:from `MX₄`, `writeShared(lock)` via `o1` by context 1 outside `acquire`/`unlock` is an `ok` kernel\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean:170:theorem S5b_1_ok : opStepC KM (.writeShared 4 [2]) 1 x4 (.ok x4w) ∧\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MX.lean:171:    Encap L0 (x4, regX) (.kernel 1 (.writeShared 4 [2])) :=\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/S10b.lean:66:    (∀ l ∈ footprint b5.P 1, ¬ K0.Pinned l ∧ b5.pin l = false) ∧\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Witness.lean:123:`writeShared` of `c` (Spec 1 §68) and a `read3`, `write3` or `writeShared` of `c′` (§66–§68), each\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Witness.lean:132:O11.1: every leaf of a `writeShared` region is `K.SharedMutable`). With R4\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Witness.lean:134:the grain of abstract steps, goes through `writeShared` on a `SharedMutable` leaf. This is not a\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/Witness.lean:140:`writeShared(lock)` via `root_M` by context 0 and `read3(lock)` via `o1` by context 1 are both\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:10:the accesses of `read3`, `write3`, `writeShared` (`Label.Access`), and the source and destination\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:39:`writeShared`: their leaves (`Label.Access`). `store`: its target (Spec 1 §59, `KernelOp.Writes`;\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:53:  | .kernel _ (.read _ ls), l | .kernel _ (.write _ ls), l | .kernel _ (.writeShared _ ls), l =>\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:59:  | .kernel c (.free p _), l => Dying st.1 (st.1.set (freeEff (st.1.view c) p)) l\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:80:`exitFrame`, `read3`, `write3`, `writeShared`, `pin`, `unpin`, `free`, `spawn`, `terminate`,\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:83:  | .kernel _ (.derive _ _ _) | .kernel _ (.split _ _) | .kernel _ (.depend _ _)\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:85:  | .kernel _ (.writeShared _ _) | .kernel _ (.pin _) | .kernel _ (.unpin _)\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:86:  | .kernel _ (.free _ _) | .spawn _ _ _ | .terminate _ | .join _ _ | .deriveSync _ _\nErn/Concurrency/MutexReal/Classify.lean:196:    | writeShared a ls =>","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"3803058c-60a7-4b72-87d5-646c501cab5c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7eef5e4f-2762-4e5e-9e18-eb82ab3945fc","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/