= P, owner = Y, one leaf)` (O14): place 10, root authority 10 held by `Y`. -/\n116\tdef lv12 : SC := lv11.set (allocEff (lv11.view 0) 8 [(none, 0)])\n117\t/-- `free(10)` (O13). -/\n118\tdef lv13 : SC := lv12.set (freeEff (lv12.view 0) 10)\n119\t/-- `endUse(Y)` (O12). -/\n120\tdef lv14 : SC := lv13.set (endUseEff (lv13.view 0) 8)\n121\t\n122\t/-- The labels of the trace of legitimate uses. -/\n123\tdef lvLbls : List Label :=\n124\t  [.kernel 0 (.derive 1 [3] .modify), .kernel 0 (.store 6 1), .newMutex 0 6,\n125\t   .kernel 0 (.derive 2 [5, 6] .modify), .kernel 0 (.store 7 7), .newArena 0 4 7, .reset 0 0,\n126\t   .kernel 0 (.split 4 [[8]]), .kernel 0 (.read 9 [8]), .kernel 0 (.writeShared 9 [8]),\n127\t   .kernel 0 (.release 9), .kernel 0 (.pin 8), .kernel 0 (.unpin 0),\n128\t   .kernel 0 (.alloc 9 8 [(none, 0)]), .kernel 0 (.free 10 0), .kernel 0 (.endUse 8)]\n129\t\n130\t/-- The named states of the trace of legitimate uses. -/\n131\tdef lvσ (i : Nat) : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg :=\n132\t  [(lv0, [], []), (lv1, [], []), (lv2, [], []), (lv2, lvReg, []), (lv3, lvReg, []),\n133\t    (lv4, lvReg, []), (lv4, lvReg, lvAr), (lv5, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv6, lvReg, lvAr5),\n134\t    (lv7, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv8, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv9, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv10, lvReg, lvAr5),\n135\t    (lv11, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv12, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv13, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv14, lvReg, lvAr5)].getD i\n136\t    (lv14, lvReg, lvAr5)\n137\t\n138\t/-- The trace of legitimate uses from the initial state, each step admitted by `Encap5R`. -/\n139\ttheorem lv_steps : Steps5R KL L0\n140\t    [(lv0, [], []), (lv1, [], []), (lv2, [], []), (lv2, lvReg, []), (lv3, lvReg, []),\n141\t      (lv4, lvReg, []), (lv4, lvReg, lvAr), (lv5, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv6, lvReg, lvAr5),\n142\t      (lv7, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv8, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv9, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv10, lvReg, lvAr5),\n143\t      (lv11, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv12, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv13, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv14, lvReg, lvAr5)]\n144\t    lvLbls :=\n145\t  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n146\t  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, .ok (by decide)⟩) <|\n147\t  .cons (by decide) (.newMutex ⟨by decide, by decide, rfl⟩) <|\n148\t  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n149\t  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, .ok (by decide)⟩) <|\n150\t  .cons (by decide) (.newArena ⟨by decide, .ok (by decide)⟩) <|\n151\t  .cons (by decide) (.reset ⟨by decide, _, .ok rfl (.ok (by decide)) (.ok (by decide)) (by decide),\n152\t    rfl⟩) <|\n153\t  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n154\t  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n155\t  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n156\t  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n157\t  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n158\t  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n159\t  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide) trivial, rfl⟩) <|\n160\t  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n161\t  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) .nil\n162\t\n163\t/-- Brief of slice 3, task 3: the trace of legitimate uses is a `RunFull` from the initial state,\n164\tand entry `e` is live before each step from `derive(root_ST0)` on: `derive`, `store`, `newArena`,\n165\t`reset`, `split`, `read3`, `writeShared`, `release`, `pin`, `unpin`, `alloc`, `free`, `endUse`\n166\tare `ok` and admitted under a live entry, their rights resting on root authorities of `f0` or on\n167\tthe split block (WC5.2 C22 item 6: another valid chain suffices). -/\n168\ttheorem lv_full : lvσ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init lvst), [], []) ∧ RunFull KL L0 lvσ lvLbls ∧\n169\t    ∀ i, 3 ≤ i → i < lvLbls.length → LiveAt (lvσ i) := by\n170\t  refine ⟨rfl, runFull_of_run7 (run7_of_run5R (lv_steps.run _) (by decide)) (by decide), ?_⟩\n171\t  decide\n172\t\n173\tend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.NonRegression\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","hash":"ba5d1788316a3ba429b44f40d2cf1573aa85f39e4db09d53fa355ab05c2a97cd","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Les 24 exécutions amendées finales sont toutes des `RunFull`, et je construis maintenant la trace sous entrée vivante pour les genres non exercés.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01F6SUyqNzrxcTDWYPHYhEYf","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/NonRegression.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\nadd='''\n/-! ## Legitimate uses under a live entry -/\n\n/-- Some entry of the registry is live in the state. -/\ndef LiveAt (st : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) : Prop := ∃ e ∈ st.2.1, e.Live st.1\n\n/-- Decidability of `LiveAt`. -/\ninstance (st : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) : Decidable (LiveAt st) := by\n  unfold LiveAt; infer_instance\n\n/-- Statics of the trace of legitimate uses (Spec 1 §47): those of W-GI (block MX without `M′`, the\nfree arena storage `ST0` with `R1`, `R2`, the arena value `AV0`), and two root leaves of the base\nframe, `8` (`Y`, `Init`) and `9` (`P`, `Init`). Root authorities: `0` of `M`, `1` of `T` (held by\n`M`), `2` of `ST0`, `3` of `AV0`, `4` of `Y`, `5` of `P`; all but `1` held by frame 0. -/\ndef lvst : Statics := Witness.gist ++ [((none, none, 0), true), ((none, none, 0), true)]\n\n/-- The statics are well formed (Spec 1 §47). -/\ntheorem lvst_ok : StaticsOK lvst := by decide\n\n/-- The contract of the trace: `lock` (place 2) and `Y` (place 8) are `SharedMutable`. -/\nabbrev KL : K := Corpus.KC [2, 8]\n\n/-- The arena of the trace (Spec 1 §46). -/\ndef lvE : Arena.ArenaEntry := ⟨4, 7, [5, 6], []⟩\n\n/-- Initial state. -/\ndef lv0 : SC := SC.ofS3 (S3.init lvst)\n/-- `guarded := derive(root_T, Modify, footprint(T))`, authority 6 (O1). -/\ndef lv1 : SC := lv0.set (deriveEff (lv0.view 0) 1 [3] .modify)\n/-- `store(guarded, slot)` (O8). -/\ndef lv2 : SC := storeEffC lv1 0 6 1\n/-- The registry after `newMutex(guarded)` (WC5.2 C13): entry `e`, live from now on. -/\ndef lvReg : SyncReg := [⟨6, none⟩]\n/-- `internal0 := derive(root_ST0, Modify, footprint(ST0))`, authority 7 (O1). -/\ndef lv3 : SC := lv2.set (deriveEff (lv2.view 0) 2 [5, 6] .modify)\n/-- `store(internal0, AV0)` (O8). -/\ndef lv4 : SC := storeEffC lv3 0 7 7\n/-- The arena registry after `newArena(ST0, internal0)` (Spec 1 §76). -/\ndef lvAr : ArenaReg := [lvE]\n/-- `reset(arena0)` (Spec 1 §78): `derive` of `internal0` over the storage (authority 8), then\n`release` of it. -/\ndef lv5 : SC := lv4.set (releaseEff (deriveEff (lv4.view 0) 7 [5, 6] .modify) 8)\n/-- The arena registry after the reset (Spec 1 §78 effect). -/\ndef lvAr5 : ArenaReg := lvAr.set 0 (Arena.resetMeta lv4.flat lvE)\n/-- `split(root_Y, [[Y]])`, the block is authority 9 (O2). -/\ndef lv6 : SC := lv5.set (splitEff (lv5.view 0) 4 [[8]])\n/-- `read3(Y)` via the block (O9): the state is unchanged. -/\ndef lv7 : SC := lv6.set (lv6.view 0)\n/-- `writeShared(Y)` via the block (O11). -/\ndef lv8 : SC := lv7.set (write3Eff (lv7.view 0) [8])\n/-- `release(block)` (O3). -/\ndef lv9 : SC := lv8.set (releaseEff (lv8.view 0) 9)\n/-- `pin(Y)` (O15): obligation 0. -/\ndef lv10 : SC := lv9.set (pinEff (lv9.view 0) 8)\n/-- `unpin(0)` (O16). -/\ndef lv11 : SC := lv10.set (unpinEff (lv10.view 0) 0)\n/-- `alloc(provider = P, owner = Y, one leaf)` (O14): place 10, root authority 10 held by `Y`. -/\ndef lv12 : SC := lv11.set (allocEff (lv11.view 0) 8 [(none, 0)])\n/-- `free(10)` (O13). -/\ndef lv13 : SC := lv12.set (freeEff (lv12.view 0) 10)\n/-- `endUse(Y)` (O12). -/\ndef lv14 : SC := lv13.set (endUseEff (lv13.view 0) 8)\n\n/-- The labels of the trace of legitimate uses. -/\ndef lvLbls : List Label :=\n  [.kernel 0 (.derive 1 [3] .modify), .kernel 0 (.store 6 1), .newMutex 0 6,\n   .kernel 0 (.derive 2 [5, 6] .modify), .kernel 0 (.store 7 7), .newArena 0 4 7, .reset 0 0,\n   .kernel 0 (.split 4 [[8]]), .kernel 0 (.read 9 [8]), .kernel 0 (.writeShared 9 [8]),\n   .kernel 0 (.release 9), .kernel 0 (.pin 8), .kernel 0 (.unpin 0),\n   .kernel 0 (.alloc 9 8 [(none, 0)]), .kernel 0 (.free 10 0), .kernel 0 (.endUse 8)]\n\n/-- The named states of the trace of legitimate uses. -/\ndef lvσ (i : Nat) : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg :=\n  [(lv0, [], []), (lv1, [], []), (lv2, [], []), (lv2, lvReg, []), (lv3, lvReg, []),\n    (lv4, lvReg, []), (lv4, lvReg, lvAr), (lv5, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv6, lvReg, lvAr5),\n    (lv7, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv8, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv9, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv10, lvReg, lvAr5),\n    (lv11, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv12, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv13, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv14, lvReg, lvAr5)].getD i\n    (lv14, lvReg, lvAr5)\n\n/-- The trace of legitimate uses from the initial state, each step admitted by `Encap5R`. -/\ntheorem lv_steps : Steps5R KL L0\n    [(lv0, [], []), (lv1, [], []), (lv2, [], []), (lv2, lvReg, []), (lv3, lvReg, []),\n      (lv4, lvReg, []), (lv4, lvReg, lvAr), (lv5, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv6, lvReg, lvAr5),\n      (lv7, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv8, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv9, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv10, lvReg, lvAr5),\n      (lv11, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv12, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv13, lvReg, lvAr5), (lv14, lvReg, lvAr5)]\n    lvLbls :=\n  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, .ok (by decide)⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.newMutex ⟨by decide, by decide, rfl⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, .ok (by decide)⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.newArena ⟨by decide, .ok (by decide)⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.reset ⟨by decide, _, .ok rfl (.ok (by decide)) (.ok (by decide)) (by decide),\n    rfl⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide) trivial, rfl⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|\n  .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) .nil\n\n/-- Brief of slice 3, task 3: the trace of legitimate uses is a `RunFull` from the initial state,\nand entry `e` is live before each step from `derive(root_ST0)` on: `derive`, `store`, `newArena`,\n`reset`, `split`, `read3`, `writeShared`, `release`, `pin`, `unpin`, `alloc`, `free`, `endUse`\nare `ok` and admitted under a live entry, their rights resting on root authorities of `f0` or on\nthe split block (WC5.2 C22 item 6: another valid chain suffices). -/\ntheorem lv_full : lvσ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init lvst), [], []) ∧ RunFull KL L0 lvσ lvLbls ∧\n    ∀ i, 3 ≤ i → i < lvLbls.length → LiveAt (lvσ i) := by\n  refine ⟨rfl, runFull_of_run7 (run7_of_run5R (lv_steps.run _) (by decide)) (by decide), ?_⟩\n  decide\n\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.NonRegression'''\nassert s.count('\\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.NonRegression')==1\ns=s.replace('\\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.NonRegression', add, 1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ntime ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/NonRegression.lean 2>&1 | head -50","description":"Add legitimate-use trace and compile","timeout":1200000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
