{"parentUuid":"d50124f8-1778-4409-ab0f-450b7ab70eff","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"048ce1b3-8891-4aae-bdd2-33b7fc094ee0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018qqw245Bmz9FqnY7zVxHwu","type":"tool_result","content":"169-\n170-/-- The locals of the child: a copy of the shape of the mutex value, root `7`, fields `8`, `9`. -/\n171:def mLocals : LocalShape := [(none, 0), (some 7, 0), (some 7, 0)]\n172-/-- `c0 : spawn` by value moving `M` into the root local `7` of the child (WC5.1 corrigé C5). -/\n173-def cv1 : SC := spawnValEff x2 0 [] mLocals [(0, 7)]\n174-\n175-/-- The labels of the by-value `spawn` that moves the mutex. -/\n176-def cvLbls : List Label := mx3Lbls ++ [.spawnVal 0 [] mLocals [(0, 7)]]\n177-\n--\n198-\n199-/-- `c0 : endUse(M)` (O12). -/\n200:def ce1 : SC := x2.set (endUseEff (x2.view 0) 0)\n201-\n202-/-- The labels of the `endUse(M)` trace. -/\n203:def ceLbls : List Label := mx3Lbls ++ [.kernel 0 (.endUse 0)]\n204-\n205-/-- The named states of the `endUse(M)` trace. -/\n206:def ceσ (i : Nat) : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg :=\n207-  [(x0, [], []), (x1, [], []), (x2, [], []), (x2, regX, []), (ce1, regX, [])].getD i\n208-    (ce1, regX, [])\n209-\n210-/-- Brief, task 4, `endUse`, status `fin de vie` (`corpus-spec2-m3.md` S17a twin; WC5.1 corrigé\n211-C22 item 5): from `MX₃`, `c0 : endUse(M)` is an `ok` step admitted by `Encap5R`; it touches `lock`\n212-and entry `e` is dead after it. -/\n213:theorem endUse_ends : ceσ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init mxst), [], []) ∧ Run5R KM L0 ceσ ceLbls ∧\n214-    (⟨3, none⟩ : SyncEntry).Live x2 ∧ ¬ (⟨3, none⟩ : SyncEntry).Live ce1 ∧\n215-    Touches L0 (x2, regX, []) (.kernel 0 (.endUse 0)) 2 := by\n216-  have h : Steps5R KM L0 [(x2, regX, []), (ce1, regX, [])] [.kernel 0 (.endUse 0)] :=\n217-    .cons ⟨⟨(by decide : ∀ e ∈ regX, e.Live x2 → ControlOf L0 x2 e ≠ some 0 ∧\n218-        OptP (slotOf x2 e.guarded) (fun q => partOf x2.P 0 q → 0 = q) True), trivial, trivial⟩,\n219-        by decide⟩\n--\n225-\n226-/-- The labels of the `release(guarded)` trace. -/\n227:def crLbls : List Label := mx3Lbls ++ [.kernel 0 (.release 3)]\n228-\n229-/-- The named states of the `release(guarded)` trace. -/\n230-def crσ (i : Nat) : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg :=\n231-  [(x0, [], []), (x1, [], []), (x2, [], []), (x2, regX, []), (cr1, regX, [])].getD i\n232-    (cr1, regX, [])\n233-\n308:def spawnEff (s : SC) (c : Nat) (ps : List Nat) (ls : LocalShape) : SC :=\n309-  { s.set (enterEff (s.view c) ps ls) with\n310-    C := s.C ++ [⟨[s.nF], .live, (s.stk c).head?⟩] }\n311-\n312-/-- Preconditions of `spawn` without transmitted value (WC4 C4.1–C4.5): the clauses of `EnterPre`\n313-(Spec 1 §72, `Ern.MemoryModel.Access.Ops`) re-indexed as in `EnterPreC`, with O6.3 read from the\n314-current frame of the new context. C4.2 (fresh identities) and C4.4 (yield without duplication)\n315-hold by construction of `spawnEff`; C4.6 concerns `spawn` with a value\n316-(`Ern.Concurrency.Transfer`); the preservation obligations of WC4 C4 are theorems, not","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f6e632d0-31dd-4d63-bfe7-800e27e6faf9","timestamp":"2026-11-12T16:55:40.260Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"169-\n170-/-- The locals of the child: a copy of the shape of the mutex value, root `7`, fields `8`, `9`. -/\n171:def mLocals : LocalShape := [(none, 0), (some 7, 0), (some 7, 0)]\n172-/-- `c0 : spawn` by value moving `M` into the root local `7` of the child (WC5.1 corrigé C5). -/\n173-def cv1 : SC := spawnValEff x2 0 [] mLocals [(0, 7)]\n174-\n175-/-- The labels of the by-value `spawn` that moves the mutex. -/\n176-def cvLbls : List Label := mx3Lbls ++ [.spawnVal 0 [] mLocals [(0, 7)]]\n177-\n--\n198-\n199-/-- `c0 : endUse(M)` (O12). -/\n200:def ce1 : SC := x2.set (endUseEff (x2.view 0) 0)\n201-\n202-/-- The labels of the `endUse(M)` trace. -/\n203:def ceLbls : List Label := mx3Lbls ++ [.kernel 0 (.endUse 0)]\n204-\n205-/-- The named states of the `endUse(M)` trace. -/\n206:def ceσ (i : Nat) : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg :=\n2