st.P q →\n                Allows (effective ((s, reg, ar).fst, (s, reg, ar).snd.fst).fst.flat b l) Mode.modify)\n    False\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/ResetException.lean:69:38: error(lean.invalidField): Invalid field `lt`: The environment does not contain `Ern.Concurrency.Exer5.lt`, so it is not possible to project the field `lt` from an expression\n  hb\nof type\n  Exer5 s (List.eraseIdx reg i) c b Mode.modify\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/ResetException.lean:73:16: error: Type mismatch\n  id\nhas type\n  ?m.254 → ?m.254\nbut is expected to have type\n  OptP (some e)\n      (fun e =>\n        OptP (ControlOf L ((s, reg, ar).fst, (s, reg, ar).snd.fst).fst e)\n          (fun ctl =>\n            ∃ a,\n              a ∈ List.range ((s, reg, ar).fst, (s, reg, ar).snd.fst).fst.A.length ∧\n~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/ResetException.lean 2>&1  0.15s user 0.22s system 84% cpu 0.439 total\nhead -50  0.00s user 0.00s system 0% cpu 0.428 total","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"4c9ca37d-cd4c-4c89-a11e-232c676fda1d","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"894be00e-5325-4f9d-a8b8-c5711f64e71d","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cl