{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","hash":"94247d92481913ae4bb291691f622a9e71be92b0e6594ea110b942a6ec989824","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Toutes les tâches 1 à 6 sont commitées. Avant le rapport, je consulte l'advisor sur l'opportunité de prouver une version restreinte de la tâche 5 (grant actif ou absent)."},{"type":"server_tool_use","id":"srvtoolu_014PBrc1zmWFv38NLGWV5qZY","name":"advisor","input":{}},{"type":"advisor_tool_result","tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_014PBrc1zmWFv38NLGWV5qZY","content":{"type":"advisor_redacted_result","encrypted_content":"REDACTED"}},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Je lis d'abord Spec 1 §73 et WC5.2 C6, sur lesquels repose la réfutation de la tâche 5."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01C5CvPyvb8EngLzLrapFhAa","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && sed -n 860,881p specs/ERN_Memory_Model_Specification_v0.1.md; echo -----; sed -n 124,168p /Users/guygouri/Downloads/ERN_WC5_2_Revu_Pour_Validation/ERN_Concurrency_Model_WC5.2.md","description":"Read Spec 1 §73 and WC5.2 C6–C8"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
