{"parentUuid":"5fdcd317-dd24-4b57-b014-cf9390799b42","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyQ6ZrJrnV8igJfQGKya","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Le balayage confirme que `ProtectedOK` tient sur les 30 traces `RunFull` du dépôt, sauf celle du grant abandonné (pas 9), et que W-GI et W-RX A échouent sur les traces `Run7`. Je consigne ce résultat sous forme de théorème.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1699,"cache_read_input_tokens":523443,"output_tokens":3392,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1186},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1699,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3392,"cache_read_input_tokens":523443,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1699,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1699},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":1,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"b1b56728-1855-43b5-b02a-291d4aba1aab","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgyQ6ZTkZdxuQCsLnkE73","requestRef":"16245330-e43e-419f-a1f6-54ed39f39f4e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"7523f1f1-8229-40f0-9024-bf22f999cc4b","timestamp":"2026-11-12T17:06:15.086Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
{"parentUuid":"7523f1f1-8229-40f0-9024-bf22f999cc4b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyQ6ZrJrnV8igJfQGKya","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017YUXhwrHRxbqj7LENSQqvC","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/Protected.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"import Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.Witness\\n\",\"import Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.NonRegression\\nimport Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.CapacityWitness\\n\",1)\nadd='''\n/-! ## Sweep of the repository -/\n\n/-- `ProtectedOK` at every step of a run. -/\ndef ProtectedRun (L : MutexLayout) (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbls : List Label) :\n    Prop :=\n  ∀ i (h : i < lbls.length), ProtectedOK L (σ i) lbls[i] (σ (i + 1))\n\n/-- W-RX, step A, is a second counterexample on `Run7` (`W_RX_A_current`): `resetLock(e_n)` touches\n`lock_n`, a leaf of `footprint(guarded)` of the outer entry `e`, live before and after, whose\ngrant is not recorded. -/\ntheorem protected_run7_refuted_rx : RunAmF KX L0 rxaσ rxaLbls ∧\n    ¬ ProtectedOK L0 (rxaσ 6) (.resetLock 0 0) (rxaσ 7) :=\n  ⟨W_RX_A_current, by decide⟩\n\nopen Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.HandoffEvents Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.MutexEdge\nopen Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.ResetLockRight Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.ClassifyWitness\nopen Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.NonRegression\nopen Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.Witness (s11σ s11Lbls)\nopen Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.GuardedChainC (lcLbls)\n\n/-- Brief of slice 3, task 5, evidence on the `RunFull` traces of the repository: the corollary\nholds at every step of the 24 final amended executions (`runAmF_traces_full`), of the trace of\nlegitimate uses, of the twin of W-GI, of twin B of W-RX and of the four witnesses of the\nexceptions of task 4 (in these, the entry dies with the step). The only `RunFull` trace that\nfails it is that of the abandoned grant (`protected_runFull_refuted`). -/\ntheorem protected_sweep :\n    ProtectedRun L0 hoσ hoLbls ∧ ProtectedRun L0 ho2σ ho2Lbls ∧ ProtectedRun L0 ho3σ ho3Lbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 hojσ hojLbls ∧ ProtectedRun L0 ho3jσ ho3jLbls ∧ ProtectedRun L0 lcσ lcLbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 rl0σ rl0Lbls ∧ ProtectedRun L0 rlσ rlLbls ∧ ProtectedRun L0 rljσ rljLbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 trσ trLbls ∧ ProtectedRun L0 trjσ trjLbls ∧ ProtectedRun L0 s11σ s11Lbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 cvσ cvLbls ∧ ProtectedRun L0 ceσ ceLbls ∧ ProtectedRun L0 crσ crLbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 gsTwinσ gsTwinLbls ∧ ProtectedRun L0 s3σ s3Lbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 s10σ s10Lbls ∧ ProtectedRun L0 AmendWitness.tsσ AmendWitness.tsLbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 AmendWitness.tiσ AmendWitness.tiLbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 AmendWitness.taσ AmendWitness.taLbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 AmendWitness.tdtσ AmendWitness.tdtLbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 FinalWitness.amσ FinalWitness.amLbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 AmendWitness.tdσ AmendWitness.tdLbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 FullEncap.NonRegression.lvσ FullEncap.NonRegression.lvLbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 gtσ gtLbls ∧ ProtectedRun L0 rxbσ rxbLbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 CapacityWitness.frσ CapacityWitness.frLbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 CapacityWitness.exσ CapacityWitness.exLbls ∧\n    ProtectedRun L0 CapacityWitness.tmσ CapacityWitness.tmLbls := by\n  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_,\n    ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> decide\n\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.Protected'''\nassert s.count('\\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.Protected')==1\ns=s.replace('\\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.Protected', add, 1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nsed -i '' 's/^import Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.Protected$/import Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.Protected/' Ern.lean; time ~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -v \"^✔\\|^⣿\" | tail -20","description":"Add protected sweep theorem and build","timeout":1200000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":