{"parentUuid":"7dee1662-b2ba-4e4f-9567-88ca991d7554","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"048ce1b3-8891-4aae-bdd2-33b7fc094ee0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017epM47JeDAcUab6Ah5sL9d","type":"tool_result","content":"Build completed successfully (126 jobs).\n110\n197f5bc docs(concurrency): state only what the abandoned-grant witness checks\n17:  `protected_run7_refuted_rx`).\n18:* On `RunFull`, an abandoned grant refutes it (`protected_runFull_refuted`): a derivative of the\n67:theorem protected_run7_refuted : Run7 KM L0 giσ giLbls ∧\n112:theorem protected_runFull_refuted : abσ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init mxst), [], []) ∧\n146:theorem protected_run7_refuted_rx : RunAmF KX L0 rxaσ rxaLbls ∧\n160:fails it is that of the abandoned grant (`protected_runFull_refuted`). -/\n161:theorem protected_sweep :","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c2931a77-99bc-45ab-80d8-72b72d0e6e26","timestamp":"2026-11-12T17:09:47.613Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Build completed successfully (126 jobs).\n110\n197f5bc docs(concurrency): state only what the abandoned-grant witness checks\n17:  `protected_run7_refuted_rx`).\n18:* On `RunFull`, an abandoned grant refutes it (`protected_runFull_refuted`): a derivative of the\n67:theorem protected_run7_refuted : Run7 KM L0 giσ giLbls ∧\n112:theorem protected_runFull_refuted : abσ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init mxst), [], []) ∧\n146:theorem protected_run7_refuted_rx : RunAmF KX L0 rxaσ rxaLbls ∧\n160:fails it is that of the abandoned grant (`protected_runFull_refuted`). -/\n161:theorem protected_sweep :","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/Protected.lean","hunks":[{"oldStart":13,"oldLines":7,"newStart":13,"newLines":8,"lines":[" * `ProtectedOK` states it for one step, decidably; `CapFromGrant` reads \"the capacity of `c` on","   `l` comes from the subtree of the grant\": `cap5(c, l)` is present and attained by the grant or","   one of its active descendants, attributable to `c`.","-* On `Run7`, W-GI refutes it (`protected_run7_refuted`).","+* On `Run7`, W-GI and step A of W-RX refute it (`protected_run7_refuted`,","+  `protected_run7_refuted_rx`)."," * On `RunFull`, an abandoned grant refutes it (`protected_runFull_refuted`): a derivative of the","   grant yielded to a child context survives the exit of the frame holding the grant and is","   reanchored to `guarded` (Spec 1 §73, `exitG`); the grant stays recorded and inactive (WC5.2"]},{"oldStart":105,"oldLines":8,"newStart":106,"newLines":8,"lines":[" to a new context `c1`, and exits the frame without `unlock` (WC5.2 C18: the grant becomes inactive"," by frame exit; `x` survives in `c1` and its origin becomes `guarded`, Spec 1 §73). Then"," `c1 : write3(T)` via `x` touches the protected leaf `T` of entry `e`, live before and after, whose","-recorded grant `g` is inactive and has no descendant: the capacity of `c1` comes from `x`, outside","-the subtree of `g`. Every step is admitted by the complete encapsulation: the trace is a `RunFull`","+recorded grant `g` is inactive: the capacity of `c1` comes from `x`, whose origin chain is now","+`[guarded, root_T]`, outside the subtree of `g`. Every step is admitted by the complete encapsulation: the trace is a `RunFull`"," from the initial state. -/"," theorem protected_runFull_refuted : abσ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init mxst), [], []) ∧","     RunFull KM L0 abσ abLbls ∧ ¬ ProtectedOK L0 (abσ 9) (.kernel 1 (.write 6 [3])) (abσ 10) ∧"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/Protected.lean"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"b5a34dc8-f32d-409d-8d93-cda1c3f507bb","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untrac