.Events` -/\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-98-\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-99-/-- Brief, task 3: every strict `sw` edge is an `sw` edge. -/\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-100-theorem sws_sw {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg} {L : MutexLayout} {lbls : List Label}\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-101-    {e e' : Ev} (h : SWS σ L lbls e e') : SW lbls e e' := by\nErn/Concurrency/Events.lean:434:def ExclPair (lbls : List Label) (i j l : Nat) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/Events.lean-435-  ∃ (hij : i < j) (hj : j < lbls.length) (c c' : Nat) (m m' : Mode), c ≠ c' ∧\nErn/Concurrency/Events.lean-436-    (lbls[i]'(Nat.lt_trans hij hj)).Access c' l m ∧ lbls[j].Access c l m' ∧\nErn/Concurrency/Events.lean-437-    (m = .modify ∨ m' = .modify)\nErn/Concurrency/Events.lean-438-\nErn/Concurrency/Events.lean-439-/-- `Race` (brief, \"Race\"; WC5.1 C33 restricted to the accesses `read3`, `write3`, `writeShared`\nErn/Concurrency/Events.lean-440-and to the pairs with a member requiring `Modify`, C44): an exclusive pair without `hb`. -/\nErn/Concurrency/Events.lean-441-def Race (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbls : List Label) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/Events.lean-442-  ∃ i j l, ExclPair lbls i j l ∧ ¬ HB σ lbls (.step i) (.step j)\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MutexEdge.lean:253:theorem W_RL_excl : ExclPair rlLbls 6 11 3 :=\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MutexEdge.lean-254-  ⟨by decide, by decide, 0, 1, .modify, .modify, by decide, ⟨rfl, by decide, rfl⟩,\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MutexEdge.lean-255-    ⟨rfl, by decide, rfl⟩, Or.inl rfl⟩\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MutexEdge.lean-256-\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MutexEdge.lean-257-/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` v9 §2 octies W-RL, graph of §2 septies: the pair is ordered by the\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MutexEdge.lean-258-abstract mutex edge passing over the `resetLock` (step 9), write of context 1 →`po` `unlock(e)`\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MutexEdge.lean-259-(step 7) →`sw` `acquire(e)` of context 0 (step 10) →`po` write of context 0, and it satisfies\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MutexEdge.lean-260-`HandoffOrderedAt` (WC5.1 C46). This is the defect of the abstract edge, kept as a counterexample\nErn/Concurrency/Corpus/MutexEdge.lean-261-(WC5.1 C45, last paragraph). -/","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9709a7a1-978e-49e6-b7a0-507355f2b5a8","timestamp":"2026-11-12T22:56:54.591Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Ern/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean:78:def HBS (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (L : MutexLayout) (lbls : List Label) :\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-79-    Ev → Ev → Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-80-  Relation.TransGen (EdgeS σ L lbls)\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-81-\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-82-/-- Strict `Race` (brief): `Race` read on strict `hb`. -/\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean:83:def RaceS (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (L : MutexLayout) (lbls : List Label) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-84-  ∃ i j l, ExclPair lbls i j l ∧ ¬ HBS σ L lbls (.step i) (.step j)\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-85-\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-86-/-- Strict `HandoffOrderedAt` (brief): `HandoffOrderedAt` read on strict `hb`; `lossStep` is\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-87-unchanged. -/\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean:88:def HandoffOrderedAtS (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (L : MutexLayout) (lbls : List Label)\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-89-    (i j l : Nat) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-90-  ∃ r, lossStep σ lbls i j l = some r ∧ HBS σ L lbls (.step r) (.step j)\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-91-\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-92-/-- Strict `HandoffOrdered` (brief): every exclusive pair satisfies `HandoffOrderedAtS`. -/\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean:93:def HandoffOrderedS (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (L : MutexLayout)\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-94-    (lbls : List Label) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStrict.lean-95-  ∀ i j l, ExclPair lbls i j l → HandoffOrderedAtS σ L lbls i j l\nErn/Concurrency/EventsStric