{"parentUuid":"27647a40-268e-404f-9a67-391253731fb1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ad10e2fd-52be-47f7-a4f7-932245537372","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HBG3sqxRd5YQTznBAW61hV","type":"tool_result","content":"(`SyncInv`, WC4 C21.1–C21.7, and `GrantDiscipline`, WC4 C22). `KInvCA` before the step and `WF3`\nafter it are supplied by theorem 2. For `issue` and `reset`, whose kernel steps derive from the\n`internal` of an arena (Spec 1 Part XIV), the separation of the registries `AdminSep` (Spec 1 §56,\nWC4 C13.7) excludes that `internal` be the `guarded` of a live entry; it is assumed for these two\nlabels only. -/\ntheorem lstep_preserves {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {lbl : Label} {st st' : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n    (h : LStep k L lbl st st') (he : Encap L (st.1, st.2.1) lbl) (hk : KInvCA st.1)\n    (hw' : WF3 st'.1.flat)\n    (hsep : ((∃ c i r d, lbl = .issue c i r d) ∨ ∃ c i, lbl = .reset c i) →\n      AdminSep st.1 st.2.1 st.2.2)\n    (hs : SyncState L st.1 st.2.1) :\n    SyncState L st'.1 st'.2.1 := by\n  have hw : WF3 st.1.flat := hk.1.1.2\n  cases h with\n  | @kernel s s' reg ar c op h =>\n    cases op\n    case transfer src dst =>\n      obtain ⟨-, h'⟩ := h; obtain ⟨hpre, rfl⟩ := Guarded.ok_iff.1 h'\n      exact transfer_syncState hpre.sameShape hpre.dstNotInit hpre.dstUsable.lt he hw hw' hs\n    case endUse p => exact endUse_syncState h he hw hw' hs\n    all_goals\n      exact facts_syncState (opStep_facts (reg := reg) h he (fun _ _ h => by cases h) hw)\n        (opStep_init h (fun _ _ h => by cases h) (fun _ h => by cases h)) hw hw' hs\n  | @spawn s s' reg ar c ps ls h =>\n    obtain ⟨-, h'⟩ := h; obtain ⟨hpre, rfl⟩ := Guarded.ok_iff.1 h'\n    exact facts_syncState (spawnEff_facts hpre.params hpre.localsOK) (spawn_init hpre.localsOK)\n      hw hw' hs\n  | @terminate s s' reg ar c h =>\n    have hf := term_facts (reg := reg) hw h\n    obtain ⟨-, h'⟩ := h; obtain ⟨-, rfl⟩ := Guarded.ok_iff.1 h'\n    exact facts_syncState hf (initFacts_same rfl rfl) hw hw' hs\n  | @join s s' reg ar c d h =>\n    have hf := join_facts (reg := reg) h\n    cases h\n    exact facts_syncState hf (initFacts_same rfl rfl) hw hw' hs\n  | deriveSync h => exact (deriveSync_excluded h he).elim\n  | newMutex h => exact newMutex_syncState h hw hs\n  | acquire h => exact acquire_syncState h hw hw' hs\n  | unlock h => exact unlock_syncState h hw hw' hs\n  | resetLock h => exact resetLock_syncState h hs\n  | spawnVal h => exact spawnVal_syncState hk h he hs\n  | newArena h => obtain ⟨-, -, rfl⟩ := newArenaStepC_ok h; exact hs\n  | @issue s reg ar c i region dst st' h =>\n    obtain ⟨E, s₁, hE, -, -, hsp, hsto, -⟩ := issueStepC_ok h\n    have hsep := hsep (.inl ⟨c, i, region, dst, rfl⟩)\n    have hsep' : ∀ e ∈ reg, e.Live s → E.internal ≠ e.guarded := fun e hm hl heq =>\n      hsep e hm E (List.mem_of_getElem? hE) hl\n        (by show s.flat.Active E.internal; rw [heq]; exact hl) heq.symm\n    have hw₁ : WF3 s₁.flat := wf3_after_view hk.1.1.1\n      (show ViewStep ((KernelOp.split E.internal [region]).Step k) c s (.ok s₁) from hsp)\n      fun t' hR => by\n        have hR' : SplitStep k E.internal [region] (s.view c) (.ok t') := hR\n        refine ⟨split_preserves_wf3 (SC.wf3_view hk.1.1.1 hw) hR', ?_⟩\n        obtain ⟨-, rfl⟩ := Guarded.ok_iff.1 hR'; rfl\n    exact kernel_syncState hsto trivial (fun _ _ e => by cases e) (fun _ e => by cases e) hw₁ hw'\n      (kernel_syncState hsp hsep' (fun _ _ e => by cases e) (fun _ e => by cases e) hw hw₁ hs)\n  | @reset s reg ar c i st' h =>\n    obtain ⟨E, s₁, hE, hd, hrl, -, -⟩ := resetStepC_ok (k := k) h\n    have hsep := hsep (.inr ⟨c, i, rfl⟩)\n    have hsep' : ∀ e ∈ reg, e.Live s → E.internal ≠ e.guarded := fun e hm hl heq =>\n      hsep e hm E (List.mem_of_getElem? hE) hl\n        (by show s.flat.Active E.internal; rw [heq]; exact hl) heq.symm\n    have hw₁ : WF3 s₁.flat := wf3_after_view hk.1.1.1\n      (show ViewStep ((KernelOp.derive E.internal (footprint s.P E.storage) .modify).Step k) c s\n        (.ok s₁) from hd)\n      fun t' hR => by\n        have hR' : DeriveStep E.internal (footprint s.P E.storage) .modify (s.view c) (.ok t') := hR\n        refine ⟨derive_preserves_wf3 (SC.wf3_view hk.1.1.1 hw) hR', ?_⟩\n        obtain ⟨-, rfl⟩ := Guarded.ok_iff.1 hR'; rfl\n    exact kernel_syncState hrl trivial (fun _ _ e => by cases e) (fun _ e => by cases e) hw₁ hw'\n      (kernel_syncState hd hsep' (fun _ _ e => by cases e) (fun _ e => by cases e) hw hw₁ hs)\n\n/-! ## A transfer onto a live mutex value is rejected (WC4 S18, C21.7; Spec 1 §63.3) -/\n\n/-- WC4 S18 (C21.7 with Spec 1 §63.3): under `SyncState`, a `transfer` whose destination contains\nthe mutex value of a live entry is rejected, its controller leaf being `Init`. Positive twins:\n`Ern.Concurrency.EncapTraces.invA`, `Ern.Concurrency.EncapTraces.invB`. -/\n5:theorem spawnEff_facts {reg : SyncReg} {s : SC} {c : Nat} {ps : List Nat} {ls : LocalShape}\n9:  .of (skel_enter rfl hpar) (pskel_shapeP hsh)\n13:theorem yield_get {t : SC} {ps : List Nat} {f j : Nat} :\n14:    (yieldEff t ps f).A[j]? = (t.A[j]?).map (yieldF ps f j) := by\n21:theorem yield_excl {L : MutexLayout} {reg : SyncReg} {t : SC} {ps : List Nat} {f src : Nat}\n22:    (hs : SyncState L (yieldEff t ps f) reg) (hx : TransferExcl L (t, reg) src) :\n23:    TransferExcl L (yieldEff t ps f, reg) src := by\n26:  cases hy : (yieldEff t ps f).A[e.guarded]? with\n35:    have hA : (yieldEff t ps f).A[e.guarded]? = t.A[e.guarded]? := by\n39:      change (yieldEff t ps f).A[e.guarded]? = some z at hz","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c7d4b72f-84ef-46a9-933d-452a0d239efb","timestamp":"2026-11-12T22:57:48.774Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"(`SyncInv`, WC4 C21.1–C21.7, and `GrantDiscipline`, WC4 C22). `KInvCA` before the step and `WF3`\nafter it are supplied by theorem 2. For `issue` and `reset`, whose kernel steps derive from the\n`internal` of an arena (Spec 1 Part XIV), the separation of the registries `AdminSep` (Spec 1 §56,\nWC4 C13.7) excludes that `internal` be the `guarded` of a live entry; it is assumed for these two\nlabels only. -/\ntheorem lstep_preserves {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {lbl : Label} {st st' : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n    (h : LStep k L lbl st st') (he : Encap L (st.1, st.2.1) lbl) (hk : KInvCA st.1)\n    (hw' : WF3 st'.1.flat)\n    (hsep : ((∃ c i r d, lbl = .issue c i r d) ∨ ∃ c i, lbl = .reset c i) →\n      AdminSep st.1 st.2.1 st.2.2)\n    (hs : SyncState L st.1 st.2.1) :\n    SyncState L st'.1 st'.2.1 := by\n  have hw : WF3 st.1.flat := hk.1.1.2\n  cases h with\n  | @kernel s s' reg ar c op h =>\n    cases op\n    case transfer src dst =>\n      obtain ⟨-, h'⟩ := h; obtain ⟨hpre, rfl⟩ := Guarded.ok_iff.1 h'\n      exact transfer_syncState hpre.sameShape hpre.dstNotInit hpre.dstUsable.lt he hw hw' hs\n    case endUse p => exact endUse_syncState h he hw hw' hs\n    all_goals\n      exact facts_syncState (opStep_facts (reg := reg) h he (fun _ _ h => by cases h) hw)\n        (opStep_init h (fun _ _ h => by cases h) (fun _ h => by cases h)) hw hw' hs\n  | @spawn s s' reg ar c ps ls h =>\n    obtain ⟨-, h'⟩ := h; obtain ⟨hpre, rfl⟩ := Guarded.ok_iff.1 h'\n    exact facts_syncState (spawnEff_facts hpre.params hpre.localsOK) (spawn_init hpre.localsOK)\n      hw hw' hs\n  | @terminate s s' reg ar c h =>\n    have hf := term_facts (reg := reg) hw h\n    obtain ⟨-, h'⟩ := h; obtain ⟨-, rfl⟩ := Guarded.ok_iff.1 h'\n    exact facts_syncState hf (initFacts_same rfl rfl) hw hw' hs\n  | @join s s' reg ar c d h =>\n    have hf := join_facts (reg := reg) h\n    cases h\n    exact facts_syncState hf (initFacts_same rfl rfl) hw hw' hs\n  | deriveSync h => exact (deriveSync_excluded h he).elim\n  | newMutex h => exact newMutex_syncState h hw hs\n  | acquire h => exact acquire_syncState h hw hw' hs\n  | unlock h => exact unlock_syncState h hw hw' hs\n  | resetLock h => exact resetLock_syncState h hs\n  | spawnVal h => exact spawnVal_syncState hk h he hs\n  | newArena h => obtain ⟨-, -, rfl⟩ := newArenaStepC_ok h; exact hs\n  | @issue s reg ar c i region dst st' h =>\n    obtain ⟨E, s₁, hE, -, -, hsp, hsto, -⟩ := issueStepC_ok h\n    have hsep := hsep (.inl ⟨c, i, region, dst, rfl⟩)\n    have hsep' : ∀ e ∈ reg, e.Live s → E.internal ≠ e.guarded := fun e hm hl heq =>\n      hsep e hm E (List.mem_of_getElem? hE) hl\n        (by show s.flat.Active E.internal; rw [heq]; exact hl) heq.symm\n    have hw₁ : WF3 s₁.flat := wf3_after_view hk.1.1.1\n      (show ViewStep ((KernelOp.split E.internal [region]).Step k) c s (.ok s₁) from hsp)\n      fun t' hR => by\n        have hR' : SplitStep k E.internal [region] (s.view c) (.ok t') := hR\n        refine ⟨split_preserves_wf3 (SC.wf3_view hk.1.1.1 hw) hR', ?_⟩\n        obtain ⟨-, rfl⟩ := Guarded.ok_iff.1 hR'; rfl\n    exact kernel_syncState hsto trivial (fun _ _ e => by cases e) (fun _ e => by cases e) hw₁ hw'\n      (kernel_syncState hsp hsep' (fun _ _ e => by cases e) (fun _ e => by cases e) hw hw₁ hs)\n  | @reset s reg ar c i st' h =>\n    obtain ⟨E, s₁, hE, hd, hrl, -, -⟩ := resetStepC_ok (k := k) h\n    have hsep := hsep (.inr ⟨c, i, rfl⟩)\n    have hsep' : ∀ e ∈ reg, e.Live s → E.internal ≠ e.guarded := fun e hm hl heq =>\n      hsep e hm E (List.mem_of_getElem? hE) hl\n        (by show s.flat.Active E.internal; rw [heq]; exact hl) heq.symm\n    have hw₁ : WF3 s₁.flat := wf3_after_view hk.1.1.1\n      (show ViewStep ((KernelOp.derive E.internal (footprint s.P E.storage) .modify).Step k) c s\n        (.ok s₁) from hd)\n      fun t' hR => by\n        have hR' : DeriveStep E.internal (footprint s.P E.storage) .modify (s.view c) (.ok t') := hR\n        refine ⟨derive_preserves_wf3 (SC.wf3_view hk.1.1.1 hw) hR', ?_⟩\n        obtain ⟨-, rfl⟩ := Guarded.ok_iff.1 hR'; rfl\n    exact kernel_syncState hrl trivial (fun _ _ e => by cases e) (fun _ e => by cases e) hw₁ hw'\n      (kernel_syncState hd hsep' (fun _ _ e => by cases e) (fun _ e => by cases e) hw hw₁ hs)\n\n/-! ## A transfer onto a live mutex value is rejected (WC4 S18, C21.7; Spec 1 §63.3) -/\n\n/-- WC4 S18 (C21.7 with Spec 1 §63.3): under `SyncState`, a `transfer` whose destination contains\nthe mutex value of a live entry is rejected, its controller leaf being `Init`. Positive twins:\n`Ern.Concurrency.EncapTraces.invA`, `Ern.Concurrency.EncapTraces.invB`. -/\n5:theorem spawnEff_facts {reg : SyncReg} {s : SC} {c : Nat} {ps : List Nat} {ls : LocalShape}\n9:  .of (skel_enter rfl hpar) (pskel_shapeP hsh)\n13:theorem yield_get {t : SC} {ps : List Nat} {f j : Nat} :\n14:    (yieldEff t ps f).A[j]? = (t.A[j]?).map (yieldF ps f j) := by\n21:theorem yield_excl {L : MutexLayout} {reg : SyncReg} {t : SC} {ps : List Nat} {f src : Nat}\n22:    (hs : SyncState L (yieldEff t ps f) reg) (hx : TransferExcl L (t, reg) src) :\n23:    TransferExcl L (yieldEff t ps f, reg) src := by\n26:  cases hy : (yieldEff t ps f).A[e.guarded]? with\n35:    have hA : (yieldEff t ps f).A[e.guarded]? = t.A[e.guarded]? := by\n39:      change (yieldEff t ps f).A[e.guarded]? = some z at hz","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"821e04f2-faf4-4a9e-9c5f-147ba5e049a5","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"27647a40-268e-404f-9a67-391253731fb1","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"cla