{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","hash":"082a588b789063cc576205be8267545f8c0f9735ba6d34960984e61ee65208e5","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"La fermeture se ramène désormais à l'abstraction `Skel`, qui couvre les autorités existantes comme les nouvelles. J'écris le module pour l'obtenir à chaque genre, pas composés compris.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QrdLHYQHCuHnNJVTXeqmhY","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && grep -n \"theorem yield_get\\|theorem spawnEff_facts\\|^namespace\\|^end \\|theorem src_none\\|theorem chain_congr\\|theorem skel_sameA\" Ern/Concurrency/SyncInit.lean Ern/Concurrency/SyncPreserve.lean Ern/MemoryModel/Access/*.lean Ern/Concurrency/*.lean | head -30; sed -n 602,612p Ern/Concurrency/SyncPreserve.lean; sed -n 809,825p Ern/Concurrency/SyncInit.lean; grep -n \"theorem deriveSync_excluded\" -A 8 Ern/Concurrency/SyncPreserve.lean","description":"Locate helper lemmas and namespaces"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
