{"parentUuid":"c9bdc0af-6bb5-4c71-9d4a-3a8363250551","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ad10e2fd-52be-47f7-a4f7-932245537372","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F4cKqxHPfoTDxFRVZPeDQi","type":"tool_result","content":"32:def Dying (s s' : SC) (l : Nat) : Prop := isLeaf s.P l ∧ s.flat.Usable l ∧ ¬ s'.flat.Usable l\n34:/-- Decidability of `Dying`. -/\n35:instance (s s' : SC) (l : Nat) : Decidable (Dying s s' l) := by unfold Dying; infer_instance\n43:leaves that die (`Dying`; §70, §73 effects), the wider notion the model has (`FreedLeaf`,\n58:    l ∈ footprint st.1.P p ∨ Dying st.1 (st.1.set (endUseEff (st.1.view c) p)) l\n59:  | .kernel c (.free p _), l => Dying st.1 (st.1.set (freeEff (st.1.view c) p)) l\n60:  | .kernel c .exit, l => Dying st.1 (exitEffC st.1 c) l\n61:  | .terminate c, l => Dying st.1 (termEffC st.1 c) l\nErn/Concurrency/SyncInit.lean:303:    (hh₀ : HoldSame s s') (hP : PSkel s.P s'.P)\nErn/Concurrency/SyncPreserve.lean:372:    (hP : PSkel s.P s'.P) (hb : e.guarded < s'.A.length) (hh : HoldSame s s') {ctl : Nat}\nErn/Concurrency/SyncPreserve.lean:391:    (hh : HoldSame s s') (hP : PSkel s.P s'.P) (hw : WF3 s.flat) (hw' : WF3 s'.flat)\nErn/Concurrency/SyncPreserve.lean:591:  pskel : PSkel s.P s'.P\nErn/Concurrency/SyncPreserve.lean:597:    (hP : PSkel s.P s'.P) (hsrc : ∀ e ∈ reg, e.Live s → ∀ j y' o, s'.A[j]? = some y' →\nErn/Concurrency/SyncPreserve.lean:958:    (hh : HoldSame s s') (hP : PSkel s.P s'.P) (hw : WF3 s.flat) (hw' : WF3 s'.flat)\nErn/Concurrency/SyncPreserve.lean:1182:    (hP : PSkel s.P s'.P) (hb : e.guarded < s'.A.length) (hh : HoldSame s s') {ctl : Nat}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"042bcf2e-b9ee-408f-bc3e-328cfe62bb55","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:06:53.309Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"32:def Dying (s s' : SC) (l : Nat) : Prop := isLeaf s.P l ∧ s.flat.Usable l ∧ ¬ s'.flat.Usable l\n34:/-- Decidability of `Dying`. -/\n35:instance (s s' : SC) (l : Nat) : Decidable (Dying s s' l) := by unfold Dying; infer