{"parentUuid":"632ae9ba-158f-422d-8d16-67b4bebcac32","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgystp1HShRUxPWpzL9yu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BnamUntv2Zzz95yuK4SVMH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/Dying.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\nadd='''\n/-! ## No other context has a capacity on a dying leaf -/\n\n/-- The second fact of the brief of the complement, task 3, for one step from `st` to `st'`: in the\nstate before the step, no context other than the acting one has a `cap5` (WC5.2 C43) on a leaf\nthat dies in the step. -/\ndef OtherCapFree (st : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbl : Label) (st' : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) :\n    Prop :=\n  ∀ c' ∈ List.range st.1.C.length, c' ≠ lbl.ctx → ∀ l ∈ List.range st.1.P.length,\n    Dying st.1 st'.1 l → cap5 st.1 st.2.1 c' l = none\n\n/-- Decidability of `OtherCapFree`. -/\ninstance (st : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbl : Label) (st' : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) :\n    Decidable (OtherCapFree st lbl st') := by\n  unfold OtherCapFree; infer_instance\n\nopen CapacityWitness in\n/-- Brief of the complement, task 3, the two facts on the four witnesses of the exceptions of\nslice 3: in each, the protected leaf that dies belongs to an entry that dies with the step (the\nfirst fact does not apply), and no context other than the acting one has a `cap5` on a leaf that\ndies (`endUse(M)`, `free(R)`, `exitFrame`, `terminate`). -/\ntheorem exc_dying_facts :\n    ¬ (⟨3, none⟩ : SyncEntry).Live ClassifyWitness.ce1 ∧\n    OtherCapFree (ClassifyWitness.ceσ 3) (.kernel 0 (.endUse 0)) (ClassifyWitness.ceσ 4) ∧\n    ¬ (⟨4, none⟩ : SyncEntry).Live fr6 ∧ OtherCapFree (frσ 6) (.kernel 0 (.free 2 0)) (frσ 7) ∧\n    ¬ (⟨3, none⟩ : SyncEntry).Live ex5 ∧ OtherCapFree (exσ 5) (.kernel 0 .exit) (exσ 6) ∧\n    ¬ (⟨3, none⟩ : SyncEntry).Live tm5 ∧ OtherCapFree (tmσ 5) (.terminate 1) (tmσ 6) ∧\n    cap5 tm4 exReg 0 4 = none := by\n  decide\n\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap'''\nassert s.count('\\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap')==1\ns=s.replace('\\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap', add, 1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ntime ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/Dying.lean 2>&1 | head -30","description":"Add dying-leaf checks on witnesses","timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2996,"cache_read_input_tokens":773311,"output_tokens":4247,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":3044},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2996,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":4247,"cache_read_input_tokens":773311,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2996,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2996},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":7315,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01BnamUntv2Zzz95yuK4SVMH":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/Dying.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\nadd='''\n/-! ## No other context has a capacity on a dying leaf -/\n\n/-- The second fact of the brief of the complement, task 3, for one step from `st` to `st'`: in the\nstate before the step, no context other than the acting one has a `cap5` (WC5.2 C43) on a leaf\nthat dies in the step. -/\ndef OtherCapFree (st : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbl : Label) (st' : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) :\n    Prop :=\n  ∀ c' ∈ List.range st.1.C.length, c' ≠ lbl.ctx → ∀ l ∈ List.range st.1.P.length,\n    Dying st.1 st'.1 l → cap5 st.1 st.2.1 c' l = none\n\n/-- Decidability of `OtherCapFree`. -/\ninstance (st : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbl : Label) (st' : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) :\n    Decidable (OtherCapFree st lbl st') := by\n  unfold OtherCapFree; infer_instance\n\nopen CapacityWitness in\n/-- Brief of the complement, task 3, the two facts on the four witnesses of the exceptions of\nslice 3: in each, the protected leaf that dies belongs to an entry that dies with the step (the\nfirst fact does not apply), and no context other than the acting one has a `cap5` on a leaf that\ndies (`endUse(M)`, `free(R)`, `exitFrame`, `terminate`). -/\ntheorem exc_dying_facts :\n    ¬ (⟨3, none⟩ : SyncEntry).Live ClassifyWitness.ce1 ∧\n    OtherCapFree (ClassifyWitness.ceσ 3) (.kernel 0 (.endUse 0)) (ClassifyWitness.ceσ 4) ∧\n    ¬ (⟨4, none⟩ : SyncEntry).Live fr6 ∧ OtherCapFree (frσ 6) (.kernel 0 (.free 2 0)) (frσ 7) ∧\n    ¬ (⟨3, none⟩ : SyncEntry).Live ex5 ∧ OtherCapFree (exσ 5) (.kernel 0 .exit) (exσ 6) ∧\n    ¬ (⟨3, none⟩ : SyncEntry).Live tm5 ∧ OtherCapFree (tmσ 5) (.terminate 1) (tmσ 6) ∧\n    cap5 tm4 exReg 0 4 = none := by\n  decide\n\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap'''\nassert s.count('\\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap')==1\ns=s.replace('\\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap', add, 1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ntime ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/Dying.lean 2>&1 | head -30","description":"Add dying-leaf checks on witnesses","timeout":900000}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01BnamUntv2Zzz95yuK4SVMH":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"26e24024-8f1d-4e97-a730-7ace2dd25042","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgystogCPFbjjNVgn5p4G","requestRef":"66085e63-0552-4c03-ae1f-327f83f69b95","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"83ed63dd-c844-4115-8f7b-ca69754f8e6f","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:11:11.836Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574