following:\n  • `Attr5.active`\n  • `DeriveSyncPre.active`\n  • `Same.active`\n  • `Skel.active`\n  • `Authority.active`\n  • `DerivePre.active`\n  • `PinOb.active`\n  • `ReleasePre.active`\n  • `SameSkel.active`\n  • `SplitPre.active`\n  • `UnpinPre.active`\n  • `Arena.ArenaInv.active`\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/SpawnValCap.lean:77:57: error(lean.invalidField): Invalid field notation: Type of\n  y\nis not known; cannot resolve field `holder`\n\nHint: Consider replacing the field projection with a call to one of the following:\n  • `Same.holder`\n  • `Authority.holder`\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/SpawnValCap.lean:77:68: error(lean.invalidDottedIdent): Invalid dotted identifier notation: The expected type of `.place` could not be determined\n\nHint: Using one of these would be unambiguous:\n  [apply] `FrameOf.place`\n  [apply] `Holder.place`\n  [apply] `PinOb.place`\n  [apply] `FrameOf.below.place`\n  [apply] `S3.Usable.place`\n  [apply] `S3.Usable.below.place`\n~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/SpawnValCap.lean 2>&1  0.19s user 0.35s system 26% cpu 2.052 total\nhead -40  0.00s user 0.00s system 0% cpu 2.052 total","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"cb0b5bd6-8192-4442-a15c-db4cae69d6f3","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToo