,"advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
{"parentUuid":"354e85cc-6d9d-40fb-b362-c72ed3cf403d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ad10e2fd-52be-47f7-a4f7-932245537372","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SU8Fo5g2pHpVQBp2VhHLwc","type":"tool_result","content":"Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Rename/OpsTransfer.lean:207:    srcUsable := (h.usable src).2 hp.srcUsable\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Rename/OpsTransfer.lean:208:    dstUsable := (h.usable dst).2 hp.dstUsable\nErn/Concurrency/ArenaPreserve.lean:319:      exact ⟨{ ha with storageUsable := (hu _).1 ha.storageUsable }, hs⟩⟩\nErn/Concurrency/ArenaPreserve.lean:324:      exact ⟨{ ha with storageUsable := (hu _).2 ha.storageUsable }, hs⟩⟩\n\n/-- The footprint of step `lbl` from state `st` (brief, task 4): the leaves the step reads or\nwrites, or whose initialization state or holder relation it changes. `read3`, `write3`,\n`writeShared`: their leaves (`Label.Access`). `store`: its target (Spec 1 §59, `KernelOp.Writes`;\n§65 effect: the holder of the authority becomes the target). `transfer`: the leaves of the source\n(they become `Moved`) and of the destination (written, §59). `endUse`: the leaves of the place\n(they become `Uninit`, §69) and the leaves that die with it. `free`, `exitFrame`, `terminate`: the\nleaves that die (`Dying`; §70, §73 effects), the wider notion the model has (`FreedLeaf`,\n`EndingLeaf`). `alloc`: the provider (§71.2: its metadata is updated), the owner (holder of the new\nroot, §71) and the fresh leaves. `enterFrame`, `spawn`: the fresh locals. By-value `spawn`: the\nfresh locals and the sources of its transfers. `issue`: its destination (§77: an explicit write to\nthe destination, which holds the block). `newMutex`, `acquire`, `unlock`, `resetLock`: the\ncontroller of their entry, by the declared realization. The other steps (`derive`, `split`,\n`release`, `depend`, `pin`, `unpin`, `join`, `deriveSync`, `newArena`, `reset`) create no physical\naccess by their abstract effect (WC5.1 corrigé C27) and change neither an initialization state, a\nholder nor the life of a place: empty. -/\ndef Touches (L : MutexLayout) (st : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) : Label → Nat → Prop\n  | .kernel _ (.read _ ls), l | .kernel _ (.write _ ls), l | .kernel _ (.writeShared _ ls), l =>\n    l ∈ ls\n  | .kernel _ (.store _ p), l => l = p\n  | .kernel _ (.transfer src dst), l => l ∈ footprint st.1.P src ∨ l ∈ footprint st.1.P dst\n  | .kernel c (.endUse p), l =>\n    l ∈ footprint st.1.P p ∨ Dying st.1 (st.1.set (endUseEff (st.1.view c) p)) l\n  | .kernel c (.free p _), l => Dying st.1 (st.1.set (freeEff (st.1.view c) p)) l\n  | .kernel c .exit, l => Dying st.1 (exitEffC st.1 c) l\n  | .terminate c, l => Dying st.1 (termEffC st.1 c) l\n  | .kernel _ (.alloc pr ow _), l =>\n    l ∈ footprint st.1.P pr ∨ l ∈ footprint st.1.P ow ∨ st.1.P.length ≤ l\n  | .kernel _ (.enter _ _), l | .spawn _ _ _, l => st.1.P.length ≤ l\n  | .spawnVal _ _ _ vs, l => st.1.P.length ≤ l ∨ ∃ v ∈ vs, l ∈ footprint st.1.P v.1\n  | .issue _ _ _ dst, l => l = dst\n  | .newMutex _ g, l => ControlOf L st.1 ⟨g, none⟩ = some l\n  | .acquire _ i, l | .unlock _ i, l | .resetLock _ i, l =>\n    (st.2.1[i]?).bind (ControlOf L st.1) = some l\n  | _, _ => False","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"fca2c152-f63a-4110-86d3-1d02a73361bf","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:37:52.456Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Rename/OpsTransfer.lean:207:    srcUsable := (h.usable src).2 hp.srcUsable\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Rename/OpsTransfer.lean:208:    dstUsable := (h.usable dst).2 hp.dstUsable\nErn/Concurrency/ArenaPreserve.lean:319:      exact ⟨{ ha with storageUsable := (hu _).1 ha.storageUsable }, hs⟩⟩\nErn/Concurrency/ArenaPreserve.lean:324:      exact ⟨{ ha with storageUsable := (hu _).2 ha.storageUsable }, hs⟩⟩\n\n/-- The footprint of step `lbl` from state `st` (brief, task 4): the leaves the step reads or\nwrites, or whose initialization state or holder relation it changes. `read3`, `write3`,\n`writeShared`: their leaves (`Label.Access`). `store`: its target (Spec 1 §59, `KernelOp.Writes`;\n§65 effect: the holder of the authority becomes the target). `transfer`: the leaves of the source\n(they become `Moved`) and of the destination (written, §59). `endUse`: the leaves of the place\n(they become `Uninit`, §69) and the leaves that die with it. `free`, `exitFrame`, `terminate`: the\nleaves that die (`Dying`; §70, §73 effects), the wider notion the model has (`FreedLeaf`,\n`EndingLeaf`). `alloc`: the provider (§71.2: its metadata is updated), the owner (holder of the new\nroot, §71) and the fresh leaves. `enterFrame`, `spawn`: the fresh locals. By-value `spawn`: the\nfresh locals and the sources of its transfers. `issue`: its destination (§77: an explicit write to\nthe destination, which holds the block). `newMutex`, `acquire`, `unlock`, `resetLock`: the\ncontroller of their entry, by the declared realization. The other steps (`derive`, `split`,\n`release`, `depend`, `pin`, `unpin`, `join`, `deriveSync`, `newArena`, `reset`) create no physical\naccess by their abstract effect (WC5.1 corrigé C27) and change neither an initialization state, a\nholder nor the life of a place: empty. -/\ndef Touches (L : MutexLayout) (st : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) : Label → Nat → Prop\n  | .kernel _ (.read _ ls), l | .kernel _ (.write _ ls), l | .kernel _ (.writeShared _ ls), l =>\n    l ∈ ls\n  | .kernel _ (.store _ p), l => l = p\n  | .kernel _ (.transfer src dst), l => l ∈ footprint st.1.P src ∨ l ∈ footprint st.1.P dst\n  | .kernel c (.endUse p), l =>\n    l ∈ footprint st.1.P p ∨ Dying st.1 (st.1.set (endUseEff (st.1.view c) p)) l\n  | .kernel c (.free p _), l => Dying st.1 (st.1.set (freeEff (st.1.view c) p)) l\n  | .kernel c .exit, l => Dying st.1 (exitEffC st.1 c) l\n  | .terminate c, l => Dying st.1 (termEffC st.1 c) l\n  | .kernel _ (.alloc pr ow _), l =>\n    l ∈ footprint st.1.P pr ∨ l ∈ footprint st.1.P ow ∨ st.1.P.length ≤ l\n  | .kernel _ (.enter _ _), l | .spawn _ _ _, l => st.1.P.length ≤ l\n  | .spawnVal _ _ _ vs, l => st.1.P.length ≤ l ∨ ∃ v ∈ vs, l ∈ footprint st.1.P v.1\n  | .issue _ _ _ dst, l => l = dst\n  | .newMutex _ g, l => ControlOf L st.1 ⟨g, none⟩ = some l\n  | .acquire _ i, l | .unlock _ i, l | .resetLock _ i, l =>\n    (st.2.1[i]?).bind (ControlOf L st.1) = some l\n  | _, _ => False","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"dc544261-80d9-427a-865a-5b41d6a99a7f","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"354e85cc-6d9d-40fb-b362-c72ed3cf403d","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
