{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","hash":"5226a2e2151ce36585d72733e2676909e2cb13dd05f6d6b29c665a8bdb4f30c6","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011T129HthKAhvTSUmGpfbpZ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && S=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6/scratchpad; cat > $S/T6.lean <<'EOF'\nimport Ern\nopen Ern.MemoryModel Ern.MemoryModel.Access Ern.Concurrency Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap\nopen Ern.Concurrency.Corpus\nopen Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.Witness (instDecidableEncap5R)\nopen Ern.Concurrency.Traces (L0)\nexample : GuardedRead.gr1 = x4 := rfl\nexample : GuardedChain.gc7 = GuardedChain.gc6 := rfl\nexample : GuardedStore.gs8 = GuardedStore.gs7 := rfl\nexample : EncapFull KM L0 (GuardedStore.gs6, GuardedStore.sreg, []) (.acquire 1 0) (GuardedStore.gs7, GuardedStore.sregG, []) ∧ LStep KM L0 (.acquire 1 0) (GuardedStore.gs6, GuardedStore.sreg, []) (GuardedStore.gs7, GuardedStore.sregG, []) := by\n  refine ⟨by decide, .acquire ⟨by decide, ⟨3, none⟩, rfl, by decide, by decide, rfl⟩⟩\nexample : EncapFull KM L0 (GuardedStore.gs7, GuardedStore.sregG, []) (.kernel 1 (.read 6 [3])) (GuardedStore.gs8, GuardedStore.sregG, []) := by decide\nEOF\n~/.elan/bin/lake env lean $S/T6.lean 2>&1 | head -30","description":"Retry with rfl and full EncapFull","timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
