ude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"0cd6ac5d-2684-4e83-baeb-6d9b2ca75511","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:43:45.957Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
{"parentUuid":"0cd6ac5d-2684-4e83-baeb-6d9b2ca75511","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ad10e2fd-52be-47f7-a4f7-932245537372","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01137Rm7zDwwkVmLfwS2qLdT","type":"tool_result","content":"## 54. Anchor Ordering and Absence of Orphan Rights\n\n`AnchorOrder` and `AnchorOrderHeld` are defined in Section 44. `NoDangling` prohibits an **active** authority from covering a leaf belonging to an unusable place; the invariant does not say that a leaf is initialized. `NoOrphan` requires every active authority held by a place to be connected to a frame in the stack through a **finite, non-repeating chain** of authorities: the first link is held by a live frame, and each active link **structurally covers the entirety** of the place holding the next link. The link need not have an effective mode over that place. `NoOrphan` guarantees neither the exercisability of all stored authorities nor freedom from blocking.\n\n## 55. ArenaInv — Invariant of the Arena Abstraction\n\n`ArenaInv` is an invariant of the **library contract**, not an additional predicate of kernel state. For every live arena:\n\n- `storage` designates an existing, usable place; the footprint of `internal` is exactly the footprint of `storage`;\n- `internal` is active, with own mode `Modify`, held by the arena value;\n- available leaves and issued regions belong to the administered storage;\n- two still-active issuances have disjoint regions; no leaf of a still-issued region simultaneously belongs to `available`;\n- every still-issued block authority is a derivative of `internal` complying with exclusivity and validity rules;\n- anchor and ownership restrictions are respected.\n\nArena entries do not, by themselves, constitute an additional storage owner. Two live arenas may cover common leaves when their `internal` authorities are distinct and their effective rights are compatible; no **global** disjointness of arena footprints is imposed.\n\n\n/-! ## The creation phase and the transfer phases -/\n\n/-- A leaf of the footprint of `q` is `q` or one of its parts (Spec 1 §40), so not below it. -/\ntheorem fp_ge {P : List Place} {q l : Nat} (h : l ∈ footprint P q) : q ≤ l := by\n  obtain ⟨-, -, -, h | h⟩ := mem_footprint.1 h\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Refinement.lean-2707-  unfold CoversUsable; infer_instance\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Refinement.lean-2708-\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Refinement.lean-2709-/-- Bounded `NoDangling` (§54). -/\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Refinement.lean:2710:def NoDanglingCheck (s : S3) : Prop :=\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean-102-def Inv3base (s : S3) : Prop := I1 s ∧ I2 s ∧ I3 s ∧ I4 s\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean-103-\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean-104-/-- `NoDangling` (§54): no active authority covers a leaf of an unusable place. -/\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean:105:def NoDangling (s : S3) : Prop :=\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Transfer.lean-184-private instance (s : S3) : Decidable (I3B s) := by unfold I3B; infer_instance\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Transfer.lean-185-","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"93a2651d-ec78-4ee0-b89d-38429b74ebb3","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:43:46.760Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## 54. Anchor Ordering and Absence of Orphan Rights\n\n`AnchorOrder` and `AnchorOrderHeld` are defined in Section 44. `NoDangling` prohibits an **active** authority from covering a leaf belonging to an unusable place; the invariant does not say that a leaf is initialized. `NoOrphan` requires every active authority held by a place to be connected to a frame in the stack through a **finite, non-repeating chain** of authorities: the first link is held by a live frame, and each active link **structurally covers the entirety** of the place holding the next link. The link need not have an effective mode over that place. `NoOrphan` guarantees neither the exercisability of all stored authorities nor freedom from blocking.\n\n## 55. ArenaInv — Invariant of the Arena Abstraction\n\n`ArenaInv` is an invariant of the **library contract**, not an additional predicate of kernel state. For every live arena:\n\n- `storage` designates an existing, usable place; the footprint of `internal` is exactly the footprint of `storage`;\n- `internal` is active, with own mode `Modify`, held by the arena value;\n- available leaves and issued regions belong to the administered storage;\n- two still-active issuances have disjoint regions; no leaf of a still-issued region simultaneously belongs to `available`;\n- every still-issued block authority is a derivative of `internal` complying with exclusivity and validity rules;\n- anchor and ownership restrictions are respected.\n\nArena entries do not, by themselves, constitute an additional storage owner. Two live arenas may cover common leaves when their `internal` authorities are distinct and their effective rights are compatible; no **global** disjointness of arena footprints is imposed.\n\n\n/-! ## The creation phase and the transfer phases -/\n\n/-- A leaf of the footprint of `q` is `q` or one of its parts (Spec 1 §40), so not below it. -/\ntheorem fp_ge {P : List Place} {q l : Nat} (h : l ∈ footprint P q) : q ≤ l := by\n  obtain ⟨-, -, -, h | h⟩ := mem_footprint.1 h\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Refinement.lean-2707-  unfold CoversUsable; infer_instance\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Refinement.lean-2708-\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Refinement.lean-2709-/-- Bounded `NoDangling` (§54). -/\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Refinement.lean:2710:def NoDanglingCheck (s : S3) : Prop :=\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean-102-def Inv3base (s : S3) : Prop := I1 s ∧ I2 s ∧ I3 s ∧ I4 s\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean-103-\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean-104-/-- `NoDangling` (§54): no active authority covers a leaf of an unusable place. -/\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean:105:def NoDangling (s : S3) : Prop :=\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Transfer.lean-184-private instance (s : S3) : Decidable (I3B s) := by unfold I3B; infer_instance\nformal/Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Transfer.lean-185-","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"16b5f256-a9f0-4049-abb9-f94f74188d9d","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0cd6ac5d-2684-4e83-baeb-6d9b2ca75511","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
