{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","hash":"94fe998a5f2c458b97a96c49112693d9a5c3509238f0e90976c3efbd94c612ff","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Citations check out (§54 is `NoDangling`, §40 places and leaves; §56 is not cited). Adding the corollary."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TdcskuZv8GE34Nx5chjF5t","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/DyingCap.lean","old_string":"      he5 (h i hi).2 hdrop).symm\n\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap","new_string":"      he5 (h i hi).2 hdrop).symm\n\n/-- `OtherCapFree`, the decidable form checked by the sweep, holds at every step of a `RunFull`\nfrom the initial state under `DDSound` (brief of the complement, task 3, second fact). -/\ntheorem otherCapFree_run {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {statics : Statics}\n    {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg} {lbls : List Label} (hdd : DDSound k)\n    (hstat : StaticsOK statics) (h0 : σ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init statics), [], []))\n    (h : RunFull k L σ lbls) {i : Nat} (hi : i < lbls.length) :\n    OtherCapFree (σ i) lbls[i] (σ (i + 1)) :=\n  fun _ _ hc' _ _ hd => other_cap_dying_run hdd hstat h0 h hi hc' hd\n\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01H7tK8BXJdmFaiacxbjXCfF","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && ~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build completed\" | head; S=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6/scratchpad; cat > $S/AxNew.lean <<'EOF'\nimport Ern\nopen Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap\n#print axioms otherCapFree_run\n#print axioms Sweep.sweep_kill\n#print axioms Replay.sweep_replay\n#print axioms Replay.W_GR_full\n#print axioms Replay.W_GC_full\n#print axioms Replay.W_GS_full\n#print axioms Replay.W_GS_2_3_local\n#print axioms Replay.mutex_full\n#print axioms Replay.distinct_full\n#print axioms Replay.wc4_full\n#print axioms Replay.endUseM_full\n#print axioms Replay.endUseSlot_full\n#print axioms Replay.W_C22_3b_twin_full\n#print axioms Replay.S17a_twin_full\nEOF\n~/.elan/bin/lake env lean $S/AxNew.lean","description":"Build and print axioms of new theorems","timeout":1800000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
