{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","hash":"3c7f1d2f08d907efe4b45532c131d1c453cd9114718a361a6f5c2e9e1f89b153","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The brief wants W-GS steps 2–3 presented as local verification, since they depend on state from the excluded step. I'm fixing that docstring, then collecting theorem line numbers for the report.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019yreprQ9i6exF2vfrHWDcv","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/Replay.lean","old_string":"encapsulation admits. The corpus v14 gives no verdict for these two steps under the complete\nencapsulation (only `ok` at the kernel, v6 §2 sexies); this is a fact obtained, not an expected\none. -/","new_string":"encapsulation admits, as the brief of the complement, task 6, expects for the rest of the trace.\nBoth depend on the state produced by the excluded step 1 (`z2` held by `T`): this is a local\nverification, not an execution. -/"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Mx9dPKpzn3GwgY6fNMXxUL","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && ~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build completed\"; for f in AbandonedGrant Closure Dying DyingCap SpawnValCap LastAcquire ComplementSweep Replay; do echo \"== $f\"; grep -nE \"^(theorem|def|instance|abbrev|structure)\" Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/$f.lean | sed -E 's/^([0-9]+):(theorem|def|instance|abbrev|structure) ([^ ]*).*/\\1 \\2 \\3/'; done 2>&1 | head -200","description":"Rebuild and list declarations with lines","timeout":1800000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
