{"parentUuid":"2d5d2abf-1f13-43e2-91ec-65b9e98a9b58","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ad10e2fd-52be-47f7-a4f7-932245537372","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015J6mVMUoGQdjjF4ZmtqkA1","type":"tool_result","content":"open Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.GuardedStore\n\n/-- The named states of the twin of W-GS (`W_GS_twin_trace5R`). -/\ndef gsTwinσ (i : Nat) : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg :=\n  [(gs0, [], []), (gs1, [], []), (gs2, [], []), (gs2, sreg, []), (gs3, sreg, []), (gs4, sreg, []),\n    (gs5, sreg, []), (gt6, sregG, []), (gt7, sregG, []),\n    (Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.PlaceExclWitness.gt8, sreg, [])].getD i\n    (Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.PlaceExclWitness.gt8, sreg, [])\n\n/-- The labels of the twin of W-GS. -/\ndef gsTwinLbls : List Label := setupLbls ++ [.acquire 0 0] ++ [.kernel 0 (.store 4 3)] ++\n  [.unlock 0 0]\n\n/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` v6 §2 sexies, twin of W-GS (`acquire(e)`, `store(z2, T)` under the grant,\n`unlock(e)`), restated with named states, is a `Run6` from the initial state. -/","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"008a224a-b435-4714-80d8-441778e54c94","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:49:39.939Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"open Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.GuardedStore\n\n/-- The named states of the twin of W-GS (`W_GS_twin_trace5R`). -/\ndef gsTwinσ (i : Nat) : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg :=\n  [(gs0, [], []), (gs1, [], []), (gs2, [], []), (gs2, sreg, []), (gs3, sreg, []), (gs4, sreg, []),\n    (gs5, sreg, []), (gt6, sregG, []), (gt7, sregG, []),\n    (Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.PlaceExclWitness.gt8, sreg, [])].getD i\n    (Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.PlaceExclWitness.gt8, sreg, [])\n\n/-- The labels of the twin of W-GS. -/\ndef gsTwinLbls : List Label := setupLbls ++ [.acquire 0 0] ++ [.kernel 0 (.store 4 3)] ++\n  [.unlock 0 0]\n\n/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` v6 §2 sexies, twin of W-GS (`acquire(e)`, `store(z2, T)` under the grant,\n`unlock(e)`), restated with named states, is a `Run6` from the initial state. -/","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":f