{"parentUuid":"6c01df01-4744-4af5-9ce8-fc41017e89a8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ad10e2fd-52be-47f7-a4f7-932245537372","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013fpgvoSkbWgiQFxBE2RsXF","type":"tool_result","content":"69:reached by the admitted prefix of the suite. Suite: `MX₄`, then steps 2 and 3, is a `RunFull`\n113:guard-free forms (`Exer5` of `z` passes through the live `guarded`), its state being reached by\n142:state being reached by the admitted setup. Positive suite: the twin (`c0 : acquire(e)`, then","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"2dbaf733-7354-4756-aacf-c6e8c584a781","timestamp":"2026-11-12T23:49:55.849Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"69:reached by the admitted prefix of the suite. Suite: `MX₄`, then steps 2 and 3, is a `RunFull`\n113:guard-free forms (`Exer5` of `z` passes through the live `guarded`), its state being reached by\n142:state being reached by the admitted setup. Positive suite: the twin (`c0 : acquire(e)`, then","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/Replay.lean","hunks":[{"oldStart":70,"oldLines":7,"newStart":70,"newLines":7,"lines":[" from the initial state; step 1 leaves the state unchanged (`gr1 = x4`), so the suite is the"," trace of the corpus without it. -/"," theorem W_GR_full : opStepC KM (.read 3 [3]) 1 x4 (.ok GuardedRead.gr1) ∧ GuardedRead.gr1 = x4 ∧","-    ¬ PremG KM L0 (x4, regX, []) (.kernel 1 (.read 3 [3])) ∧","+    ¬ PremG KM L0 (x4, regX, []) (.kernel 1 (.read 3 [3])) ∧ wrσ 5 = (x4, regX, []) ∧","     wrσ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init mxst), [], []) ∧ RunFull KM L0 wrσ wrLbls := by","   have h : Steps5R KM L0 [(x2, regX, []), (x3, regX, []), (x4, regX, []), (wr5, wrReg, []),","       (wr6, wrReg, [])]"]},{"oldStart":80,"oldLines":7,"newStart":80,"newLines":7,"lines":["     .cons (by decide) (.spawn ⟨by decide, .ok (by decide)⟩) <|","     .cons (by decide) (.acquire ⟨by decide, ⟨3, none⟩, rfl, by decide, by decide, rfl⟩) <|","     .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) .nil","-  exact ⟨GuardedRead.W_GR_1_ok, rfl, by decide, rfl,","+  exact ⟨GuardedRead.W_GR_1_ok, rfl, by decide, rfl, rfl,","     runFull_of_run7 (run7_of_run5R ((ClassifyWitness.mx3_steps h).run _) (by decide))","       (by decide)⟩"," "]},{"oldStart":115,"oldLines":7,"newStart":115,"newLines":7,"lines":[" `read3(Y)` via `z`, through the grant), is a `RunFull` from the initial state; step 1 leaves the"," state unchanged (`gc7 = gc6`), so the suite is the trace of the corpus without it. -/"," theorem W_GC_full : opStepC KM (.read 3 [4]) 1 gc6 (.ok gc7) ∧ gc7 = gc6 ∧","-    ¬ PremG KM L0 (gc6, greg, []) (.kernel 1 (.read 3 [4])) ∧","+    ¬ PremG KM L0 (gc6, greg, []) (.kernel 1 (.read 3 [4])) ∧ cgσ 7 = (gc6, greg, []) ∧","     cgσ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init zst), [], []) ∧ RunFull KM L0 cgσ cgLbls := by","   have h : Steps5R KM L0 [(gc0, [], []), (gc1, [], []), (gc2, [], []), (gc3, [], []),","       (gc4, [], []), (gc4, greg, []), (gc5, greg, []), (gc6, greg, []), (cg7, cgReg, []),"]},{"oldStart":130,"oldLines":7,"newStart":130,"newLines":7,"lines":["     .cons (by decide) (.acquire ⟨by decide, ⟨4, none⟩, rfl, by decide, by decide, rfl⟩) <|","     .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) <|","     .cons (by decide) (.kernel ⟨by decide, _, .ok (by decide), rfl⟩) .nil","-  exact ⟨gc_read.2, rfl, by decide, rfl,","+  exact ⟨gc_read.2, rfl, by decide, rfl, rfl,","     runFull_of_run7 (run7_of_run5R (h.run _) (by decide)) (by decide)⟩"," "," /-! ## W-GS -/"]},{"oldStart":143,"oldLines":9,"newStart":143,"newLines":10,"lines":[" `store(z2, T)` under the grant) is a `RunFull` from the initial state, as the corpus v14 expects. -/"," theorem W_GS_full : opStepC KM (.store 4 3) 0 gs5 (.ok gs6) ∧","     ¬ PremG KM L0 (gs5, sreg, []) (.kernel 0 (.store 4 3)) ∧","+    MutexReal.NonRegression.gsTwinσ 6 = (gs5, sreg, []) ∧","     MutexReal.NonRegression.gsTwinσ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init GuardedChain.zst), [], []) ∧","     RunFull KM L0 MutexReal.NonRegression.gsTwinσ MutexReal.NonRegression.gsTwinLbls :=","-  ⟨W_GS_1_ok, by decide, rfl, NonRegression.runAmF_traces_full.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.1⟩","+  ⟨W_GS_1_ok, by decide, rfl, rfl, NonRegression.runAmF_traces_full.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.1⟩"," "," open Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.GuardedStore in"," /-- W-GS, steps 2 and 3 on the states of the corpus trace, after the excluded step 1: `c1 :"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/Replay.lean"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"6a0f1318-1d2d-4515-8249-83cd419c0efe","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6c01df01-4744-4af5-9ce8-fc41017e89a8","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
