{"parentUuid":"207be4e1-3e02-4b49-96ee-e45d4546b0a2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgywNC5wKP9WQwFopKm2K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018E8pZyDNioVkCxrstu5niV","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"M=/Users/guygouri/.claude/projects/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/memory; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='/Users/guygouri/.claude/projects/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/memory/ern-formal-mm02-exploration.md'\nlines=open(p).read().split('\\n')\ni=[k for k,l in enumerate(lines) if l.startswith('- Spec 2 jalon 4, slice 3, complete encapsulation C22.6')][0]\nnew=(\"- Spec 2 jalon 4, slice 3 complement (2026-11-13, corpus v14 §2 terdecies): owner decisions = task 5 restated as three cases, \"\n\"reanchor is not an issuance (C22.1), \\\"entrée vivante\\\" = live before and after. Eight more `FullEncap` modules \"\n\"(AbandonedGrant W-AG/W-AG-J/W-AG′, Closure `closure_run`, Dying + DyingCap, SpawnValCap `spawnVal_cap_pre`, \"\n\"LastAcquire `three_cases`/`last_acquire`/`protected_cap_run`, ComplementSweep, Replay), commits 857972e..1d53130, \"\n\"report section « Complément » in `formal/reports/spec2-m4-encap.md`. All proved; form (2′) not needed (composites create \"\n\"only in phase 1); task 3(ii) is a short corollary of L1 `cap5_drop_own` via `run5R_take`. Library refusals show as \"\n\"\\\"no ok outcome\\\", not `reject` (D-C1). Still open: general lemma for which kinds kill leaves (only decide on 46 traces), \"\n\"§78.1, C46 ordering (W-AG races, W-AG-J ordered by join), safe-interface enforcement. Audit: 2796 theorems / 1861 non-internal. \"\n\"Lesson: list every positive trace by grepping trace types (EncapsulatedTrace*, Run5*, Run6/7, LRun) before claiming a replay is complete; \"\n\"`sed -i ''` on macOS has no `\\\\|` in basic regex.\")\nlines.insert(i+1,new)\nopen(p,'w').write('\\n'.join(lines))\nq='/Users/guygouri/.claude/projects/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/memory/MEMORY.md'\ns=open(q).read()\na=\"slice 3 complete encapsulation (FullEncap, RunFull, task 5 refuted), reports/\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"slice 3 complete encapsulation (FullEncap, RunFull, task 5 refuted) and its complement (corpus v14, three cases proved, closure, dying leaves via L1), reports/\")\nopen(q,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -c \"slice 3 complement\" $M/ern-formal-mm02-exploration.md; cat $M/MEMORY.md | head -2 | cut -c1-400","description":"Add the complement pass to memory and index"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":357,"cache_read_input_tokens":346573,"output_tokens":1099,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":357,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1099,"cache_read_input_tokens":346573,"cache_creation_input_tokens":357,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":357},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":8791,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_018E8pZyDNioVkCxrstu5niV":{"command":"M=/Users/guygouri/.claude/projects/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/memory; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='/Users/guygouri/.claude/projects/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/memory/ern-formal-mm02-exploration.md'\nlines=open(p).read().split('\\n')\ni=[k for k,l in enumerate(lines) if l.startswith('- Spec 2 jalon 4, slice 3, complete encapsulation C22.6')][0]\nnew=(\"- Spec 2 jalon 4, slice 3 complement (2026-11-13, corpus v14 §2 terdecies): owner decisions = task 5 restated as three cases, \"\n\"reanchor is not an issuance (C22.1), \\\"entrée vivante\\\" = live before and after. Eight more `FullEncap` modules \"\n\"(AbandonedGrant W-AG/W-AG-J/W-AG′, Closure `closure_run`, Dying + DyingCap, SpawnValCap `spawnVal_cap_pre`, \"\n\"LastAcquire `three_cases`/`last_acquire`/`protected_cap_run`, ComplementSweep, Replay), commits 857972e..1d53130, \"\n\"report section « Complément » in `formal/reports/spec2-m4-encap.md`. All proved; form (2′) not needed (composites create \"\n\"only in phase 1); task 3(ii) is a short corollary of L1 `cap5_drop_own` via `run5R_take`. Library refusals show as \"\n\"\\\"no ok outcome\\\", not `reject` (D-C1). Still open: general lemma for which kinds kill leaves (only decide on 46 traces), \"\n\"§78.1, C46 ordering (W-AG races, W-AG-J ordered by join), safe-interface enforcement. Audit: 2796 theorems / 1861 non-internal. \"\n\"Lesson: list every positive trace by grepping trace types (EncapsulatedTrace*, Run5*, Run6/7, LRun) before claiming a replay is complete; \"\n\"`sed -i ''` on macOS has no `\\\\|` in basic regex.\")\nlines.insert(i+1,new)\nopen(p,'w').write('\\n'.join(lines))\nq='/Users/guygouri/.claude/projects/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/memory/MEMORY.md'\ns=open(q).read()\na=\"slice 3 complete encapsulation (FullEncap, RunFull, task 5 refuted), reports/\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"slice 3 complete encapsulation (FullEncap, RunFull, task 5 refuted) and its complement (corpus v14, three cases proved, closure, dying leaves via L1), reports/\")\nopen(q,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -c \"slice 3 complement\" $M/ern-formal-mm02-exploration.md; cat $M/MEMORY.md | head -2 | cut -c1-400","description":"Add the complement pass to memory and index"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"2bfb2a1b-b89e-4ea7-9a22-d48b85b3c53e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgywNBqYiSkecwr6Hgree","requestRef":"b0020434-c0f5-4edd-bef8-530a198c885f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"1312a659-36c7-480b-8677-3f04513c7754","t