{"parentUuid":"0b635344-e3f2-4388-abe9-5b750802f47f","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/DyingCap.lean","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/DyingCap.lean","content":"import Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.LastAcquire\n\n/-!\n# No other context has a capacity on a dying leaf\n\nBrief of milestone 4, slice 3, complement, task 3, second fact (`corpus-spec2-m3.md` v14\n§2 terdecies, \"Feuilles qui meurent\"): in the state before a step of a context `c`, no context\nother than `c` has a `cap5` (WC5.2 C43) on a leaf that dies in the step.\n\nAfter the step, no context has a `cap5` on such a leaf: an attaining authority would be active\nand cover it, against `NoDangling` (Spec 1 §54) after the step. A context other than `c` with a\n`cap5` before the step would then have lost it in a step of `c`, which L1 forbids\n(`cap5_drop_own`, WC5.2 C45, proved for the 28 kinds on `EncapsulatedTrace5`, which every prefix\nof a `RunFull` is).\n-/\n\nset_option autoImplicit false\n\nnamespace Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap\n\nopen Ern.MemoryModel Ern.MemoryModel.Access Ern.Concurrency Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal\nopen SyncPreserveAux SyncInitAux TransferPreserveAux\n\n/-- After a step, no context has a `cap5` on a leaf that died in it, when `NoDangling` holds after\nthe step (Spec 1 §54) and the step keeps leaves leaves (`PSkel`). -/\ntheorem cap5_none_after {s s' : SC} {reg : SyncReg} {c l : Nat} (hP : PSkel s.P s'.P)\n    (hnd : NoDangling s'.flat) (hd : Dying s s' l) : cap5 s' reg c l = none := by\n  cases hc : cap5 s' reg c l with\n  | none => rfl\n  | some m =>\n    exfalso\n    have hal : Allows (cap5 s' reg c l) .observe := by rw [hc]; exact Or.inl rfl\n    obtain ⟨x, -, -, hex⟩ := cap5_attained hal\n    obtain ⟨z, hz, za, hlz, -⟩ := eff_present (ne_none_of_allows hex)\n    obtain ⟨hleaf, hu, hu'⟩ := hd\n    have hlt := hu.lt\n    have hleaf' : isLeaf s'.P l := (hP.isLeaf hlt).2 hleaf\n    have hmem : l ∈ footprint s'.flat.P l :=\n      (Arena.mem_footprint_leaf hleaf' (Nat.lt_of_lt_of_le hlt hP.1)).2 rfl\n    exact hnd x z hz za l hu' l hmem hlz\n\n/-- A prefix of a `RunFull` is a `Run5R`. -/\ntheorem run5R_take {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunFull k L σ lbls) (n : Nat) : Run5R k L σ (lbls.take n) :=\n  fun i hi => by\n    have hi' : i < lbls.length := by simp at hi; omega\n    have e : (lbls.take n)[i] = lbls[i] := List.getElem_take\n    rw [e]\n    exact ⟨(h i hi').1.1.1, (h i hi').2⟩\n\n/-- Brief of the complement, task 3, second fact: on a `RunFull` from the initial state, under\n`DDSound`, in the state before a step, no context other than the acting one has a `cap5` on a\nleaf that dies in the step. Invariants and results used: `NoDangling` after the step (Spec 1\n§54), `PSkel` of the step, and L1 (`cap5_drop_own`, WC5.2 C45). -/\ntheorem other_cap_dying_run {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {statics : Statics}\n    {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg} {lbls : List Label} (hdd : DDSound k)\n    (hstat : StaticsOK statics) (h0 : σ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init statics), [], []))\n    (h : RunFull k L σ lbls) {i : Nat} (hi : i < lbls.length) {c' l : Nat}\n    (hc' : c' ≠ lbls[i].ctx) (hd : Dying (σ i).1 (σ (i + 1)).1 l) :\n    cap5 (σ i).1 (σ i).2.1 c' l = none := by\n  obtain ⟨hk, hlib⟩ := runFull_inv hdd hstat h0 h (Nat.le_of_lt hi)\n  obtain ⟨hk', -⟩ := runFull_inv hdd hstat h0 h hi\n  obtain ⟨-, hP⟩ := shape_step hk hlib.2.1 (h i hi).1.1.1.1.1 (h i hi).2\n  have hafter := cap5_none_after (reg := (σ (i + 1)).2.1) (c := c') hP hk'.1.2.1.2.2 hd\n  cases hb : cap5 (σ i).1 (σ i).2.1 c' l with\n  | none => rfl\n  | some m =>\n    exfalso\n    have htr5R := run5R_trace (run5R_take h i)\n    have hlen : (lbls.take i).length = i := by simp; omega\n    rw [hlen, h0] at htr5R\n    have htr := encapsulatedTrace5C_imp (encapsulatedTrace5R_imp htr5R)\n    have he5C := (h i hi).1.1.1.1\n    have he5 : Encap5 L ((σ i).1, (σ i).2.1) lbls[i] :=\n      ⟨he5C.1, chainExcl_guardedExcl he5C.2.1, he5C.2.2⟩\n    have hdrop : capRank (cap5 (σ (i + 1)).1 (σ (i + 1)).2.1 c' l) <\n        capRank (cap5 (σ i).1 (σ i).2.1 c' l) := by\n      rw [hafter, hb]; cases m <;> decide\n    exact hc' (cap5_drop_own hdd statics (lbls.take i) (σ i) (σ (i + 1)) lbls[i] c' l hstat htr\n      he5 (h i hi).2 hdrop).symm\n\n/-- `OtherCapFree`, the decidable form checked by the sweep, holds at every step of a `RunFull`\nfrom the initial state under `DDSound` (brief of the complement, task 3, second fact). -/\ntheorem otherCapFree_run {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {statics : Statics}\n    {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg} {lbls : List Label} (hdd : DDSound k)\n    (hstat : StaticsOK statics) (h0 : σ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init statics), [], []))\n    (h : RunFull k L σ lbls) {i : Nat} (hi : i < lbls.length) :\n    OtherCapFree (σ i) lbls[i] (σ (i + 1)) :=\n  fun _ _ hc' _ _ hd => other_cap_dying_run hdd hstat h0 h hi hc' hd\n\nend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap\n","numLines":92,"startLine":1,"totalLines":92}},"displayPath":"Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/DyingCap.lean","savedCopyFraming":{"enveloped":false}},"type":"attachment","uuid":"b100dee0-8324-49ff-95f7-95daa918e8d0","timestamp":"2026-11-13T01:25:46.462Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/DyingCap.lean\"}\n</system-reminder>"},{"content":"<system-reminder>\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\timport Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.LastAcquire\n2\t\n3\t/-!\n4\t# No other context has a capacity on a dying leaf\n5\t\n6\tBrief of milestone 4, slice 3, complement, task 3, second fact (`corpus-spec2-m3.md` v14\n7\t§2 terdecies, \"Feuilles qui meurent\"): in the state before a step of a context `c`, no context\n8\tother than `c` has a `cap5` (WC5.2 C43) on a leaf that dies in the step.\n9\t\n10\tAfter the step, no context has a `cap5` on such a leaf: an attaining authority would be active\n11\tand cover it, against `NoDangling` (Spec 1 §54) after the step. A context other than `c` with a\n12\t`cap5` before the step would then have lost it in a step of `c`, which L1 forbids\n13\t(`cap5_drop_own`, WC5.2 C45, proved for the 28 kinds on `EncapsulatedTrace5`, which every prefix\n14\tof a `RunFull` is).\n15\t-/\n16\t\n17\tset_option autoImplicit false\n18\t\n19\tnamespace Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap\n20\t\n21\topen Ern.MemoryModel Ern.MemoryModel.Access Ern.Concurrency Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal\n22\topen SyncPreserveAux SyncInitAux TransferPreserveAux\n23\t\n24\t/-- After a step, no context has a `cap5` on a leaf that died in it, when `NoDangling` holds after\n25\tthe step (Spec 1 §54) and the step keeps leaves leaves (`PSkel`). -/\n26\ttheorem cap5_none_after {s s' : SC} {reg : SyncReg} {c l : Nat} (hP : PSkel s.P s'.P)\n27\t    (hnd : NoDangling s'.flat) (hd : Dying s s' l) : cap5 s' reg c l = none := by\n28\t  cases hc : cap5 s' reg c l with\n29\t  | none => rfl\n30\t  | some m =>\n31\t    exfalso\n32\t    have hal : Allows (cap5 s' reg c l) .observe := by rw [hc]; exact Or.inl rfl\n33\t    obtain ⟨x, -, -, hex⟩ := cap5_attained hal\n34\t    obtain ⟨z, hz, za, hlz, -⟩ := eff_present (ne_none_of_allows hex)\n35\t    obtain ⟨hleaf, hu, hu'⟩ := hd\n36\t    have hlt := hu.lt\n37\t    have hleaf' : isLeaf s'.P l := (hP.isLeaf hlt).2 hleaf\n38\t    have hmem : l ∈ footprint s'.flat.P l :=\n39\t      (Arena.mem_footprint_leaf hleaf' (Nat.lt_of_lt_of_le hlt hP.1)).2 rfl\n40\t    exact hnd x z hz za l hu' l hmem hlz\n41\t\n42\t/-- A prefix of a `RunFull` is a `Run5R`. -/\n43\ttheorem run5R_take {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\n44\t    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunFull k L σ lbls) (n : Nat) : Run5R k L σ (lbls.take n) :=\n45\t  fun i hi => by\n46\t    have hi' : i < lbls.length := by simp at hi; omega\n47\t    have e : (lbls.take n)[i] = lbls[i] := List.getElem_take\n48\t    rw [e]\n49\t    exact ⟨(h i hi').1.1.1, (h i hi').2⟩\n50\t\n51\t/-- Brief of the complement, task 3, second fact: on a `RunFull` from the initial state, under\n52\t`DDSound`, in the state before a step, no context other than the acting one has a `cap5` on a\n53\tleaf that dies in the step. Invariants and results used: `NoDangling` after the step (Spec 1\n54\t§54), `PSkel` of the step, and L1 (`cap5_drop_own`, WC5.2 C45). -/\n55\ttheorem other_cap_dying_run {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {statics : Statics}\n56\t    {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg} {lbls : List Label} (hdd : DDSound k)\n57\t    (hstat : StaticsOK statics) (h0 : σ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init statics), [], []))\n58\t    (h : RunFull k L σ lbls) {i : Nat} (hi : i < lbls.length) {c' l : Nat}\n59\t    (hc' : c' ≠ lbls[i].ctx) (hd : Dying (σ i).1 (σ (i + 1)).1 l) :\n60\t    cap5 (σ i).1 (σ i).2.1 c' l = none := by\n61\t  obtain ⟨hk, hlib⟩ := runFull_inv hdd hstat h0 h (Nat.le_of_lt hi)\n62\t  obtain ⟨hk', -⟩ := runFull_inv hdd hstat h0 h hi\n63\t  obtain ⟨-, hP⟩ := shape_step hk hlib.2.1 (h i hi).1.1.1.1.1 (h i hi).2\n64\t  have hafter := cap5_none_after (reg := (σ (i + 1)).2.1) (c := c') hP hk'.1.2.1.2.2 hd\n65\t  cases hb : cap5 (σ i).1 (σ i).2.1 c' l with\n66\t  | none => rfl\n67\t  | some m =>\n68\t    exfalso\n69\t    have htr5R := run5R_trace (run5R_take h i)\n70\t    have hlen : (lbls.take i).length = i := by simp; omega\n71\t    rw [hlen, h0] at htr5R\n72\t    have htr := encapsulatedTrace5C_imp (encapsulatedTrace5R_imp htr5R)\n73\t    have he5C := (h i hi).1.1.1.1\n74\t    have he5 : Encap5 L ((σ i).1, (σ i).2.1) lbls[i] :=\n75\t      ⟨he5C.1, chainExcl_guardedExcl he5C.2.1, he5C.2.2⟩\n76\t    have hdrop : capRank (cap5 (σ (i + 1)).1 (σ (i + 1)).2.1 c' l) <\n77\t        capRank (cap5 (σ i).1 (σ i).2.1 c' l) := by\n78\t      rw [hafter, hb]; cases m <;> decide\n79\t    exact hc' (cap5_drop_own hdd statics (lbls.take i) (σ i) (σ (i + 1)) lbls[i] c' l hstat htr\n80\t      he5 (h i hi).2 hdrop).symm\n81\t\n82\t/-- `OtherCapFree`, the decidable form checked by the sweep, holds at every step of a `RunFull`\n83\tfrom the initial state under `DDSound` (brief of the complement, task 3, second fact). -/\n84\ttheorem otherCapFree_run {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {statics : Statics}\n85\t    {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg} {lbls : List Label} (hdd : DDSound k)\n86\t    (hstat : StaticsOK statics) (h0 : σ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init statics), [], []))\n87\t    (h : RunFull k L σ lbls) {i : Nat} (hi : i < lbls.length) :\n88\t    OtherCapFree (σ i) lbls[i] (σ (i + 1)) :=\n89\t  fun _ _ hc' _ _ hd => other_cap_dying_run hdd hstat h0 h hi hc' hd\n90\t\n91\tend Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap\n92\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
{"parentUuid":"b100dee0-8324-49ff-95f7-95daa918e8d0","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern.lean","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern.lean","content":"-- This module serves as the root of the `Ern` library.\n-- Import modules here that should be built as part of the library.\nimport Ern.Concurrency.ArenaConservativity\nimport Ern.Concurrency.ArenaPreserve\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Cap\nimport Ern.Concurrency.CapDrop\nimport Ern.Concurrency.CapPreserve\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Conservativity\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.AR\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.ARRealize\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.CapValues\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.Encap5Witness\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.PlaceExclWitness\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.Frames\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.GuardedChain\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.GuardedChainC\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.GuardedRead\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.GuardedStore\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.L1Evidence\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.Handoff\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.HandoffEvents\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.MX\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.MutexEdge\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.MutexEdgeStrict\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.ResetLockRight\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.S10\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.S10b\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.S10Seq\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.Witness\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Context\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Encap5\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Encap5C\nimport Ern.Concurrency.Encap5R\nimport Ern.Concurrency.EncapTraces\nimport Ern.Concurrency.EventModel.Closure\nimport Ern.Concurrency.EventModel.Graph\nimport Ern.Concurrency.EventModel.Lemmas\nimport Ern.Concurrency.EventModel.Witness\nimport Ern.Concurrency.EventModel.Complements\nimport Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.Graph\nimport Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.Coherence\nimport Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.Classify\nimport Ern.Co