{"parentUuid":"503c53fa-cb7e-440f-b12d-76da899b9f86","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"af17f01e-fb36-4c87-8f58-dbe0f151d425","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AdjNB6vN1QV6rxkpfaAT53","type":"tool_result","content":"Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:223:`Usable` (§40), `FrameOf` (§40), `OwnedIn` (§40) and `ExercisableAt` (§43) are inductive\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:375:/-! ## Usable places (§40) -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:377:/-- `Usable(s, p)` (§40, items 1–3): `p` exists, is not marked dead, and its owner is a frame of\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:379:inductive S3.Usable (s : S3) : Nat → Prop where\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:381:      pl.owner = .frame f → f ∈ s.F → S3.Usable s q\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:383:      pl.owner = .place o → S3.Usable s o → S3.Usable s q\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:386:theorem S3.Usable.lt {s : S3} {q : Nat} (h : s.Usable q) : q < s.P.length := by\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:389:/-- One step of `Usable` read on a Boolean premise (decision procedure for §40). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:420:/-- Soundness of the iteration for `Usable` (decision procedure for §40). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:421:theorem usable_of_kiter (s : S3) : ∀ k q, kiter (usableR s) k q = true → s.Usable q\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:435:/-- `Usable` is computed by `|P| + 1` steps of `usableR` (decision procedure for §40). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:437:    s.Usable q ↔ kiter (usableR s) (s.P.length + 1) q = true := by\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:448:/-- Decidability of `Usable` (§40). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:449:instance (s : S3) (q : Nat) : Decidable (s.Usable q) := decidable_of_iff _ usable_iff.symm\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:454:  | .place p => s.Usable p\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:825:def AnchorOrder (s : S3) : Prop := ∀ q, s.Usable q → ∀ x ∈ s.D q, EffAnchorOK s x (s.pframe q)\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:829:    ∀ q ∈ List.range s.P.length, s.Usable q → ∀ x ∈ s.D q, EffAnchorOK s x (s.pframe q) :=\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:838:  ∀ q, s.Usable q → ∀ (x : Nat) (y : Authority), s.A[x]? = some y → y.active = true →\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:844:    ∀ q ∈ List.range s.P.length, s.Usable q → ∀ x ∈ List.range s.A.length,\n    SweepOK L0 agσ agLbls ∧ SweepOK L0 ajσ ajLbls ∧ SweepOK L0 apσ apLbls := by\n  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_,\n    ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> decide\n\n/-- The kinds whose effect may make a leaf unusable (brief of the complement, task 3, \"which\nkinds kill leaves\"): `endUse` (Spec 1 §69), `free` (§70), `exitFrame` (§73) and `terminate`\n(WC5.2 C7). -/\ndef killKind : Label → Bool\n  | .kernel _ (.endUse _) | .kernel _ (.free _ _) | .kernel _ .exit | .terminate _ => true\n  | _ => false\n\n/-- At every step of a run, a leaf dies only in a step of one of the kinds of `killKind`. -/\ndef KillOK (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbls : List Label) : Prop :=\n  ∀ i (h : i < lbls.length), ∀ l ∈ List.range (σ i).1.P.length, Dying (σ i).1 (σ (i + 1)).1 l →\n    killKind lbls[i] = true\n\n/-- Decidability of `KillOK`. -/\ninstance (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbls : List Label) : Decidable (KillOK σ lbls) := by\n  unfold KillOK; infer_instance\n\n/-- Brief of the complement, task 3, on the traces of `sweep`: no step outside `endUse`, `free`,\n`exitFrame` and `terminate` kills a leaf. -/\ntheorem sweep_kill :\n    KillOK hoσ hoLbls ∧ KillOK ho2σ ho2Lbls ∧ KillOK ho3σ ho3Lbls ∧ KillOK hojσ hojLbls ∧\n    KillOK ho3jσ ho3jLbls ∧ KillOK lcσ lcLbls ∧ KillOK rl0σ rl0Lbls ∧ KillOK rlσ rlLbls ∧\n    KillOK rljσ rljLbls ∧ KillOK trσ trLbls ∧ KillOK trjσ trjLbls ∧ KillOK s11σ s11Lbls ∧\n    KillOK cvσ cvLbls ∧ KillOK ceσ ceLbls ∧ KillOK crσ crLbls ∧ KillOK gsTwinσ gsTwinLbls ∧\n    KillOK s3σ s3Lbls ∧ KillOK s10σ s10Lbls ∧ KillOK AmendWitness.tsσ AmendWitness.tsLbls ∧\n    KillOK AmendWitness.tiσ AmendWitness.tiLbls ∧ KillOK AmendWitness.taσ AmendWitness.taLbls ∧\n    KillOK AmendWitness.tdtσ AmendWitness.tdtLbls ∧ KillOK FinalWitness.amσ FinalWitness.amLbls ∧\n    KillOK AmendWitness.tdσ AmendWitness.tdLbls ∧","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"7300fd13-4edc-4baa-8888-99bae9330508","timestamp":"2026-11-13T01:26:02.353Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:223:`Usable` (§40), `FrameOf` (§40), `OwnedIn` (§40) and `ExercisableAt` (§43) are inductive\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:375:/-! ## Usable places (§40) -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:377:/-- `Usable(s, p)` (§40, items 1–3): `p` exists, is not marked dead, and its owner is a frame of\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:379:inductive S3.Usable (s : S3) : Nat → Prop where\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:381:      pl.owner = .frame f → f ∈ s.F → S3.Usable s q\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:383:      pl.owner = .place o → S3.Usable s o → S3.Usable s q\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:386:theorem S3.Usable.lt {s : S3} {q : Nat} (h : s.Usable q) : q < s.P.length := by\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:389:/-- One step of `Usable` read on a Boolean premise (decision procedure for §40). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:420:/-- Soundness of the iteration for `Usable` (decision procedure for §40). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:421:theorem usable_of_kiter (s : S3) : ∀ k q, kiter (usableR s) k q = true → s.Usable q\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:435:/-- `Usable` is computed by `|P| + 1` steps of `usableR` (decision procedure for §40). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:437:    s.Usable q ↔ kiter (usableR s) (s.P.length + 1) q = true := by\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:448:/-- Decidability of `Usable` (§40). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:449:instance (s : S3) (q : Nat) : Decidable (s.Usable q) := decidable_of_iff _ usable_iff.symm\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:454:  | .place p => s.Usable p\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:825:def AnchorOrder (s : S3) : Prop := ∀ q, s.Usable q → ∀ x ∈ s.D q, EffAnchorOK s x (s.pframe q)\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:829:    ∀ q ∈ List.range s.P.length, s.Usable q → ∀ x ∈ s.D q, EffAnchorOK s x (s.pframe q) :=\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:838:  ∀ q, s.Usable q → ∀ (x : Nat) (y : Authority), s.A[x]? = some y → y.active = true →\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean:844:    ∀ q ∈ List.range s.P.length, s.Usable q → ∀ x ∈ List.range s.A.length,\n    SweepOK L0 agσ agLbls ∧ SweepOK L0 ajσ ajLbls ∧ SweepOK L0 apσ apLbls := by\n  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_,\n    ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> decide\n\n/-- The kinds whose effect may make a leaf unusable (brief of the complement, task 3, \"which\nkinds kill leaves\"): `endUse` (Spec 1 §69), `free` (§70), `exitFrame` (§73) and `terminate`\n(WC5.2 C7). -/\ndef killKind : Label → Bool\n  | .kernel _ (.endUse _) | .kernel _ (.free _ _) | .kernel _ .exit | .terminate _ => true\n  | _ => false\n\n/-- At every step of a run, a leaf dies only in a step of one of the kinds of `killKind`. -/\ndef KillOK (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbls : List Label) : Prop :=\n  ∀ i (h : i < lbls.length), ∀ l ∈ List.range (σ i).1.P.length, Dying (σ i).1 (σ (i + 1)).1 l →\n    killKind lbls[i] = true\n\n/-- Decidability of `KillOK`. -/\ninstance (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbls : List Label) : Decidable (KillOK σ lbls) := by\n  unfold KillOK; infer_instance\n\n/-- Brief of the complement, task 3, on the traces of `sweep`: no step outside `endUse`, `free`,\n`exitFrame` and `terminate` kills a leaf. -/\ntheorem sweep_kill :\n    KillOK hoσ hoLbls ∧ KillOK ho2σ ho2Lbls ∧ KillOK ho3σ ho3Lbls ∧ KillOK hojσ hojLbls ∧\n    KillOK ho3jσ ho3jLbls ∧ KillOK lcσ lcLbls ∧ KillOK rl0σ rl0Lbls ∧ KillOK rlσ rlLbls ∧\n    KillOK rljσ rljLbls ∧ KillOK trσ trLbls ∧ KillOK trjσ trjLbls ∧ KillOK s11σ s11Lbls ∧\n    KillOK cvσ cvLbls ∧ KillOK ceσ ceLbls ∧ KillOK crσ crLbls ∧ KillOK gsTwinσ gsTwinLbls ∧\n    KillOK s3σ s3Lbls ∧ KillOK s10σ s10Lbls ∧ KillOK AmendWitness.tsσ AmendWitness.tsLbls ∧\n    KillOK AmendWitness.tiσ AmendWitness.tiLbls ∧ KillOK AmendWitness.taσ AmendWitness.taLbls ∧\n    KillOK AmendWitness.tdtσ AmendWitness.tdtLbls ∧ KillOK FinalWitness.amσ FinalWitness.amLbls ∧\n    KillOK AmendWitness.tdσ AmendWitness.tdLbls ∧","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"a9be4780-fd7b-4e02-93fc-a79288b6f343","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"503c53fa-cb7e-440f-b12d-76da899b9f86","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
