{"parentUuid":"b461a5c5-08f5-420c-9716-76632202aa27","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"af17f01e-fb36-4c87-8f58-dbe0f151d425","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014UtU93Nbnqmrnz1V4fTGH8","type":"tool_result","content":"Ern/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean:447:theorem newArenaStepC_ok {s : SC} {reg : SyncReg} {ar : ArenaReg} {c st i : Nat}\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-448-    {st' : SC × ArenaReg} (h : NewArenaStepC s reg ar c st i (.ok st')) :\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-449-    s.Live c ∧ NewArenaPreC s reg ar c st i ∧\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-450-      st' = (s, ar ++ [⟨st, i, footprint s.P st, []⟩]) :=\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-451-  ⟨h.1, Guarded.ok_iff.1 h.2⟩\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-452-\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-453-/-- An `ok` outcome of `issue` executed by `c` (Spec 1 §77, Part XIV): the static checks and\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-454-availability, then `split` then `store` executed by `c`, then the metadata update. -/\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean:455:theorem issueStepC_ok {k : K} {s : SC} {ar : ArenaReg} {c i : Nat} {region : List Nat}\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-456-    {dst : Nat} {st' : SC × ArenaReg} (h : IssueStepC k s ar c i region dst (.ok st')) :\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-457-    ∃ E s₁, ar[i]? = some E ∧ Arena.IssueStatic (s.view c) E region dst ∧\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-458-      Arena.Avail E region ∧ opStepC k (.split E.internal [region]) c s (.ok s₁) ∧\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-459-      opStepC k (.store s.A.length dst) c s₁ (.ok st'.1) ∧\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-460-      st'.2 = ar.set i (Arena.issueMeta s.flat E region) := by\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-461-  cases h with\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-462-  | ok hE hst hav hsp hsto => exact ⟨_, _, hE, hst, hav, hsp, hsto, rfl⟩\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-463-\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-464-/-- An `ok` outcome of `reset` executed by `c` (Spec 1 §78, Part XIV): `derive` of `internal` at\n--\nErn/Concurrency/SyncL