{"parentUuid":"27cde3e9-8135-430c-b69a-14d478bdd6d0","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"af17f01e-fb36-4c87-8f58-dbe0f151d425","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015iwrgSer31XKpC3ksu6fC6","type":"tool_result","content":"18:namespace Ern.Concurrency\n26:namespace PreservationAux\n37:theorem view_facts {s : SC} (hk : KInvCA s) (c : Nat) :\n158:theorem set_usable {s : SC} {t : S3} (hmem : ∀ f, f ∈ t.F ↔ f ∈ s.frames) {q : Nat} :\n456:end Releases\n554:end AllocC\n735:theorem set_usable_iff {s : SC} {t : S3} (hP : t.P = s.P) (hd : t.dead = s.dead) {q : Nat} :\n855:end Store\n1119:end EnterS3\n1742:end TransferS3\n1805:end PreservationAux\n1862:namespace DeriveSyncWitness\n1877:end DeriveSyncWitness\n1902:end Ern.Concurrency\n20:namespace Ern.Concurrency\n28:namespace SyncPreserveAux\n50:end SyncPreserveAux\n75:namespace SyncPreserveAux\n203:end SkelLemmas\n629:theorem viewStep_ok {R : S3 → Outcome3 S3 → Prop} {c : Nat} {s s' : SC}\n1300:end SyncPreserveAux\n1306:namespace SyncPreserveWitness\n1345:end SyncPreserveWitness\n1357:end Ern.Concurrency\nErn/Concurrency/TransferPreserve.lean:16:namespace Ern.Concurrency\nErn/Concurrency/TransferPreserve.lean:20:namespace TransferPreserveAux\nErn/Concurrency/TransferPreserve.lean:292:end TransferPreserveAux\nErn/Concurrency/TransferPreserve.lean:327:end Ern.Concurrency\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Alloc.lean:15:namespace Ern.MemoryModel.Access\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Alloc.lean:17:namespace Alloc\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Alloc.lean:247:end Root\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Alloc.lean:316:end Usable\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Alloc.lean:377:end Anchor\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Alloc.lean:572:end Preserve\n  | place hpl hdq ho _ ih => exact .place (by rw [← hP]; exact hpl) (hd _ hdq) ho ih\n\n/-- Usability depends only on places, stack and death markers (§40). -/\ntheorem S3.Usable.congr {s s' : S3} (hP : s'.P = s.P) (hF : s'.F = s.F) (hd : s'.dead = s.dead)\n    {q : Nat} : s'.Usable q ↔ s.Usable q :=\n  ⟨S3.Usable.mono hP (fun f h => hF ▸ h) (fun q h => hd ▸ h),\n   S3.Usable.mono hP.symm (fun f h => hF ▸ h) (fun q h => by rw [hd]; exact h)⟩\n\n/-- Usability carries over between states with the same places, stack and death markers\n(§40). -/\ntheorem S3.Usable.of_eqs {s s' : S3} {q : Nat} (h : s'.Usable q) (hP : s'.P = s.P)\nimport Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.LastAcquire\nimport Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.AbandonedGrant\nimport Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.NonRegression\n\n/-!\n# Sweep of the complement on the `RunFull` traces\n\nBrief of milestone 4, slice 3, complement, tasks 2, 3 and 5: the closure (`ClosureStep`), the\nthree cases of the protected data (`ThreeOK`, at mode `Observe`) and the absence of another\ncontext's capacity on a dying leaf (`OtherCapFree`) are checked by `decide` at every step of the\n`RunFull` traces of the repository, W-AG, W-AG-J and W-AG′ included. Step 7 of W-AG falls in the\nthird case (`W_AG_7_third`).","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9a17453a-5312-4e6d-9760-745b5f38a666","timestamp":"2026-11-13T01:34:04.242Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"18:namespace Ern.Concurrency\n26:namespace PreservationAux\n37:theorem view_facts {s : SC} (hk : KInvCA s) (c : Nat) :\n158:theorem set_usable {s : SC} {t : S3} (hmem : ∀ f, f ∈ t.F ↔ f ∈ s.frames) {q : Nat} :\n456:end Releases\n554:end AllocC\n735:theorem set_usable_iff {s : SC} {t : S3} (hP : t.P = s.P) (hd : t.dead = s.dead) {q : Nat} :\n855:end Store\n1119:end EnterS3\n1742:end TransferS3\n1805:end PreservationAux\n1862:namespace DeriveSyncWitness\n1877:end DeriveSyncWitness\n1902:end Ern.Concurrency\n20:namespace Ern.Concurrency\n28:namespace SyncPreserveAux\n50:end SyncPreserveAux\n75:namespace SyncPreserveAux\n203:end SkelLemmas\n629:theorem viewStep_ok {R : S3 → Outcome3 S3 → Prop} {c : Nat} {s s' : SC}\n1300:end SyncPreserveAux\n1306:namespace SyncPreserveWitness\n1345:end SyncPreserveWitness\n1357:end Ern.Concurrency\nErn/Concurrency/TransferPreserve.lean:16:namespace Ern.Concurrency\nErn/Concurrency/TransferPreserve.lean:20:namespace TransferPreserveAux\nErn/Concurrency/TransferPreserve.lean:292:end TransferPreserveAux\nErn/Concurrency/TransferPreserve.lean:327:end Ern.Concurrency\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Alloc.lean:15:namespace Ern.MemoryModel.Access\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Alloc.lean:17:namespace Alloc\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Alloc.lean:247:end Root\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Alloc.lean:316:end Usable\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Alloc.lean:377:end Anchor\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Preserve/Alloc.lean:572:end Preserve\n  | place hpl hdq ho _ ih => exact .place (by rw [← hP]; exact hpl) (hd _ hdq) ho ih\n\n/-- Usability depends only on places, stack and death markers (§40). -/\ntheorem S3.Usable.congr {s s' : S3} (hP : s'.P = s.P) (hF : s'.F = s.F) (hd : s'.dead = s.dead)\n    {q : Nat} : s'.Usable q ↔ s.Usable q :=\n  ⟨S3.Usable.mono hP (fun f h => hF ▸ h) (fun q h => hd ▸ h),\n   S3.Usable.mono hP.symm (fun f h => hF ▸ h) (fun q h => by rw [hd]; exact h)⟩\n\n/-- Usability carries over between states with the same places, stack and death markers\n(§40). -/\ntheorem S3.Usable.of_eqs {s s' : S3} {q : Nat} (h : s'.Usable q) (hP : s'.P = s.P)\nimport Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.LastAcquire\nimport Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.AbandonedGrant\nimport Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.NonRegression\n\n/-!\n# Sweep of the complement on the `RunFull` traces\n\nBrief of milestone 4, slice 3, complement, tasks 2, 3 and 5: the closure (`ClosureStep`), the\nthree cases of the protected data (`ThreeOK`, at mode `Observe`) and the absence of another\ncontext's capacity on a dying leaf (`OtherCapFree`) are checked by `decide` at every step of the\n`RunFull` traces of the repository, W-AG, W-AG-J and W-AG′ included. Step 7 of W-AG falls in the\nthird case (`W_AG_7_third`).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"39265acc-e64a-456b-b689-2