`killKind`\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/KillKinds.lean:100:13: error: unsolved goals\ncase free\nk : K\nc : Nat\ns s' : SC\nhkill : sorry () = false\nq : Nat\nhq : s.flat.Usable q\np a : Nat\nh : opStepC k (KernelOp.free p a) c s (Outcome3.ok s')\nhnt : ∀ (src dst : Nat), KernelOp.free p a ≠ KernelOp.transfer src dst\nhne : ∀ (ps : List Nat) (ls : LocalShape), KernelOp.free p a ≠ KernelOp.enter ps ls\n⊢ s'.flat.Usable q\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/KillKinds.lean:152:45: error(lean.unknownIdentifier): Unknown identifier `killKind`\n\nNote: It is not possible to treat `killKind` as an implicitly bound variable here because the `autoImplicit` option is set to `false`.\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/KillKinds.lean:178:16: error: don't know how to synthesize implicit argument `dst`\n  @transfer_usable_frameOwned (t.view c) v.fst ?m.63 v.snd hpre.dstUsable (hown v List.mem_cons_self)\ncontext:\nk : K\nfin : S3\nc : Nat\nt : SC\nv : Nat × Nat\nvs : List (Nat × Nat)\nhpre : ValTransferPre k fin t c v.fst v.snd\nhrest : ValTransfersPre k fin c (transferEffC t c v.fst v.snd) vs\nhk : KBase t\nhown : ∀ (v_1 : Nat × Nat), v_1 ∈ v :: vs → FrameOwned t.P v_1.snd\nq : Nat\nh : t.flat.Usable q\n⊢ Nat\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/KillKinds.lean:178:9: error: failed to infer `have` declaration type\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/KillKinds.lean:177:49: error: unsolved goals\nk : K\nfin : S3\nc : Nat\nt : SC\nv : Nat × Nat\nvs : List (Nat × Nat)\nhpre : ValTransferPre k fin t c v.fst v.snd\n~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/KillKinds.lean 2>&1  0.31s user 0.34s system 34% cpu 1.873 total\nhead -80  0.00s user 0.00s system 0% cpu 1.858 total","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e980df49-6aa5-4cba-ab15-0de2741792e8","timestamp":"2026-11-13T01:35:02.246Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/KillKinds.lean:63:10: warning: `if_neg` has been deprecated: Use `ite_eq_right` instead\n\nHint: Replace the deprecated name:\n  i̵f̵_̵n̵e̵g̵i̲t̲e̲_̲e̲q̲_̲r̲i̲g̲h̲t̲\nErn/Concurrency/Full