K_run`, `:256`) (voir tâche 3) |"," | Contrôle des trois cas | `ThreeOK` (`ComplementSweep:37`), `SweepOK` (`:50`) | `ThreeOK` vérifie la provenance au mode `Observe`, plus faible que `CapFrom` ; le théorème `three_cases` donne le mode exigé |"," | Phases de `spawnVal` | `PhaseRel s c t` (`SpawnValCap:72`) | structure auxiliaire de preuve |"," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"71bd60b8-5408-4109-8f1b-597c80f360ae","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
