{"parentUuid":"9eadf699-0748-42dd-9ff2-d7965bca3065","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"af17f01e-fb36-4c87-8f58-dbe0f151d425","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015rD5qWUxa3vL56kGMLC9pn","type":"tool_result","content":"41:- Spec 2 jalon 4, layer R final pass (2026-11-12): second version of `ERN_WC5_2_amendements_proposes.md` (final C22.4, C18.4, proposed C13.11), corpus v12 §2 undecies; owner decisions: depend clause dropped, `alloc(owner = M)` admitted, provider counts by leaves. Modules `MutexReal/{Final,FinalWitness,FinalNonRegression,Classify7,Classify7Witness,FinalAuthority,FinalCorollaries}`; commits `d51ba8c`..`5148c22`; 2462 theorems (1642 non-internal). `TouchesF` = Touches with alloc owner counted as the place itself (`l = ow`, like store/issue); `CtlRestrF`, `Encap7`, `Run7`; `NewMutexRight` = Write3Pre fields exercisable + effectiveModify on `s.view c`; `RunAmF`. `Run6 → Run7` only under `SyncInv` (C21.3 leaf) or from init: unconditional left « inachevé ». All v12 facts obtained; `alloc(provider = M, owner = lock′)` kernel ok, refused only by definition (`allocEff` ignores the provider). Lesson: never `head`-truncate an enumeration grep (missed 4 newMutex steps in `Traces.lean`); `simp` on `isAtomic`/`relCap` realizes non-internal `eq_1` lemmas that count as new theorems.\n42:- Spec 2 jalon 4, slice 3, complete encapsulation C22.6 (2026-11-12): WC5.2 now cited (`~/Downloads/ERN_WC5_2_Revu_Pour_Validation/ERN_Concurrency_Model_WC5.2.md`), corpus v13 §2 duodecies. Modules `formal/Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/` (Inventory: `Prem`/`PremG`/`EncapFull`/`RunFull`; Witness W-GI, W-RX; NonRegression; Capacity `capacity_run`/`CapReq`; CapacityWitness; Protected; ResetException), report `formal/reports/spec2-m4-encap.md`, commits 67d4a3b..0cbe567. Encoding: guard-free = `Exer5` in place of `ExercisableAt`; resetLock C18.1 exception = `Exer5` over `reg.eraseIdx i`; negative reads (`ParamOriginHidden`) not substituted; exhaustivity by a Lean meta scan (`ScanRights.lean`, scratchpad) from `LStep` constructors. Results: all corpus v13 facts obtained; task 5 corollary (capacity from the grant subtree) REFUTED also on RunFull by an abandoned grant (derivative yielded to a child survives frame exit, reanchored to guarded per Spec 1 §73); dying leaves (endUse/free/exit/terminate) are the only task-4 exception; spawnVal pre-state capacity left inachevé. Audit 2666 theorems / 1767 non-internal, +204/+125. `decide` on these corpus states runs in ~1 s per module.\n43:- Spec 2 jalon 4, slice 3 complement (2026-11-13, corpus v14 §2 terdecies): owner decisions = task 5 restated as three cases, reanchor is not an issuance (C22.1), \"entrée vivante\" = live before and after. Eight more `FullEncap` modules (AbandonedGrant W-AG/W-AG-J/W-AG′, Closure `closure_run`, Dying + DyingCap, SpawnValCap `spawnVal_cap_pre`, LastAcquire `three_cases`/`last_acquire`/`protected_cap_run`, ComplementSweep, Replay), commits 857972e..1d53130, report section « Complément » in `formal/reports/spec2-m4-encap.md`. All proved; form (2′) not needed (composites create only in phase 1); task 3(ii) is a short corollary of L1 `cap5_drop_own` via `run5R_take`. Library refusals show as \"no ok outcome\", not `reject` (D-C1). Still open: general lemma for which kinds kill leaves (only decide on 46 traces), §78.1, C46 ordering (W-AG races, W-AG-J ordered by join), safe-interface enforcement. Audit: 2796 theorems / 1861 non-internal. Lesson: list every positive trace by grepping trace types (EncapsulatedTrace*, Run5*, Run6/7, LRun) before claiming a replay is complete; `sed -i ''` on macOS has no `\\|` in basic regex.\n1:- [ERN formal exploratory passes](ern-formal-mm02-exploration.md) — French briefs, MM-02/MM-03/MM-23/J3/derivability, Spec 2 m1–m3 (WC2–WC4), m4 handoff (WC5, corpus v4–v6, ChainExcl, PlaceExcl), m4 event pass (WC5.1, corpus v8, po/sw/hb), m4 herd7/RC11 litmus pass, m4 strict mutex edge (corpus v9), m4 layer E event fragment (WC5.1 corrigé), m4 layer R mutex realization (corpus v10, 3 controller counterexamples) corrective pass (Run6, proposed C22.4/C18 amendments, W-NC) final pass (Run7, TouchesF, proposed C13.11) and slice 3 complete encapsulation (FullEncap, RunFull, task 5 refuted) and its complement (corpus v14, three cases proved, closure, dying leaves via L1), reports/ never merged, spec in ~/Downloads, axiom rule","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"37d04d0f-0a18-4670-ac6c-a520812cd70e","timestamp":"2026-11-13T01:41:32.048Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"41:- Spec 2 jalon 4, layer R final pass (2026-11-12): second version of `ERN_WC5_2_amendements_proposes.md` (final C22.4, C18.4, proposed C13.11), corpus v12 §2 undecies; owner decisions: depend clause dropped, `alloc(owner = M)` admitted, provider counts by leaves. Modules `MutexReal/{Final,FinalWitness,FinalNonRegression,Classify7,Classify7Witness,FinalAuthority,FinalCorollaries}`; commits `d51ba8c`..`5148c22`; 2462 theorems (1642 non-internal). `TouchesF` = Touches with alloc owner counted as the place itself (`l = ow`, like store/issue); `CtlRestrF`, `Encap7`, `Run7`; `NewMutexRight` = Write3Pre fields exercisable + effectiveModify on `s.view c`; `RunAmF`. `Run6 → Run7` only under `SyncInv` (C21.3 leaf) or from init: unconditional left « inachevé ». All v12 facts obtained; `alloc(provider = M, owner = lock′)` kernel ok, refused only by definition (`allocEff` ignores the provider). Lesson: never `head`-truncate an enumeration grep (missed 4 newMutex steps in `Traces.lean`); `simp` on `isAtomic`/`relCap` realizes non-internal `eq_1` lemmas that count as new theorems.\n42:- Spec 2 jalon 4, slice 3, complete encapsulation C22.6 (2026-11-12): WC5.2 now cited (`~/Downloads/ERN_WC5_2_Revu_Pour_Validation/ERN_Concurrency_Model_WC5.2.md`), corpus v13 §2 duodecies. Modules `formal/Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/` (Inventory: `Prem`/`PremG`/`EncapFull`/`RunFull`; Witness W-GI, W-RX; NonRegression; Capacity `capacity_run`/`CapReq`; CapacityWitness; Protect