 -/\n78:def regX : SyncReg := [⟨3, none⟩]\n79-/-- MX step 4: `o1 := derive(root_M, Observe, {slot, lock})`, authority 4 (O1). -/\n80:def x3 : SC := x2.set (deriveEff (x2.view 0) 0 [1, 2] .observe)\n81-/-- MX step 4: `spawn c1` yielding `o1` (WC4 C4): context 1, initial frame 1, parent frame 0. -/\n82:def x4 : SC := spawnEff x3 0 [4] []\n83-\n84-/-- The steps of block MX (`corpus-spec2-m3.md` §0): each is an `ok` step; `ControlOf(e)` is\n85-`lock`. -/\n--\n164:def x4w : SC := x4.set (write3Eff (x4.view 1) [2])\n165-\n166-/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` §1 S5b, `ok noyau` (O11.1, O11.2), outside C22.4 and classed under OB-C05:\n167-from `MX₄`, `writeShared(lock)` via `o1` by context 1 outside `acquire`/`unlock` is an `ok` kernel\n--\n200:def x10 : SC := enterEffC x9 1 [6] []\n201-/-- `f2 : write3(T)` via `g′` (O10). -/\n202:def x11 : SC := x10.set (write3Eff (x10.view 1) [3])\n203-\n204-/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` §1 S8, positive twin, `ok`: `enterFrame f2` yielding `g′ := derive(g,\n205-Modify)`, then `write3(T)` via `g′`. -/\n--\n238:def x12 : SC := exitEffC x11 1\n239-/-- `c1 : unlock(e)` (WC4 C17). -/\n240:def x13 : SC := x12.set (releaseEff (x12.view 1) 5)\n241-\n242-/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` §1 S15, positive twin, `ok`: after `write3(T)` via `g′` (`S8_2_ok`),\n243-`exitFrameC(f2)` releases `g′`, and `unlock(e)` succeeds (`g` active, without descendant). -/\n--\n319:def x2w : SC := x2.set (write3Eff (x2.view 0) [2])\n320-\n321-/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` §1 S12, `ok noyau` (O10), outside C22.4 and classed under OB-C05: from\n322-`MX₃`, `write3(lock)` via `root_M` by context 0 is an `ok` kernel step and `Encap` admits it (WC4\n--\n329:def x2a : SC := deriveSyncEff x2 0 3\n330-/-- `c0 : unlock(e)` (WC4 C17). -/\n331:def x2u : SC := x2a.set (releaseEff (x2a.view 0) 4)\n332-\n333-/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` §1 S12, twin, `ok`: in `MX₃`, `acquire(e)` then `unlock(e)` by context 0,\n334-the operations of the protocol. -/","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"64b99b8b-fec8-4764-81e3-adada58b7528