l/Access/Basic.lean-654-\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean-655-/-- Decidability of `Allows` (§43). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean-656-instance (e : Option Mode) (m : Mode) : Decidable (Allows e m) := by\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean-657-  unfold Allows; infer_instance\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean-658-\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Basic.lean-659-/-- Footprint of authority `a` (§42), empty if it does not exist. -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean:105:def NoDangling (s : S3) : Prop :=\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean-106-  ∀ (j : Nat) (y : Authority), s.A[j]? = some y → y.active = true →\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean-107-    ∀ q, ¬ s.Usable q → ∀ l ∈ footprint s.P q, l ∉ y.footprint\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean-108-\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean-109-/-- `Inv3 = I1 ∧ I2 ∧ I3 ∧ I4 ∧ AnchorOrder ∧ NoDangling` (§57). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean-110-def Inv3 (s : S3) : Prop := Inv3base s ∧ AnchorOrder s ∧ NoDangling s\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Invariants.lean-111-\nErn/Concurrency/CapPreserve.lean:20:def capRank : Option Mode → Nat\nErn/Concurrency/CapPreserve.lean-21-  | none => 0\nErn/Concurrency/CapPreserve.lean-22-  | some .observe => 1\nErn/Concurrency/CapPreserve.lean-23-  | some .modify => 2\nErn/Concurrency/CapPreserve.lean-24-\nErn/Concurrency/CapPreserve.lean-25-/-- Step `lbl` is an access by context `d` to leaf `l` requiring mode `m`: `read3` and\nErn/Concurrency/CapPreserve.lean-26-`writeShared` require `Observe` (Spec 1 §66.2, §68.2), `write3` requires `Modify` (§67.1). -/\n--\nErn/Concurrency/CapPreserve.lean:135:theorem eff_present {t : S3} {y l : Nat} (h : effective t y l ≠ none) :\nErn/Concurrency/CapPreserve.lean-136-    ∃ z, t.A[y]? = some z ∧ z.active = true ∧ l ∈ z.footprint ∧ Mode.modify ∉ descModes t y l := by\nErn/Concurrency/CapPreserve.lean-137-  unfold effective at h\nErn/Concurrency/CapPreserve.lean-138-  split at h\nErn/Concurrency/CapPreserve.lean-139-  · rename_i z hz\nErn