{"parentUuid":"345ae5ef-bacf-4167-abab-d88754c69431","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c6363317-3632-459e-8779-ebed992e8329","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019JWKXm2kUydKEYyHeC2vra","type":"tool_result","content":"Ern/Concurrency/Encap5C.lean:155:def Encap5C (L : MutexLayout) (st : SC × SyncReg) (lbl : Label) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5C.lean-156-  Encap L st lbl ∧ ChainExcl st lbl ∧ CtlExcl L st lbl\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5C.lean-157-\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5C.lean-158-/-- `ChainExcl` implies `GuardedExcl`: the argument of an `Exer5` is not a live `guarded`. -/\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5C.lean-159-theorem chainExcl_guardedExcl {st : SC × SyncReg} {lbl : Label} (h : ChainExcl st lbl) :\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5C.lean-160-    GuardedExcl st lbl := by\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5C.lean-161-  cases lbl with\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5C.lean-162-  | kernel c op =>\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5C.lean-163-    cases op <;> simp only [ChainExcl, GuardedExcl] at h ⊢ <;>\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean:49:def Encap5 (L : MutexLayout) (st : SC × SyncReg) (lbl : Label) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-50-  Encap L st lbl ∧ GuardedExcl st lbl ∧ CtlExcl L st lbl\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-51-\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-52-/-- `EncapsulatedTrace5`: a run every step of which satisfies `Encap5` in the state where it is\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-53-taken, of the same form as `EncapsulatedTrace` (WC4 C22, C23). -/\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-54-inductive EncapsulatedTrace5 (k : K) (L : MutexLayout) :\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-55-    SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg → List Label → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg → Prop where\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-56-  | nil {st : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg} : EncapsulatedTrace5 k L st [] st\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5.lean-57-  | cons {st st₁ st₂ : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg} {lbl : Label} {lbls : List Label} :\nErn/Concurrency/Encap5R.lean:116:def Encap5R (k : K) (L : MutexLayout) (st : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbl : Label) : Prop :=