{"parentUuid":"6e065440-6dac-419e-ae05-092ded1ab4dc","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c6363317-3632-459e-8779-ebed992e8329","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KFXFjo4b79j6Bm6emRQtYu","type":"tool_result","content":"Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean:69:def KernelOp.Step (k : K) : KernelOp → S3 → Outcome3 S3 → Prop\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-70-  | .derive src region m => DeriveStep src region m\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-71-  | .split src rs => SplitStep k src rs\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-72-  | .release a => ReleaseStep a\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-73-  | .transfer src dst => TransferStep k src dst\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-74-  | .depend q x => DependStep q x\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-75-  | .enter ps ls => EnterStep ps ls\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-76-  | .exit => ExitStep k\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-77-  | .read a ls => Read3Step a ls\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-78-  | .write a ls => Write3Step a ls\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-79-  | .writeShared a ls => WriteSharedStep k a ls\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-80-  | .pin p => PinStep p\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-81-  | .unpin o => UnpinStep k o\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-82-  | .endUse p => EndUseStep k p\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-83-  | .free p auth => FreeStep k p auth\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-84-  | .alloc pr ow ls => AllocStep k pr ow ls\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-85-  | .store a p => StoreStep a p\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-86-\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-87-/-- A kernel step is the `ok` outcome of some operation O1–O16 (§57, §58). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-88-theorem kstep_iff {k : K} {s s' : S3} : KStep k s s' ↔ ∃ op : KernelOp, op.Step k s (.ok s') := by\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-89-  constructor\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-90-  · intro h\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-91-    cases h with\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean:775:def EndUseStep (k : K) (p : Nat) (s : S3) : Outcome3 S3 → Prop :=\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean-776-  Guarded (EndUsePre k s p) (endUseEff s p)\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean-777-\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean-778-/-! ## O13 `free` (§70) -/\n--\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean:885:def FreeStep (k : K) (p auth : Nat) (s : S3) : Outcome3 S3 → Prop :=\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean-886-  Guarded (FreePre k s p auth) (freeEff s p)\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean-887-\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean-888-/-! ## O14 `alloc` (§71) -/","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"be45cd79-d8f0-4837-9b98-b43cb37d0f35","timestamp":"2026-11-14T08:20:46.205Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Ern/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean:69:def KernelOp.Step (k : K) : KernelOp → S3 → Outcome3 S3 → Prop\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-70-  | .derive src region m => DeriveStep src region m\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-71-  | .split src rs => SplitStep k src rs\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-72-  | .release a => ReleaseStep a\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-73-  | .transfer src dst => TransferStep k src dst\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-74-  | .depend q x => DependStep q x\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-75-  | .enter ps ls => EnterStep ps ls\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-76-  | .exit => ExitStep k\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-77-  | .read a ls => Read3Step a ls\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-78-  | .write a ls => Write3Step a ls\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-79-  | .writeShared a ls => WriteSharedStep k a ls\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-80-  | .pin p => PinStep p\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-81-  | .unpin o => UnpinStep k o\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-82-  | .endUse p => EndUseStep k p\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-83-  | .free p auth => FreeStep k p auth\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-84-  | .alloc pr ow ls => AllocStep k pr ow ls\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-85-  | .store a p => StoreStep a p\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-86-\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-87-/-- A kernel step is the `ok` outcome of some operation O1–O16 (§57, §58). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-88-theorem kstep_iff {k : K} {s s' : S3} : KStep k s s' ↔ ∃ op : KernelOp, op.Step k s (.ok s') := by\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-89-  constructor\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-90-  · intro h\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Main.lean-91-    cases h with\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean:775:def EndUseStep (k : K) (p : Nat) (s : S3) : Outcome3 S3 → Prop :=\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean-776-  Guarded (EndUsePre k s p) (endUseEff s p)\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean-777-\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean-778-/-! ## O13 `free` (§70) -/\n--\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean:885:def FreeStep (k : K) (p auth : Nat) (s : S3) : Outcome3 S3 → Prop :=\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean-886-  Guarded (FreePre k s p auth) (freeEff s p)\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean-887-\nErn/MemoryModel/Access/Ops.lean-888-/-! ## O14 `alloc` (§71) -/","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"031f1bcb-8b10-431b-9994-615140da4143","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6e065440-6dac-419e-ae05-092ded1ab4dc","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","ent