{"parentUuid":"b11bd1a2-7120-437a-aab1-2de82189d2fd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c6363317-3632-459e-8779-ebed992e8329","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012up92yFFZkTR5L2BN6kVeU","type":"tool_result","content":"/-- Theorem 2 (WC4 C20, C23; Spec 1 §57 re-indexed): every inherited operation O1–O16 other than\nO7, executed by a context with an `ok` outcome, preserves `KInvC` with the auxiliaries `KAux` and\n`HeldAnchored` on the flat state, under `DDSound` (Spec 1 §80, used by `split`). Fragment: the\nconcurrent kernel without synchronization; O7 (`exitFrameC`) is not covered here. -/\ntheorem opStepC_preservesC {k : K} (hdd : DDSound k) {s s' : SC} {c : Nat} {op : KernelOp}\n    (hk : KInvCA s) (hnx : op ≠ .exit) (h : opStepC k op c s (.ok s')) : KInvCA s' := by\n  cases op with\n  | exit => exact absurd rfl hnx\n  | transfer src dst =>\n    obtain ⟨-, h⟩ := h; obtain ⟨hpre, rfl⟩ := Guarded.ok_iff.1 h\n    exact transfer_preserves hk hpre\n  | depend q x =>","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"43a21e86-7615-4c16-b7f1-c7c1ce48e2b2","timestamp":"2026-11-14T08:25:29.970Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"/-- Theorem 2 (WC4 C20, C23; Spec 1 §57 re-indexed): every inherited operation O1–O16 other than\nO7, executed by a context with an `ok` outcome, preserves `KInvC` with the auxiliaries `KAux` and\n`HeldAnchored` on the flat state, under `DDSound` (Spec 1 §80, used by `split`). Fragment: the\nconcurrent kernel without synchronization; O7 (`exitFrameC`) is not covered here. -/\ntheorem opStepC_preservesC {k : K} (hdd : DDSound k) {s s' : SC} {c : Nat} {op : KernelOp}\n    (hk : KInvCA s) (hnx : op ≠ .exit) (h : opStepC k op c s (.ok s')) : KInvCA s' := by\n  cases op with\n  | exit => exact absurd rfl hnx\n  | transfer src dst =>\n    obtain ⟨-, h⟩ := h; obtain ⟨hpre, rfl⟩ := Guarded.ok_iff.1 h\n    exact transfer_preserves hk hpre\n  | depend q x =>","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierCont