"entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","hash":"9d24272b53a2f10f695b37a04f543e8ebc6e69da631c33ead11c458913c8a2e3","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Task 4's cheap cases follow from `PremG`, since `store` and `issue` carry a resulting-state right on their target, and the remaining E kinds stay as written limits. I'm now measuring the cost of enumerating extended pairs on one trace for the task-5 sweep.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01U6RPTuVPdLzYYG5XDGVNSu","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && cat > /tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6/scratchpad/S1.lean <<'EOF'\nimport Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtFrontier\nimport Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtWitness\nopen Ern.MemoryModel Ern.MemoryModel.Access Ern.Concurrency Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal\nopen Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExt Ern.Concurrency.Corpus\nopen Ern.Concurrency.Traces (L0)\n\ndef tableOf (k : K) [DecidablePred k.SharedMutable] (L : MutexLayout) (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbls : List Label) :\n    List (Nat × Nat × Nat × Option Nat × Bool × Bool) :=\n  let n := lbls.length\n  let B := (σ n).1.P.length\n  (List.range n).flatMap fun i => (List.range n).flatMap fun j => ((List.range B).filter fun l =>\n    decide (ExtPair k L σ lbls i j l)).map fun l =>\n      (i, j, l, (List.range n).find? (fun r => decide (IsFrontier k σ lbls i j l r)),\n        decide (HandoffOrderedExtAtS k σ L lbls i j l), decide (HBS σ L lbls (.step i) (.step j)))\n\n#eval tableOf KM L0 Corpus.MutexEdge.trσ Corpus.MutexEdge.trLbls\nEOF\ntime ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean /tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6/scratchpad/S1.lean 2>&1 | head","description":"Compute the extended pair table for W-TR","timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
