leaf `T` of entry `e`, live before and after, whose\nrecorded grant `g` is inactive: the capacity of `c1` comes from `x`, whose origin chain is now\n`[guarded, root_T]`, outside the subtree of `g`. Every step is admitted by the complete\nencapsulation: the trace is a `RunFull` from the initial state. -/\ntheorem protected_runFull_refuted : abσ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init mxst), [], []) ∧\n    RunFull KM L0 abσ abLbls ∧ ¬ ProtectedOK L0 (abσ 9) (.kernel 1 (.write 6 [3])) (abσ 10) ∧\n    ¬ ab8.flat.Active 5 ∧ ab8.flat.ancs 6 = [3, 1] ∧ cap5 ab8 abReg 1 3 = some .modify ∧\n    (⟨3, some 5⟩ : SyncEntry).Live ab8 ∧ (⟨3, some 5⟩ : SyncEntry).Live ab9 := by\n  have h : Steps5R KM L0 [(x2, regX, []), (ab3, regX, []), (ab4, regX, []), (ab5, abReg, []),\n27:namespace Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.Protected","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"118e7510-f3f1-4b05-91f2-ccad62b74b75","timestamp":"2026-11-14T08:33:18.336Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"excluded. `MetaRight` over `AV0` and the exercise of `internal0` hold without a live `guarded`;\nthe destination right (Spec 1 §77.2), the target right of the internal `store` (§65.2) and its\nresulting-state right (§65.5) hold only through `guarded`. The trace is no `RunFull`. -/\ntheorem W_GI_1_excluded :\n    MetaRightG (gi6, giReg) 0 ⟨4, 4, [5, 6], []⟩ ∧ Exer5 gi6 giReg 0 4 .modify ∧\n    HasRight (gi6.view 0) .modify 3 ∧ ¬ HasRight5 (gi6, giReg) 0 .modify 3 ∧\n    ¬ HasRight5 (gi7s, giReg) 0 .modify 3 ∧ ¬ HasRight5 (gi7, giReg) 0 .modify 3 ∧\n    ¬ PremG KM L0 (giσ 8) (.issue 0 0 [5] 3) ∧ ¬ RunFull KM L0 giσ giLbls := by\n  have h : ¬ PremG KM L0 (giσ 8) (.issue 0 0 [5] 3) := by decide\n  exact ⟨by decide, by decide, by decide, by decide, by decide, by decide, h,\n    fun hr => h (hr 8 (by decide)).1.2⟩\n/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` v13 §2 duodecies W-RX, step A, excluded by the complete encapsulation:\nthe chain of the right on `slot_n` contains `guarded`, the `guarded` of the other live entry `e`\n(WC5.2 C22 item 6, `resetLock` exception); so does th