"uuid":"49386eb6-af9c-4000-a776-e08c372b3875","timestamp":"2026-11-14T08:34:56.151Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"5\n/-- Brief, task 5, sweep, the traces of the event pass and of the mutex edge: the extended exclusive pairs, their frontier, the\nstrict `hb` from the frontier and from the first member (`SweepExt`). -/\ntheorem sweep_ext_1 :\n    SweepExt KF L0 hoσ hoLbls\n      [(2, 4, 1, 3, false, false), (2, 4, 2, 3, false, false)] ∧\n    SweepExt KF L0 ho2σ ho2Lbls\n      [(3, 5, 0, 4, false, false)] ∧\n    SweepExt KF L0 ho3σ ho3Lbls\n      [(4, 9, 0, 5, false, false)] ∧\n    SweepExt KF L0 hojσ hojLbls\n      [(2, 6, 1, 3, true, true), (2, 6, 2, 3, true, true)] ∧\n    SweepExt KF L0 ho3jσ ho3jLbls\n      [(4, 11, 0, 5, true, true)] ∧\n    SweepExt KM L0 lcσ lcLbls\n      [(4, 7, 2, 5, true, true), (4, 9, 2, 5, true, true), (8, 11, 4, 9, true, true)] ∧\n    SweepExt KM L0 rl0σ rl0Lbls\n      [(2, 5, 2, 3, true, true), (2, 7, 2, 3, true, true), (6, 10, 3, 7, true, true)] ∧\n    SweepExt KM L0 rlσ rlLbls\n      [(2, 5, 2, 3, true, true), (2, 7, 2, 3, true, true), (6, 11, 3, 7, false, false)] ∧\n    SweepExt KM L0 rljσ rljLbls\n      [(2, 5, 2, 3, true, true), (2, 7, 2, 3, true, true), (6, 13, 3, 7, true, true)] ∧\n    SweepExt KM L0 trσ trLbls\n      [(2, 5, 2, 3, true, true), (2, 7, 2, 3, true, true), (5, 9, 2, 8, false, false), (6, 11, 3, 7, false, false), (7, 9, 2, 8, false, false)] ∧\n    SweepExt KM L0 trjσ trjLbls\n      [(2, 5, 2, 3, true, true), (2, 7, 2, 3, true, true), (5, 11, 2, 8, true, true), (6, 13, 3, 7, true, true), (7, 11, 2, 8, true, true)] ∧\n    SweepExt KM L0 s11σ s11Lbls\n      [(2, 7, 2, 3, true, true)] := by\n  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> decide\n\n/-- Brief, task 5, sweep, the final amended executions: the extended exclusive pairs, their frontier, the","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"d5bdff38-193b-4b31-bcdd-c1c6a3af7d54","context":{