{"parentUuid":"99a4ec3f-5358-4947-98a8-2e51923e2d56","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c6363317-3632-459e-8779-ebed992e8329","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VU74ffBMwm4t9FAXZtHqh6","type":"tool_result","content":"Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/HandoffExtSweep.lean: 132: 102\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/HandoffExtSweep.lean: 171: 105\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/HandoffExtSweep.lean: 174: 105\nBuild completed successfully (99 jobs).\n~/.elan/bin/lake build Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtSweep 2>&1  15.71s user 0.61s system 144% cpu 11.258 total\ngrep -v \"^✔\"  0.00s user 0.00s system 0% cpu 11.258 total\nhead -30  0.00s user 0.00s system 0% cpu 11.257 total","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6637ec58-bb18-4ad6-b1fa-9755747fe8c9","timestamp":"2026-11-14T08:35:33.794Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/HandoffExtSweep.lean: 132: 102\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/HandoffExtSweep.lean: 171: 105\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/HandoffExtSweep.lean: 174: 105\nBuild completed successfully (99 jobs).\n~/.elan/bin/lake build Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtSweep 2>&1  15.71s user 0.61s system 144% cpu 11.258 total\ngrep -v \"^✔\"  0.00s user 0.00s system 0% cpu 11.258 total\nhead -30  0.00s user 0.00s system 0% cpu 11.257 total","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern.lean","hunks":[{"oldStart":76,"oldLines":6,"newStart":76,"newLines":7,"lines":[" import Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtWitness"," import Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtClass"," import Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtFrontier","+import Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtSweep"," import Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.Replay"," import Ern.Concurrency.Events"," import Ern.Concurrency.EventsCompose"]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/HandoffExtSweep.lean","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":210,"lines":["+import Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtFrontier","+import Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtWitness","+import Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.Protected","+","+/-!","+# Sweep of the extended handoff on the `RunFull` traces","+","+Brief of milestone 4, slice 4, task 5, \"Balayage\" (`formal/reports/spec2-m4-handoff-ext.md`). For","+each `RunFull` trace of the repository, the witnesses of this slice included, `SweepExt` lists","+the extended exclusive pairs `(i, j, l)`, their frontier `r`, and whether strict `hb` holds from","+`r` to `j` (extended handoff order) and from `i` to `j` (no extended race). The list is complete","+(`sweepExt_complete`): every extended exclusive pair of the trace is in it. The facts of the","+corpus (`corpus-spec2-m3.md` v15 §2 quaterdecies) are the expected ones; for the other traces the","+lists are results of the model, decided by `decide`.","+-/","+","+set_option autoImplicit false","+","+namespace Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtSweep","+","+open Ern.MemoryModel Ern.MemoryModel.Access Ern.Concurrency Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal","+open Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExt","+open Ern.Concurrency.Corpus Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.HandoffEvents Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.MutexEdge","+open Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.ResetLockRight Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.ClassifyWitness","+open Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.NonRegression","+open Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal.Witness (s11σ s11Lbls)","+open Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.GuardedChainC (lcLbls)","+open Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.AbandonedGrant","+open Ern.Concurrency.Traces (L0)","+open Ern.MemoryModel.Access.Examples (K0)","+","+/-- The sweep of a trace (brief, task 5): every extended exclusive pair with `i`, `j` steps of the","+trace and `l` a place of its last state is in the list `T`; each entry `(i, j, l, r, a, b)` of `T`","+is an extended exclusive pair whose frontier is `r`, with strict `hb(r, j)` exactly when `a`","+(extended handoff order) and strict `hb(i, j)` exactly when `b` (no extended race). -/","+def SweepExt (k : K) (L : MutexLayout) (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbls : List Label)","+    (T : List (Nat × Nat × Nat × Nat × Bool × Bool)) : Prop :=","+  (∀ i ∈ List.range lbls.length, ∀ j ∈ List.range lbls.length,","+    ∀ l ∈ List.range (σ lbls.length).1.P.length,","+      ExtPair k L σ lbls i j l → (i, j, l) ∈ T.map fun e => (e.1, e.2.1, e.2.2.1)) ∧","+  ∀ e ∈ T, ExtPair k L σ lbls e.1 e.2.1 e.2.2.1 ∧","+    IsFrontier k σ lbls e.1 e.2.1 e.2.2.1 e.2.2.2.1 ∧","+    (HBS σ L lbls (.step e.2.2.2.1) (.step e.2.1) ↔ e.2.2.2.2.1 = true) ∧","+    (HBS σ L lbls (.step e.1) (.step e.2.1) ↔ e.2.2.2.2.2 = true)","+","+/-- Decidability of `SweepExt`. -/","+instance (k : K) [DecidablePred k.SharedMutable] (L : MutexLayout)","+    (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbls : List Label)","+    (T : List (Nat × Nat × Nat × Nat × Bool × Bool)) : Decidable (SweepExt k L σ lbls T) := by","+  unfold SweepExt; infer_instance","+","+/-- On a `RunFull` from the initial state, the list of `SweepExt` is complete: every extended","+exclusive pair is in it, its leaf being a place of the last state (`touch_lt_run`,","+`len_mono_run`). -/","+theorem sweepExt_complete {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {statics : Statics}","+    {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg} {lbls : List Label} (hdd : DDSound k)","+    (hstat : StaticsOK statics) (h0 : σ 0 = (SC.ofS3 (S3.init statics), [], []))","+    (h : RunFull k L σ lbls) {T : List (Nat × Nat × Nat × Nat × Bool × Bool)}","+    (hs : SweepExt k L σ lbls T) {i j l : Nat} (hp : ExtPair k L σ lbls i j l) :","+    (i, j, l) ∈ T.map fun e => (e.1, e.2.1, e.2.2.1) := by","+  obtain ⟨hij, hj, -, -, htj, -⟩ := hp.out","+  have hl := Nat.lt_of_lt_of_le (touch_lt_run hdd hstat h0 h hj htj)","+    (len_mono_run hdd hstat h0 h (Nat.succ_le_of_lt hj) (Nat.le_refl _))","+  exact hs.1 i (List.mem_range.2 (Nat.lt_trans hij hj)) j (List.mem_range.2 hj) l","+    (List.mem_range.2 hl) hp","+","+/-- Brief, task 5, sweep, on the traces of the event pass and of the mutex edge: the extended","+exclusive pairs, their frontier, the strict `hb` from the frontier and from the first member","+(`SweepExt`). -/","+theorem sweep_ext_1 :","+    SweepExt KF L0 hoσ hoLbls","+      [(2, 4, 1, 3, false, false), (2, 4, 2, 3, false, false)] ∧","+    SweepExt KF L0 ho2σ ho2Lbls","+      [(3, 5, 0, 4, false, false)] ∧","+    SweepExt KF L0 ho3σ ho3Lbls","+      [(4, 9, 0, 5, false, false)] ∧","+    SweepExt KF L0 hojσ hojLbls","+      [(2, 6, 1, 3, true, true), (2, 6, 2, 3, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt KF L0 ho3jσ ho3jLbls","+      [(4, 11, 0, 5, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 lcσ lcLbls","+      [(4, 7, 2, 5, true, true), (4, 9, 2, 5, true, true), (8, 11, 4, 9, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 rl0σ rl0Lbls","+      [(2, 5, 2, 3, true, true), (2, 7, 2, 3, true, true), (6, 10, 3, 7, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 rlσ rlLbls","+      [(2, 5, 2, 3, true, true), (2, 7, 2, 3, true, true), (6, 11, 3, 7, false, false)] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 rljσ rljLbls","+      [(2, 5, 2, 3, true, true), (2, 7, 2, 3, true, true), (6, 13, 3, 7, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 trσ trLbls","+      [(2, 5, 2, 3, true, true), (2, 7, 2, 3, true, true), (5, 9, 2, 8, false, false),","+       (6, 11, 3, 7, false, false), (7, 9, 2, 8, false, false)] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 trjσ trjLbls","+      [(2, 5, 2, 3, true, true), (2, 7, 2, 3, true, true), (5, 11, 2, 8, true, true),","+       (6, 13, 3, 7, true, true), (7, 11, 2, 8, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 s11σ s11Lbls","+      [(2, 7, 2, 3, true, true)] := by","+  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> decide","+","+/-- Brief, task 5, sweep, on the final amended executions: the extended exclusive pairs, their","+frontier, the strict `hb` from the frontier and from the first member (`SweepExt`). -/","+theorem sweep_ext_2 :","+    SweepExt KM L0 cvσ cvLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 ceσ ceLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 crσ crLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 gsTwinσ gsTwinLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KA L0 s3σ s3Lbls","+      [(5, 8, 2, 6, true, true), (7, 9, 8, 7, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 s10σ s10Lbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 AmendWitness.tsσ AmendWitness.tsLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KA L0 AmendWitness.tiσ AmendWitness.tiLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 AmendWitness.taσ AmendWitness.taLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 AmendWitness.tdtσ AmendWitness.tdtLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 FinalWitness.amσ FinalWitness.amLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 AmendWitness.tdσ AmendWitness.tdLbls","+      [] := by","+  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> decide","+","+/-- Brief, task 5, sweep, on the witnesses of slice 3 and the first replayed traces: the extended","+exclusive pairs, their frontier, the strict `hb` from the frontier and from the first member","+(`SweepExt`). -/","+theorem sweep_ext_3 :","+    SweepExt FullEncap.NonRegression.KL L0 FullEncap.NonRegression.lvσ FullEncap.NonRegression.lvLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 Witness.gtσ Witness.gtLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt Witness.KX L0 Witness.rxbσ Witness.rxbLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt CapacityWitness.KF4 L0 CapacityWitness.frσ CapacityWitness.frLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt CapacityWitness.KE3 L0 CapacityWitness.exσ CapacityWitness.exLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt CapacityWitness.KE3 L0 CapacityWitness.tmσ CapacityWitness.tmLbls","+      [(0, 2, 2, 0, true, true), (0, 3, 3, 0, true, true), (0, 4, 3, 0, true, true),","+       (0, 5, 2, 0, true, true), (0, 5, 3, 0, true, true), (0, 5, 4, 0, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 agσ agLbls","+      [(9, 13, 3, 10, false, false)] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 ajσ ajLbls","+      [(9, 15, 3, 10, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 apσ apLbls","+      [(9, 13, 3, 11, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 Replay.wrσ Replay.wrLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 Replay.cgσ Replay.cgLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KA L0 Replay.s3fσ Replay.s3fLbls","+      [(5, 8, 2, 6, true, true), (5, 10, 2, 6, true, true), (7, 9, 8, 7, true, true)] := by","+  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> decide","+","+/-- Brief, task 5, sweep, on the replayed traces and the trace of the refutation of slice 3: the","+extended exclusive pairs, their frontier, the strict `hb` from the frontier and from the first","+member (`SweepExt`). -/","+theorem sweep_ext_4 :","+    SweepExt K0 L0 Replay.s4σ Replay.s4Lbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt K9 L0 Replay.s9σ Replay.s9Lbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt K0 L0 Replay.mtσ Replay.mtLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt K0 L0 Replay.dtσ Replay.dtLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt K0 L0 Replay.tAσ [.kernel 0 (.derive 1 [3] .modify), .kernel 0 (.store 4 1), .newMutex 0 4,","+      .kernel 0 (.transfer 0 4)]","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt K0 L0 Replay.tBσ [.kernel 0 (.derive 1 [3] .modify), .kernel 0 (.store 4 1), .newMutex 0 4,","+      .acquire 0 0, .kernel 0 (.transfer 0 4)]","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt K0 L0 Replay.kmσ Replay.kmLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt K0 L0 Replay.ksσ Replay.ksLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KW L0 Replay.tbσ Replay.tbLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt K0 L0 Replay.saσ Replay.saLbls","+      [] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 Protected.abσ Protected.abLbls","+      [] := by","+  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> decide","+","+/-- Brief, task 5, sweep, on the witnesses of this slice: the extended exclusive pairs, their","+frontier, the strict `hb` from the frontier and from the first member (`SweepExt`). -/","+theorem sweep_ext_5 :","+    SweepExt KF L0 HandoffExtWitness.htσ HandoffExtWitness.htLbls","+      [(2, 4, 0, 3, false, false)] ∧","+    SweepExt KF L0 HandoffExtWitness.htjσ HandoffExtWitness.htjLbls","+      [(2, 6, 0, 3, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt KF L0 HandoffExtWitness.hsσ HandoffExtWitness.hsLbls","+      [(3, 5, 0, 4, false, false)] ∧","+    SweepExt KF L0 HandoffExtWitness.hsjσ HandoffExtWitness.hsjLbls","+      [(3, 7, 0, 4, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt KF L0 HandoffExtWitness.hxσ HandoffExtWitness.hxLbls","+      [(0, 4, 0, 3, true, true), (1, 4, 0, 3, true, true), (4, 6, 0, 5, false, false)] ∧","+    SweepExt KF L0 HandoffExtWitness.hxjσ HandoffExtWitness.hxjLbls","+      [(0, 4, 0, 3, true, true), (1, 4, 0, 3, true, true), (4, 8, 0, 5, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt K0 L0 HandoffExtWitness.svσ HandoffExtWitness.svLbls","+      [(4, 5, 4, 4, true, true)] ∧","+    SweepExt KM L0 HandoffExtWitness.crjσ HandoffExtWitness.crjLbls","+      [] := by","+  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> decide","+","+end Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtSweep"]}],"created":true}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern.lean","/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/HandoffExtSweep.lean"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5b12c102-b0f8-4aae-afeb-6aa883c445eb","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"99a4ec3f-5358-4947-98a8-2e51923e2d56","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a