ncy/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-221-`Arena.ResetD`): the derived authority is `|A|`, held by the current frame. -/\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Capacity.lean:64:theorem cap5_of_hasRight5 {s : SC} {reg : SyncReg} {c q l : Nat} {m : Mode} (hne : s.stk c ≠ [])","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"95cd5dc0-0b69-4c13-b158-688e6e37bf66","timestamp":"2026-11-14T08:36:23.780Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Ern/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean:455:theorem issueStepC_ok {k : K} {s : SC} {ar : ArenaReg} {c i : Nat} {region : List Nat}\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-456-    {dst : Nat} {st' : SC × ArenaReg} (h : IssueStepC k s ar c i region dst (.ok st')) :\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-457-    ∃ E s₁, ar[i]? = some E ∧ Arena.IssueStatic (s.view c) E region dst ∧\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-458-      Arena.Avail E region ∧ opStepC k (.split E.internal [region]) c s (.ok s₁) ∧\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-459-      opStepC k (.store s.A.length dst) c s₁ (.ok st'.1) ∧\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-460-      st'.2 = ar.set i (Arena.issueMeta s.flat E region) := by\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-461-  cases h with\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-462-  | ok hE hst hav hsp hsto => exact ⟨_, _, hE, hst, hav, hsp, hsto, rfl⟩\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-463-\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-464-/-- An `ok` outcome of `reset` executed by `c` (Spec 1 §78, Part XIV): `derive` of `internal` at\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-465-`Modify` over the storage then `release` of the derived authority, both executed by `c` (WC4 C2),\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-466-the check of §78.3 holding, then the metadata update. -/\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-467-theorem resetStepC_ok {k : K} {s : SC} {ar : ArenaReg} {c i : Nat} {st' : SC × ArenaReg}\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean:217:def issueMid (s : SC) (c : Nat) (E : Arena.ArenaEntry) (region : List Nat) : SC :=\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-218-  s.set (splitEff (s.view c) E.internal [region])\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-219-\nErn/Concurrency