\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-157-transfer phase of the by-value `spawn` (WC5.2 C5 item 4): some authority grounding the `Modify`\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-158-right over the source by a guard-free chain, and every active derived authority held outside the\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-159-source covering a source leaf is on its origin chain. -/\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-160-def OutsideG (st : SC × SyncReg) (c src : Nat) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-161-  ∃ g ∈ List.range st.1.A.length, GroundsG st c .modify src g ∧\n--\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean:222:def resetMid (s : SC) (c : Nat) (E : Arena.ArenaEntry) : SC :=\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-223-  s.set (deriveEff (s.view c) E.internal (footprint s.P E.storage) .modify)\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-224-\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-225-/-- The original right premises of the source-access clause of `transfer` (Spec 1 §63.4). -/\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-226-def Outside (s : SC) (c src : Nat) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-227-  ∃ g ∈ List.range (s.view c).A.length, Grounds (s.view c) .modify src g ∧\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-228-    ∀ j ∈ List.range (s.view c).A.length, ActiveDerivedOutside (s.view c) src j →\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-229-      RightChain (s.view c) g j\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-230-\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-231-/-- The original right premises of the transfer phases of the by-value `spawn` (WC5.2 C5.2;\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-232-`ValTransferPre.srcRight`, `.noOutsideDerived`). -/\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-233-def ValRights (c : Nat) : SC → List (Nat × Nat) → Prop\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Inventory.lean-234-  | _, [] => True","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"bfac6d81-0aba-4580-b9ed-d2078eb41c00","timestamp":"2026-11-14T08:39:47.494Z","tool