rn/MemoryModel/Arena.lean-143-`decide` evaluates it on the concrete states of the witnesses below; `KInvB.sound` derives\nErn/MemoryModel/Arena.lean-144-`KInv ∧ KAux`. `WF3` (§49) and `I1` (§50), which §76.6 asks of the resulting state of `newArena`,\nErn/MemoryModel/Arena.lean-145-are decidable through their bounded forms (`wf3_iff_kb`, `i1_iff_kb`). -/\nErn/MemoryModel/Arena.lean-146-\nErn/MemoryModel/Arena.lean-147-/-- A leaf of the footprint of `q` makes `q` an existing place (§40). -/\nErn/Concurrency/Reachable.lean:62:def LibInv (L : MutexLayout) (st : SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/Reachable.lean-63-  SyncState L st.1 st.2.1 ∧ AdminSep st.1 st.2.1 st.2.2 ∧ ArenaInvC st.1 st.2.2\nErn/Concurrency/Reachable.lean-64-\nErn/Concurrency/Reachable.lean-65-/-- With an empty arena registry, `LibInv` is `SyncState` (`AdminSep` and `ArenaInvC` range over\nErn/Concurrency/Reachable.lean-66-the entries of the arena registry). -/\nErn/Concurrency/Reachable.lean-67-theorem libInv_nil {L : MutexLayout} {s : SC} {reg : SyncReg} :\nErn/Concurrency/Reachable.lean-68-    LibInv L (s, reg, []) ↔ SyncState L s reg := by\nErn/Concurrency/Reachable.lean-69-  refine ⟨fun h => h.1, fun h => ⟨h, ?_, ?_⟩⟩\nErn/Concurrency/Reachable.lean-70-  · intro e _ E hE; cases hE\nErn/Concurrency/Reachable.lean-71-  · intro E hE; cases hE\nErn/Concurrency/Reachable.lean-72-\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean:431:def ResetStepC (s : SC) (ar : ArenaReg) (c i : Nat) (o : Outcome3 (SC × ArenaReg)) : Prop :=\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-432-  s.Live c ∧ ∃ o₃, Arena.ResetD i ⟨s.view c, ar⟩ o₃ ∧\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-433-    o = omap (fun L' => (s.set L'.kern, L'.arenas)) o₃\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-434-\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-435-/-- Writing back into `s` an `S3` whose stack is that of the view of `c`, then taking the view of\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-436-`c`, gives that `S3` back (WC4 C2). -/\nErn/Concurrency/SyncLib.lean-437-theorem SC.view_set {s : SC} {c : Nat}