{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","hash":"c58227db923184e5121a7a8556d8efc83e94d67e5c616c4e7538b8a35480d304","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The task-4 question is refuted on a RunFull trace: c1's unlock sets r = i, and c0's resetLock cuts the strict mutex edge so no HBS path joins the steps, while the twin without resetLock is ordered. Next I'll add the sweep entries for the four traces created after the sweep.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01H7REpG3B3jrM9xAHzJDYy6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && ~/.elan/bin/lake build Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtSame 2>&1 | tail -1; SP=/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6/scratchpad; cat > $SP/S4.lean <<'EOF'\nimport Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtSame\nopen Ern.MemoryModel Ern.MemoryModel.Access Ern.Concurrency Ern.Concurrency.MutexReal\nopen Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExt Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap Ern.Concurrency.Corpus\nopen Ern.Concurrency.Traces (L0)\nopen Ern.MemoryModel.Access.Examples (K0)\nopen Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtSame\n\ndef tableOf (k : K) [DecidablePred k.SharedMutable] (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbls : List Label) : String :=\n  let n := lbls.length\n  let B := (σ n).1.P.length\n  let es := (List.range n).flatMap fun i => (List.range n).flatMap fun j => ((List.range B).filter fun l =>\n    decide (ExtPair k L0 σ lbls i j l)).map fun l =>\n      let r := ((List.range n).find? (fun r => decide (IsFrontier k σ lbls i j l r))).getD 999\n      (i, j, l, r, decide (HBS σ L0 lbls (.step r) (.step j)), decide (HBS σ L0 lbls (.step i) (.step j)))\n  toString (es.map fun (i, j, l, r, a, b) => s!\"({i}, {j}, {l}, {r}, {a}, {b})\")\n\n#eval s!\"vn {tableOf K0 vnσ vnLbls}\"\n#eval s!\"hq {tableOf KM hqσ hqLbls}\"\n#eval s!\"ul {tableOf KM ulσ ulLbls}\"\n#eval s!\"ulj {tableOf KM uljσ uljLbls}\"\nEOF\n~/.elan/bin/lake env lean $SP/S4.lean 2>&1 | head","description":"Compute sweep tables for the four new traces","timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
