{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","hash":"5ead16896c7909eb53eff3a1375ac36f4e71a66b65dab8036784f7b0fe93e440","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Adding `sweep_ext_6` for those four traces and the O7.2 conjunct to `W_HX_neg`."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FkE6rzMaVH4gkLQHZMoNbp","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/HandoffExtSame.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\ntail='end Ern.Concurrency.FullEncap.HandoffExtSame\\n'\nadd=r'''/-- Brief, task 5, sweep, on the `RunFull` traces of this module (`SweepExt`): the\n`(spawnVal, N)` witness, the prefix of the suggested construction, and the `(unlock, E)` trace\nwith its twin. -/\ntheorem sweep_ext_6 :\n    HandoffExtSweep.SweepExt K0 L0 vnσ vnLbls [(4, 5, 5, 4, true, true)] ∧\n    HandoffExtSweep.SweepExt KM L0 hqσ hqLbls [(2, 8, 2, 3, true, true)] ∧\n    HandoffExtSweep.SweepExt KM L0 ulσ ulLbls\n      [(2, 5, 2, 3, true, true), (2, 7, 2, 3, true, true), (5, 12, 2, 7, false, false),\n       (7, 12, 2, 7, false, false)] ∧\n    HandoffExtSweep.SweepExt KM L0 uljσ uljLbls\n      [(2, 5, 2, 3, true, true), (2, 7, 2, 3, true, true), (5, 11, 2, 7, true, true),\n       (7, 11, 2, 7, true, true)] := by\n  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> decide\n\n'''\ns=s[:-len(tail)]+add+tail\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/HandoffExtWitness.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\nold='''/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` v15 §2 quaterdecies W-HX, negative: step 3 before step 2 is `reject`\n(O7.2: an active authority is attached to the dying local `X`; this is S1a). -/\ntheorem W_HX_neg : opStepC KF .exit 0 hx5 .reject := ⟨by decide, .reject (by decide)⟩'''\nnew='''/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` v15 §2 quaterdecies W-HX, negative: step 3 before step 2 is `reject`\n(O7.2: an active authority is attached to the dying local `X`, as in S1a; the surviving `a` has no\nsurviving origin, §73.4). -/\ntheorem W_HX_neg : opStepC KF .exit 0 hx5 .reject ∧\n    firstSurv (hx5.view 0) (hx5.view 0).F.tail ((hx5.view 0).ancs 1) = none :=\n  ⟨⟨by decide, .reject (by decide)⟩, by decide⟩'''\nassert old in s\ns=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\n~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -v \"^✔\" | tail -3; for f in HandoffExtWitness HandoffExtSame; do ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/$f.lean 2>&1 | head -5; done","description":"Add sweep_ext_6 and W-HX clause, full build","timeout":1800000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
