e":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
{"parentUuid":"ad7461c2-22fa-4e02-839c-20228ab22e9a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"0dd0571a-6379-45f8-954f-cbdecd0ea155","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MoM77VdCBgRSWHRKP95f8f","type":"tool_result","content":"11:current frame by a holder chain that contains no live `guarded` (`Exer5`). It is a proposition of\n24:inductive Exer5 (s : SC) (reg : SyncReg) (c : Nat) : Nat → Mode → Prop where\n26:      y.active = true → m.le y.mode → y.holder = .frame (s.view c).top → Exer5 s reg c a m\n28:      y.active = true → m.le y.mode → y.holder = .place p → Exer5 s reg c b m →\n29:      (∀ l ∈ footprint s.P p, Allows (effective s.flat b l) m) → Exer5 s reg c a m\n31:/-- One step of `Exer5 · m` read on a Boolean premise (decision procedure, on the pattern of `exR`,\n33:def exer5R (s : SC) (reg : SyncReg) (c : Nat) (m : Mode) (E : Nat → Bool) (a : Nat) : Bool :=\n71:/-- Soundness of the iteration for `Exer5`. -/\n73:    ∀ k a, kiter (exer5R s reg c m) k a = true → Exer5 s reg c a m\n107:/-- `Exer5` is computed by `|A| + 1` steps of `exer5R`. -/\n109:    Exer5 s reg c a m ↔ kiter (exer5R s reg c m) (s.A.length + 1) a = true := by\n117:/-- Decidability of `Exer5`. -/\n118:instance (s : SC) (reg : SyncReg) (c a : Nat) (m : Mode) : Decidable (Exer5 s reg c a m) :=\n123:theorem Exer5.attr5 {s : SC} {reg : SyncReg} {c a : Nat} {m : Mode} (hne : s.stk c ≠ [])\n124:    (h : Exer5 s reg c a m) : Attr5 s reg c a m := by\n129:/-- The argument of an `Exer5` is not a live `guarded`. -/\n130:theorem Exer5.notGuarded {s : SC} {reg : SyncReg} {c a : Nat} {m : Mode} (h : Exer5 s reg c a m) :\n141:frame of the executing context by a holder chain without a live `guarded` (`Exer5`). -/\n142:def ChainExcl (st : SC × SyncReg) : Label → Prop\n143:  | .kernel c (.derive a _ m) => Exer5 st.1 st.2 c a m\n144:  | .kernel c (.split a _) => Exer5 st.1 st.2 c a .modify\n145:  | .kernel c (.read a _) => Exer5 st.1 st.2 c a .observe\n146:  | .kernel c (.write a _) => Exer5 st.1 st.2 c a .modify\n147:  | .kernel c (.writeShared a _) => Exer5 st.1 st.2 c a .observe\n155:def Encap5C (L : MutexLayout) (st : SC × SyncReg) (lbl : Label) : Prop :=\n158:/-- `ChainExcl` implies `GuardedExcl`: the argument of an `Exer5` is not a live `guarded`. -/\n195:def Run5C (k : K) (L : MutexLayout) (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbls : List Label) :\n214:def Cap5SoundC (k : K) (L : MutexLayout) : Prop :=\n227:def HandoffLossExistsC (k : K) (L : MutexLayout) : Prop :=\n267:    exact cap5_of (Exer5.attr5 hne hx) (allows_observe (hp.effectivePresent l hl'))","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8793fbd0-ab07-44cf-8672-292fd55ca36b","timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:22:57.478Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"11:current frame by a holder chain that contains no live `guarded` (`Exer5`). It is a proposition of\n24:inductive Exer5 (s : SC) (reg : SyncReg) (c : Nat) : Nat → Mode → Prop where\n26:      y.active = true → m.le y.mode → y.holder = .frame (s.view c).top → Exer5 s reg c a m\n28:      y.active = true → m.le y.mode → y.holder = .place p → Exer5 s reg c b m →\n29:      (∀ l ∈ footprint s.P p, Allows (effective s.flat b l) m) → Exer5 s reg c a m\n31:/-- One step of `Exer5 · m` read on a Boolean premise (decision procedure, on the pattern of `exR`,\n33:def exer5R (s : SC) (reg : SyncReg) (c : Nat) (m : Mode) (E : Nat → Bool) (a : Nat) : Bool :=\n71:/-- Soundness of the iteration for `Exer5`. -/\n73:    ∀ k a, kiter (exer5R s reg c m) k a = true → Exer5 s reg c a m\n107:/-- `Exer5` is computed by `|A| + 1` steps of `exer5R`. -/\n109:    Exer5 s reg c a m ↔ kiter (exer5R s reg c m) (s.A.length + 1) a = true := by\n117:/-- Decidability of `Exer5`. -/\n118:instance (s : SC) (reg : SyncReg) (c a : Nat) (m : Mode) : Decidable (Exer5 s reg c a m) :=\n123:theorem Exer5.attr5 {s : SC} {reg : SyncReg} {c a : Nat} {m : Mode} (hne : s.stk c ≠ [])\n124:    (h : Exer5 s reg c a m) : Attr5 s reg c a m := by\n129:/-- The argument of an `Exer5` is not a live `guarded`. -/\n130:theorem Exer5.notGuarded {s : SC} {reg : SyncReg} {c a : Nat} {m : Mode} (h : Exer5 s reg c a m) :\n141:frame of the executing context by a holder chain without a live `guarded` (`Exer5`). -/\n142:def ChainExcl (st : SC × SyncReg) : Label → Prop\n143:  | .kernel c (.derive a _ m) => Exer5 st.1 st.2 c a m\n144:  | .kernel c (.split a _) => Exer5 st.1 st.2 c a .modify\n145:  | .kernel c (.read a _) => Exer5 st.1 st.2 c a .observe\n146:  | .kernel c (.write a _) => Exer5 st.1 st.2 c a .modify\n147:  | .kernel c (.writeShared a _) => Exer5 st.1 st.2 c a .observe\n155:def Encap5C (L : MutexLayout) (st : SC × SyncReg) (lbl : Label) : Prop :=\n158:/-- `ChainExcl` implies `GuardedExcl`: the argument of an `Exer5` is not a live `guarded`. -/\n195:def Run5C (k : K) (L : MutexLayout) (σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg) (lbls : List Label) :\n214:def Cap5SoundC (k : K) (L : MutexLayout) : Prop :=\n227:def HandoffLossExistsC (k : K) (L : MutexLayout) : Prop :=\n267:    exact cap5_of (Exer5.attr5 hne hx) (allows_observe (hp.effectivePresent l hl'))","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"7a882f38-b021-4643-b087-7762dd7b26c4","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ad7461c2-22fa-4e02-839c-20228ab22e9a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source