n/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
{"parentUuid":"49520d1c-7b8e-4f77-abff-6bcc11db86a9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"0dd0571a-6379-45f8-954f-cbdecd0ea155","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016juwKSd7mkKs4NLmh1uzGJ","type":"tool_result","content":"import Ern.Concurrency.CapDrop\n\n/-!\n# Test of a corrected `GuardedExcl`\n\n`GuardedExcl` (brief of milestone 4, task 3) excludes the steps whose authority argument is a live\n`guarded`; the third clause of Spec 1 §43 is recursive along the holder chain, and an authority\nstored in the protected storage is exercisable through `guarded` (`Corpus/GuardedChain.lean`).\nThis module tests the correction proposed in `formal/reports/spec2-m4-handoff.md`: the authority\nargument of `derive`, `split`, `read`, `write` and `writeShared` must be exercisable from the\ncurrent frame by a holder chain that contains no live `guarded` (`Exer5`). It is a proposition of\nthe report, absent from WC5 and from the brief, tested here and not decided. Beside it, the\ndefinitions of the brief (`GuardedExcl`, `Encap5`, `EncapsulatedTrace5`) are unchanged.\n-/\n\nnamespace Ern.Concurrency\n\nopen Ern.MemoryModel.Access\n\n/-! ## Exercise without a live `guarded` -/\n\n/-- `ExercisableAt` (Spec 1 §43) read from the current frame of `c`, by a holder chain none of whose\nauthorities is the `guarded` of a live entry of `reg` (WC4 C12). -/\ninductive Exer5 (s : SC) (reg : SyncReg) (c : Nat) : Nat → Mode → Prop where\n  | base {a : Nat} {m : Mode} {y : Authority} : NotGuarded s reg a → s.A[a]? = some y →\n      y.active = true → m.le y.mode → y.holder = .frame (s.view c).top → Exer5 s reg c a m\n  | held {a p b : Nat} {m : Mode} {y : Authority} : NotGuarded s reg a → s.A[a]? = some y →\n      y.active = true → m.le y.mode → y.holder = .place p → Exer5 s reg c b m →\n      (∀ l ∈ footprint s.P p, Allows (effective s.flat b l) m) → Exer5 s reg c a m\n\n/-- One step of `Exer5 · m` read on a Boolean premise (decision procedure, on the pattern of `exR`,\nSpec 1 §43). -/\ndef exer5R (s : SC) (reg : SyncReg) (c : Nat) (m : Mode) (E : Nat → Bool) (a : Nat) : Bool :=\n  decide (NotGuarded s reg a) && match s.A[a]? with\n  | some y => y.active && decide (m.le y.mode) && match y.holder with","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"066f2cde-e47b-4c50-86ee-7224c2e0f470","timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:22:59.811Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"import Ern.Concurrency.CapDrop\n\n/-!\n# Test of a corrected `GuardedExcl`\n\n`GuardedExcl` (brief of milestone 4, task 3) excludes the steps whose authority argument is a live\n`guarded`; the third clause of Spec 1 §43 is recursive along the holder chain, and an authority\nstored in the protected storage is exercisable through `guarded` (`Corpus/GuardedChain.lean`).\nThis module tests the correction proposed in `formal/reports/spec2-m4-handoff.md`: the authority\nargument of `derive`, `split`, `read`, `write` and `writeShared` must be exercisable from the\ncurrent frame by a holder chain that contains no live `guarded` (`Exer5`). It is a proposition of\nthe report, absent from WC5 and from the brief, tested here and not decided. Beside it, the\ndefinitions of the brief (`GuardedExcl`, `Encap5`, `EncapsulatedTrace5`) are unchanged.\n-/\n\nnamespace Ern.Concurrency\n\nopen Ern.MemoryModel.Access\n\n/-! ## Exercise without a live `guarded` -/\n\n/-- `ExercisableAt` (Spec 1 §43) read from the current frame of `c`, by a holder chain none of whose\nauthorities is the `guarded` of a live entry of `reg` (WC4 C12). -/\ninductive Exer5 (s : SC) (reg : SyncReg) (c : Nat) : Nat → Mode → Prop where\n  | base {a : Nat} {m : Mode} {y : Authority} : NotGuarded s reg a → s.A[a]? = some y →\n      y.active = true → m.le y.mode → y.holder = .frame (s.view c).top → Exer5 s reg c a m\n  | held {a p b : Nat} {m : Mode} {y : Authority} : NotGuarded s reg a → s.A[a]? = some y →\n      y.active = true → m.le y.mode → y.holder = .place p → Exer5 s reg c b m →\n      (∀ l ∈ footprint s.P p, Allows (effective s.flat b l) m) → Exer5 s reg c a m\n\n/-- One step of `Exer5 · m` read on a Boolean premise (decision procedure, on the pattern of `exR`,\nSpec 1 §43). -/\ndef exer5R (s : SC) (reg : SyncReg) (c : Nat) (m : Mode) (E : Nat → Bool) (a : Nat) : Bool :=\n  decide (NotGuarded s reg a) && match s.A[a]? with\n  | some y => y.active && decide (m.le y.mode) && match y.holder with","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"fa915b95-1d9e-4be2-b71d-bc679404d30b","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/spec2-m4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"49520d1c-7b8e-4f77-abff-6bcc11db86a9","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"e6419d94-65c2-4a67-8a07-67ae7e574ad6","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"formal/spec2-m4","slug":"replicated-napping-garden"}
