{"parentUuid":"b907fb65-d704-4e6f-bea0-30c621bf73a0","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"0dd0571a-6379-45f8-954f-cbdecd0ea155","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G9aFqBHcvf7gtzRP3G1XKd","type":"tool_result","content":"Ern/Concurrency/FullEncap/Replay.lean:37:theorem RunFull.take {k : K} {L : MutexLayout} {σ : Nat → SC × SyncReg × ArenaReg}\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Replay.lean:38:    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunFull k L σ lbls) (n : Nat) : RunFull k L σ (lbls.take n) :=\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Replay.lean:175:    RunFull KM L0 MutexEdge.rl0σ (MutexEdge.rl0Lbls.take 8) :=\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Replay.lean:176:  ⟨rfl, RunFull.take NonRegression.runAmF_traces_full.2.2.2.2.2.2.1 8⟩\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Replay.lean:182:  RunFull.take NonRegression.runAmF_traces_full.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.1 7\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/Replay.lean:348:    RunFull.take rA 3⟩\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/DyingCap.lean:44:    {lbls : List Label} (h : RunFull k L σ lbls) (n : Nat) : Run5R k L σ (lbls.take n) :=\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/HandoffExtWitness.lean:427:theorem W_NM_run : RunFull KM L0 rl0σ (rl0Lbls.take 6) :=\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/HandoffExtWitness.lean:428:  Replay.RunFull.take NonRegression.runAmF_traces_full.2.2.2.2.2.2.1 6\nErn/Concurrency/FullEncap/HandoffExtWitness.lean:487:theorem W_CR_excluded : RunFull KM L0 rl0σ (rl0Lbls.take 3) ∧ rl0σ 3 = (x2, regX, []) ∧\n  decide\n\n/-! ## W-NM -/\n\nopen Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.MutexEdge (rl0σ rl0Lbls) in\n/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` v15 §2 quaterdecies W-NM: the steps 1 to 4 of block MX (`MX₄`), then\n`c1 : acquire(e)`, form a `RunFull` from the initial state (a prefix of W-RL₀). -/\ntheorem W_NM_run : RunFull KM L0 rl0σ (rl0Lbls.take 6) :=\n  Replay.RunFull.take NonRegression.runAmF_traces_full.2.2.2.2.2.2.1 6\n\nopen Ern.Concurrency.Corpus.MutexEdge (rl0σ rl0Lbls) in\n/-- `corpus-spec2-m3.md` v15 §2 quaterdecies W-NM, the three facts: `(newMutex, acquire, lock)`\n(indice